translate french c31s004_flight2_58af43b9:

    # mc "You've grown as a person. As a woman."
    mc "Tu as grandi en tant que personne. En tant que femme."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2933
translate french c31s004_flight2_2fa12777:

    # mc "You've even gotten married."
    mc "Tu t'es même mariée."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2935
translate french c31s004_flight2_451ea7e1:

    # ama "*Laugh* I don't know if that's a good or a bad thing."
    ama "*Rires* Je ne sais pas si c'est une bonne ou une mauvaise chose."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2936
translate french c31s004_flight2_96825b34:

    # mc "Hey!"
    mc "Hé !"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2938
translate french c31s004_flight2_ac50cdcf:

    # bet "*Laugh* We don't know what your taste in men was like before, so we can't know if you've evolved for better or worse."
    bet "*Rires* On ne sait pas quels étaient tes goûts en matière d'hommes avant, donc on ne peut pas savoir si tu as évolué en bien ou en mal."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2939
translate french c31s004_flight2_85e7ec37:

    # mc "Hey! I'm right here. You know that, right?"
    mc "Hé ! Je suis juste là. Vous le savez, hein ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2941
translate french c31s004_flight2_9fbf1aa0:

    # bet "I mean, if she used to like Jason Moanoa and ended up marrying you..."
    bet "Je veux dire, si elle aimait Jason Moanoa avant et qu'elle a fini par t'épouser..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2942
translate french c31s004_flight2_ffee94dd:

    # mc "*Laugh* If you take away Jason's fame, money, hair, beard, and muscles... What does he have that I don't?"
    mc "*Rires* Si on enlève la célébrité, l'argent, les cheveux, la barbe et les muscles de Jason... Qu'est-ce qu'il a que je n'ai pas ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2944
translate french c31s004_flight2_66ef0658:

    # bet "*Laugh* Nothing, nothing..." (multiple=2)
    bet "*Rires* Rien, rien..." (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2945
translate french c31s004_flight2_79b7f536:

    # ama "*Laugh* Acting talent?" (multiple=2)
    ama "*Rires* Un talent d'acteur ?" (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2946
translate french c31s004_flight2_3267f1ce:

    # mc "Stop this plane, I want to get off!"
    mc "Arrêtez cet avion, je veux descendre !"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2948
translate french c31s004_flight2_e1ac6040:

    # bet "But seriously..."
    bet "Mais sérieusement..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2949
translate french c31s004_flight2_3ba4b337:

    # bet "What [mc] wanted to say, even though he likes to beat around the bush, is that you're not the same person we met three weeks ago."
    bet "Ce que [mc] voulait dire, même s'il aime tourner autour du pot, c'est que tu n'es plus la même personne qu'on a rencontrée il y a trois semaines."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2952
translate french c31s004_flight2_e0f4645a:

    # bet "What [mc] means to say, even though he likes to beat around the bush, is that you're not the same person we met three weeks ago."
    bet "Ce que [mc] veut dire, même s'il aime tourner autour du pot, c'est que tu n'es plus la même personne qu'on a rencontrée il y a trois semaines."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2953
translate french c31s004_flight2_b36be703:

    # bet "It's no longer just you and [eva] against the world. Now you have us too."
    bet "Ce n'est plus juste toi et [eva] contre le reste du monde. Maintenant, tu nous as aussi."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2954
translate french c31s004_flight2_0ebf2174:

    # bet "Nobody messes with a Marks without 23 people jumping at their throat."
    bet "Personne ne s'en prend à une Marks sans que 23 personnes ne lui sautent à la gorge."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2955
translate french c31s004_flight2_b547ee30:

    # mc "And if not, we can always send Jamaal to run them over. Even though he can't jump too high."
    mc "Et sinon, on peut toujours envoyer Jamaal pour leur rouler dessus. Même s'il ne peut pas sauter très haut."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2957
translate french c31s004_flight2_736d580a:

    # ama "I couldn't do this without you guys. Thank you..."
    ama "Je n'aurais pas pu faire ça sans vous. Merci..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2959
translate french c31s004_flight2_520e658b:

    # ama "And about running someone over... *Giggles* I think when you meet a certain [dam], a D-series clone, you'll feel like doing it."
    ama "Et pour ce qui est de rouler sur quelqu'un... *Glousse* Je pense que quand vous rencontrerez un certain [dam], un clone de série D, vous en aurez envie."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2960
translate french c31s004_flight2_8c86aede:

    # alb "*PA system* We will be landing in a few minutes. Please remember to fasten your seatbelts."
    alb "*Haut-parleur* Nous atterrirons dans quelques minutes. N'oubliez pas d'attacher vos ceintures."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2961
translate french c31s004_flight2_1f8baac2:

    # mc "Well, I think the real trip starts now. It's nothing we can't do together."
    mc "Eh bien, je pense que le vrai voyage commence maintenant. Il n'y a rien qu'on ne puisse faire ensemble."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2962
translate french c31s004_flight2_9584d0e2:

    # mc "And if we have to run over this [dam] guy, we'll run him over."
    mc "Et si on doit rouler sur ce [dam], on lui roulera dessus."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2969
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_62c3affa:

    # "Once the plane lands, it goes straight to what looks like a military hangar."
    "Une fois l'avion posé, il se dirige tout droit vers ce qui ressemble à un hangar militaire."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2970
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_2ede401c:

    # "[aar] is waiting for you with a car inside the hangar."
    "[aar] vous attend avec une voiture à l'intérieur du hangar."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2974
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_41b5383b:

    # "[ama]'s face lights up when she sees him through the window."
    "Le visage de [ama] s'illumine quand elle le voit par la fenêtre."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2976
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_770cf792:

    # "And she does what you would never have expected from someone like [ama]."
    "Et elle fait ce que vous n'auriez jamais attendu de quelqu'un comme [ama]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2977
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_350aa7cb:

    # "Judging by his surprised face, [aar] would never have expected it either."
    "À en juger par son visage surpris, [aar] ne s'y attendait pas non plus."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2979
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_dcb99871:

    # ama "You didn't have to bother coming."
    ama "Tu n'avais pas besoin de te déranger pour venir."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2980
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_06c41f7f:

    # aar "It was the least I could do..."
    aar "C'était la moindre des choses..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2982
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_3a4f68fa:

    # mc "[aar], it's a pleasure to see you in person instead of through a screen."
    mc "[aar], c'est un plaisir de te voir en personne plutôt qu'à travers un écran."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2983
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_2e0531e7:

    # aar "Likewise, [mc]. I was looking forward to handing the CEO job over to you."
    aar "De même, [mc]. J'avais hâte de te céder le poste de PDG."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2985
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_ba759fc9:

    # aar "*Whispering* What have you done to [ama]?"
    aar "*Chuchotant* Qu'est-ce que tu as fait à [ama] ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2986
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_5c450db9:

    # mc "*Laugh* We taught her to express what she feels. It's a good change."
    mc "*Rire* On lui a appris à exprimer ce qu'elle ressent. C'est un bon changement."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2988
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_39c9cc94:

    # ama "Jeetje mina*! [aar] is your clone! \n* 'Mother of mine!' in Dutch."
    ama "Jeetje mina* ! [aar] est ton clone ! \n* 'Oh ma mère !' en néerlandais."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2990
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_a51b1017:

    # mc "I told you she'd figure it out the moment she saw us together."
    mc "Je t'avais dit qu'elle comprendrait à la seconde où elle nous verrait ensemble."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2991
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_238515b8:

    # aar "I had to try."
    aar "Il fallait que j'essaie."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2993
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_211c275e:

    # ama "You knew? Why didn't you tell me?"
    ama "Tu le savais ? Pourquoi tu ne me l'as pas dit ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2994
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_6e71b403:

    # mc "I promised [aar]. He told me he wanted to tell you himself."
    mc "J'ai fait une promesse à [aar]. Il m'a dit qu'il voulait te le dire lui-même."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2996
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_5d401034:

    # bet "If it was obvious over a video call, only a blind person wouldn't figure it out seeing you together."
    bet "Si c'était évident lors d'un appel vidéo, seul un aveugle ne le remarquerait pas en vous voyant ensemble."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2997
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_8f5a1fb0:

    # mc "Yeah, that's what I thought."
    mc "Ouais, c'est ce que je me suis dit."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2999
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_1e2626b7:

    # ama "You knew too? Does [eva] know too? Am I the only idiot who didn't know?"
    ama "Tu le savais aussi ? Est-ce qu'[eva] le sait aussi ? Suis-je la seule idiote à ne pas être au courant ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3000
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_aa6c3611:

    # mc "No, [ama]. [eva] doesn't know either. [aar] wanted to tell both of you in person."
    mc "Non, [ama]. [eva] ne le sait pas non plus. [aar] voulait vous le dire à toutes les deux en personne."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3002
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_eb18b069:

    # aar "I think I was a bit naive."
    aar "Je crois que j'ai été un peu naïf."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3003
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_780c2b55:

    # mc "Just a bit?"
    mc "Juste un peu ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3005
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_cc91dae0:

    # ama "Well, we knew you were someone's clone. We just didn't know whose."
    ama "Eh bien, on savait que tu étais le clone de quelqu'un. On ne savait juste pas de qui."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3006
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_28d13ec0:

    # ama "When did you find out? Why didn't you tell us anything?"
    ama "Quand l'as-tu découvert ? Pourquoi tu ne nous as rien dit ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3008
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_f3692149:

    # aar "I've known for a few months, since the Clone War started. But it wasn't the right time to say anything."
    aar "Je le sais depuis quelques mois, depuis que la Guerre des Clones a commencé. Mais ce n'était pas le bon moment pour en parler."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3009
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_95ab0870:

    # aar "I was surprised you didn't say anything the day we met [mar] and [nor], so I thought it wasn't too obvious."
    aar "J'ai été surpris que vous ne disiez rien le jour où on a rencontré [mar] et [nor], alors je me suis dit que ce n'était pas trop flagrant."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3011
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_69720dec:

    # aar "I haven't looked like you for years, and I don't think the girls remember how I looked back then."
    aar "Je ne te ressemble plus depuis des années, et je ne pense pas que les filles se souviennent de mon apparence à l'époque."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3012
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_ca38fbc7:

    # mc "I think it has more to do with how shocked they were to meet [mar] and [nor]."
    mc "Je pense que ça a plus à voir avec le choc qu'elles ont eu en rencontrant [mar] et [nor]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3013
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_fa493f58:

    # mc "I don't think they looked at us more than a couple of times."
    mc "Je ne pense pas qu'elles nous aient regardés plus de deux ou trois fois."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3015
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_74cb3c6a:

    # ama "I guess that must be it. It took me less than a minute to see it now."
    ama "Je suppose que ça doit être ça. Il m'a fallu moins d'une minute pour le voir maintenant."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3016
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_c69d3bfc:

    # mc "It's normal that you only had eyes for [mar] and [nor] that day, sweetie."
    mc "C'est normal que tu n'aies eu d'yeux que pour [mar] et [nor] ce jour-là, ma chérie."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3019
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_2a441c4a:

    # ama "*Laugh* At least I know my husband isn't going to go bald."
    ama "*Rires* Au moins, je sais que mon mari ne va pas devenir chauve."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3020
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_464ccb1b:

    # mc "*Laugh* I'm pretty happy about that too."
    mc "*Rires* J'en suis plutôt content aussi."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3021
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_7d031e06:

    # mc "Although I'd be a proud bald guy if it happened, the kind who shaves it all off. No wigs for me."
    mc "Même si je serais un fier chauve si ça arrivait, le genre à tout raser. Pas de perruques pour moi."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3023
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_0b43a49d:

    # aar "What? Husband? What's this about? Is it some kind of cover?"
    aar "Quoi ? Mari ? C'est quoi cette histoire ? C'est une sorte de couverture ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3024
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_6e4b6d37:

    # mc "I think [ama] has to explain some things to you, [aar]."
    mc "Je crois qu'[ama] a quelques trucs à t'expliquer, [aar]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3026
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_4ca237a9:

    # ama "*Laugh* At least you know you're not going to go bald."
    ama "*Rires* Au moins, tu sais que tu ne vas pas devenir chauve."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3027
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_464ccb1b_1:

    # mc "*Laugh* I'm pretty happy about that too."
    mc "*Rires* J'en suis plutôt content aussi."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3028
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_7d031e06_1:

    # mc "Although I'd be a proud bald guy if it happened, the kind who shaves it all off. No wigs for me."
    mc "Même si je serais un fier chauve si ça arrivait, le genre à tout raser. Pas de perruques pour moi."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3030
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_48f1f471:

    # bet "Can we talk about baldness and whatever else you want on the way to the base?"
    bet "On peut parler de calvitie et de tout ce que vous voulez sur le chemin de la base ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3031
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_de620dd9:

    # bet "It's late and we should get some rest before starting the day tomorrow."
    bet "Il se fait tard et on devrait se reposer avant de commencer la journée de demain."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3033
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_7a93eca1:

    # aar "You're not going to sleep at the base. I'm taking you to the CEO's House."
    aar "Vous n'allez pas dormir à la base. Je vous emmène à la maison du PDG."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3034
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_de627ecd:

    # mc "I thought the CEO's House was at the base..."
    mc "Je pensais que la maison du PDG était à la base..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3036
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_8c4b6f25:

    # aar "No. Neither Richards nor Daniels ever wanted to live at the base. The house is about fifteen kilometers away. About ten miles for you."
    aar "Non. Ni Richards ni Daniels n'ont jamais voulu vivre à la base. La maison est à environ quinze kilomètres d'ici. À peu près dix miles pour toi."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3037
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_6111ea36:

    # mc "Do you live there too? You've been acting CEO..."
    mc "Tu y vis aussi ? Tu as été PDG par intérim..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3038
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_7e28962c:

    # aar "I live at the base, with the rest of the guys. Nothing has changed regarding that."
    aar "Je vis à la base, avec le reste des gars. Rien n'a changé de ce côté-là."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3040
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_f47e96c8:

    # aar "By the way... welcome, [bet]. They didn't let me greet you."
    aar "Au fait... bienvenue, [bet]. Ils ne m'ont pas laissé te saluer."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3041
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_1297831f:

    # mc "Get your surprised face ready, [aar]."
    mc "Prépare ta tête de surpris, [aar]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3043
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_ac1abe42:

    # aar "What do you mean?"
    aar "Comment ça ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3046
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_e7633ab4:

    # bet "What's with holding out your hand? You're the clone of my great-nephew. You're family!"
    bet "C'est quoi cette main tendue ? Tu es le clone de mon petit-neveu. Tu es de la famille !"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3047
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_b15b59b5:

    # "[aar] realizes what you meant a second too late."
    "[aar] réalise ce que tu voulais dire une seconde trop tard."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3048
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_2941fcf9:

    # mc "*Laugh* I meant exactly that, [aar]."
    mc "*Rire* C'est exactement ce que je voulais dire, [aar]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3049
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_26634e50:

    # mc "And [aar] doesn't think we're family because we share genes, {b}Aunt{/b} [bet]."
    mc "Et [aar] ne pense pas qu'on soit de la famille juste parce qu'on partage des gènes, {b}Tante{/b} [bet]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3050
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_0d5b86d1:

    # "You emphasize the 'Aunt' to make it clear that you are family."
    "Vous insistez sur le mot 'Tante' pour bien faire comprendre que vous êtes de la famille."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3051
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_260cc0df:

    # bet "Nonsense!"
    bet "N'importe quoi !"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3053
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_c70c8356:

    # "It doesn't matter that you and [bet] don't share genes. You're family because you choose to be."
    "Peu importe que vous et [bet] ne partagiez pas les mêmes gènes. Vous êtes de la famille parce que vous l'avez choisi."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3055
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_d10156a2:

    # "You also hope that, by emphasizing the 'Aunt', [bet] won't say anything about you two being married also."
    "Vous espérez aussi qu'en insistant sur le mot 'Tante', [bet] ne dira rien sur le fait que vous êtes aussi mariés."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3056
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_03b2ffbf:

    # "You don't want [aar]'s head to explode in the first ten minutes of meeting you. You wouldn't know how to get to the CEO's House. Maybe [ama] knows?"
    "Vous ne voulez pas que la tête de [aar] explose dans les dix premières minutes de votre rencontre. Vous ne sauriez pas comment vous rendre à la Maison du PDG. Peut-être que [ama] le sait ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3058
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_5a7d2b7d:

    # "After a few uncomfortable seconds for [aar], [bet] lets him go and takes a couple of steps back."
    "Après quelques secondes inconfortables pour [aar], [bet] le lâche et recule de quelques pas."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3059
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_a93bced7:

    # bet "Well, we've done the introductions. Next time I expect you to hug me back, [aar]."
    bet "Bien, les présentations sont faites. La prochaine fois, j'attends de toi que tu me rendes mon câlin, [aar]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3060
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_547c8a1f:

    # mc "Let his brain start working again before demanding things for next time."
    mc "Laisse son cerveau se remettre à fonctionner avant d'exiger des choses pour la prochaine fois."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3062
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_43cff04b:

    # aar "What? There's going to be a next time?"
    aar "Quoi ? Il va y avoir une prochaine fois ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3063
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_f982b868:

    # "The tough mercenary looks ridiculous, made uncomfortable by an old woman's hugs."
    "Le dur à cuire de mercenaire a l'air ridicule, mis mal à l'aise par les câlins d'une vieille femme."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3064
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_81ba533a:

    # mc "*Laugh* You know nothing, [aar] Gilford."
    mc "*Rire* Tu ne sais rien, [aar] Gilford."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3066
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_22d58535:

    # ama "That's from a TV show, [aar]."
    ama "Ça vient d'une série télé, [aar]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3067
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_1879d4b9:

    # ama "And yes. There are going to be a lot of next times. You'll get used to it."
    ama "Et oui. Il va y avoir beaucoup de prochaines fois. Tu t'y habitueras."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3068
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_c0280c35:

    # ama "We Marks are a family of huggers. We Gilfords should learn a lot from the Marks."
    ama "Nous, les Marks, sommes une famille qui aime les câlins. Nous, les Gilford, devrions beaucoup apprendre des Marks."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3069
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_12da8da0:

    # "You love that she includes herself in both families in a single line."
    "Tu adores le fait qu'elle s'inclue dans les deux familles en une seule phrase."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3070
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_7943f579:

    # mc "And now I think we should go before [aar] has a stroke."
    mc "Et maintenant, je pense qu'on devrait y aller avant qu'[aar] ne fasse une attaque."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3072
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_ab32aab2:

    # "After saying goodbye to [alb] and the pilots, you get into the limo and begin the journey to what will be your home for the next few months."
    "Après avoir dit au revoir à [alb] et aux pilotes, vous montez dans la limousine et commencez le trajet vers ce qui sera votre maison pour les prochains mois."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3073
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_ea94d5cc:

    # "[aar] acts as chauffeur while [ama] sits next to him and explains everything that has happened since he returned to Aruba."
    "[aar] fait office de chauffeur pendant qu'[ama] s'assoit à côté de lui et explique tout ce qui s'est passé depuis son retour à Aruba."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3074
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_af4c1341:

    # "The beautiful woman's words and excitement resonate in the empty streets, lighting up the night with her smile."
    "Les mots et l'excitation de la belle femme résonnent dans les rues vides, illuminant la nuit de son sourire."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3075
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_8f198eeb:

    # "She doesn't talk about missions or surveillance devices. She talks about family. She recounts laughter and hugs. She talks about the girls and Jamaal."
    "Elle ne parle pas de missions ou d'appareils de surveillance. Elle parle de famille. Elle raconte les rires et les câlins. Elle parle des filles et de Jamaal."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3077
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_20404727:

    # "She talks about your wedding."
    "Elle parle de votre mariage."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3078
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_9e5c9fc4:

    # "[bet] and you only intervene when [ama] leaves out some detail that you consider important."
    "[bet] et toi n'intervenez que lorsqu'[ama] omet un détail que vous jugez important."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3079
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_6ec8d16d:

    # "Neither of you wants to interrupt the excitement with which the blonde mercenary is explaining her new life."
    "Aucun de vous ne veut interrompre l'enthousiasme avec lequel la mercenaire blonde explique sa nouvelle vie."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3080
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_9943de76:

    # "The [ama] that almost broke your arm on the plane has disappeared again, although you know she's still in there."
    "La [ama] qui a failli vous casser le bras dans l'avion a de nouveau disparu, bien que vous sachiez qu'elle est toujours là."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3081
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_91095358:

    # "[aar] survives the trip without strokes or heart attacks. Barely."
    "[aar] survit au voyage sans AVC ni crise cardiaque. De justesse."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3082
translate french c31s005_AarPicksUp_b69dc59d:

    # "Which is lucky. He's the one driving."
    "Ce qui est une chance. C'est lui qui conduit."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3088
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_de4378fb:

    # "You arrive at the CEO's House around 4 AM. There are a couple of cars in the garage, apart from the limo you arrived in."
    "Vous arrivez à la maison de la PDG vers 4 heures du matin. Il y a quelques voitures dans le garage, en plus de la limousine dans laquelle vous êtes arrivés."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3089
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_0a13cb57:

    # "You had seen pictures of the interior, but something doesn't add up. What you've seen in the photos doesn't fit in that building."
    "Vous aviez vu des photos de l'intérieur, mais quelque chose cloche. Ce que vous avez vu sur les photos ne rentre pas dans ce bâtiment."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3091
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_afcbb943:

    # bet "I thought it would be bigger..."
    bet "Je pensais que ce serait plus grand..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3092
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_fc82af07:

    # bet "No offense, but it looks like a shack and a small building."
    bet "Sans vouloir vous offenser, on dirait une cabane et un petit bâtiment."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3093
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_542448ce:

    # bet "Not that I'm complaining. The terrace on the shack looks impressive and I've lived in worse places."
    bet "Non pas que je m'en plaigne. La terrasse de la cabane a l'air impressionnante et j'ai vécu dans de pires endroits."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3095
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_0dd8e3b2:

    # aar "The official name is A House on the Cliff. There are two floors below what you see."
    aar "Le nom officiel est Une Maison sur la Falaise. Il y a deux étages en dessous de ce que vous voyez."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3096
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_05359c75:

    # aar "This is just the kitchen, the living room, and the terrace. The bedrooms are on the next floor."
    aar "Ce n'est que la cuisine, le salon et la terrasse. Les chambres sont à l'étage suivant."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3097
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_fda14927:

    # mc "And on the third floor?"
    mc "Et au troisième étage ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3099
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_ee80499b:

    # aar "The panic room. Officially called The Bunker."
    aar "La panic room. Officiellement appelée Le Bunker."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3100
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_0dca65a0:

    # aar "There are secure communications with the base from that room, in case of an attack or if the CEO wants to follow an operation from here."
    aar "Il y a des communications sécurisées avec la base depuis cette pièce, en cas d'attaque ou si le PDG veut suivre une opération d'ici."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3101
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_e46ec2b8:

    # aar "There's also a small armory and the surveillance room."
    aar "Il y a aussi une petite armurerie et la salle de surveillance."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3102
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_5809d825:

    # mc "Do we have security personnel?"
    mc "Est-ce qu'on a du personnel de sécurité ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3104
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_42d4edcb:

    # ama "No. I told [aar] it wasn't necessary for tonight."
    ama "Non. J'ai dit à [aar] que ce n'était pas nécessaire pour ce soir."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3105
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_6c1174f1:

    # ama "No one knows we were coming and the house has been empty for a few weeks, so we don't expect to need it."
    ama "Personne ne sait qu'on arrivait et la maison est vide depuis quelques semaines, donc on ne pense pas en avoir besoin."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3107
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_d1515b34:

    # ama "Besides, I didn't want you to run into any operatives until we know what to expect from each of them."
    ama "En plus, je ne voulais pas que tu tombes sur des agents avant qu'on sache à quoi s'attendre de chacun d'eux."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3108
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_2af4d6d9:

    # mc "That sounds very smart."
    mc "Ça me paraît très intelligent."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3110
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_178d9d9a:

    # aar "You should rest now. You're going to have a very long day tomorrow."
    aar "Tu devrais te reposer maintenant. Tu vas avoir une très longue journée demain."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3111
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_4b98d4ab:

    # mc "I think you're right. See you tomorrow at the base?"
    mc "Je crois que tu as raison. On se voit demain à la base ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3113
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_a8133fae:

    # aar "Yeah, your first meeting is at 10 AM, with the department heads. I'll be there too."
    aar "Ouais, ta première réunion est à 10h, avec les chefs de département. J'y serai aussi."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3114
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_f5044b8c:

    # aar "But before that, you're scheduled for a tour of the facilities, so you should be there around 8 AM."
    aar "Mais avant ça, tu as une visite des installations de prévue, donc tu devrais être là vers 8h."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3115
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_0b03e858:

    # mc "Perfect. See you there then."
    mc "Parfait. On se voit là-bas alors."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3117
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_9afeb654:

    # "Both [bet] and [ama] say goodbye to [aar] with a hug after he helps you bring the luggage into the kitchen."
    "[bet] et [ama] disent toutes les deux au revoir à [aar] avec un câlin après qu'il t'ait aidé à apporter les bagages dans la cuisine."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3118
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_b45d2904:

    # "At this rate, he's going to get used to the Marks' hugs very quickly, even if he doesn't want to be part of the family."
    "À ce rythme, il va très vite s'habituer aux câlins des Marks, même s'il ne veut pas faire partie de la famille."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3119
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_8fa90c79:

    # "All it will take is for [eva] and a couple more of the girls to come and hug him... He'll have no choice but to change his mind."
    "Il suffira que [eva] et quelques autres filles viennent lui faire un câlin... Il n'aura pas d'autre choix que de changer d'avis."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3120
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_ca836ce4:

    # "In a weird way, he's your brother too."
    "D'une manière un peu bizarre, c'est aussi ton frère."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3121
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_9540a212:

    # "He drives off in the limo. For a moment you thought he'd leave the limo and take the Humvee."
    "Il s'en va avec la limousine. Pendant un instant, tu as cru qu'il allait laisser la limousine et prendre le Humvee."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3124
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_07d83ba2:

    # ama "I think we should go to sleep now. I'll show you your rooms."
    ama "Je pense qu'on devrait aller dormir maintenant. Je vais vous montrer vos chambres."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3125
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_cf2aa8fc:

    # mc "Have you been here before?"
    mc "Tu es déjà venue ici ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3127
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_2f025de4:

    # ama "Never, but I know how to read a floor plan and I can guide you to the rooms [aar] has assigned you."
    ama "Jamais, mais je sais lire un plan et je peux vous guider vers les chambres que [aar] vous a assignées."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3128
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_9c0fca5d:

    # ama "Neither Richards nor Daniels wanted us girls to be part of the mansion's security team."
    ama "Ni Richards ni Daniels ne voulaient que nous, les filles, fassions partie de l'équipe de sécurité du manoir."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3129
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_0510d4a5:

    # mc "Was there a reason for that?"
    mc "Y avait-il une raison à ça ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3131
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_e926464f:

    # ama "They said we could do more interesting things than stare at a monitor."
    ama "Ils disaient qu'on pouvait faire des choses plus intéressantes que de fixer un écran."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3132
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_771f29b2:

    # mc "And they were right. Despite that, you've spent the last few months doing just that."
    mc "Et ils avaient raison. Malgré ça, tu as passé ces derniers mois à faire exactement ça."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3134
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_ae617da5:

    # ama "*Laugh* And if it weren't for [emm] and [kat]... well, and the rest of you... it would have been really boring."
    ama "*Rire* Et s'il n'y avait pas eu [emm] et [kat]... enfin, et vous tous... ça aurait été vraiment chiant."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3135
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_48236755:

    # mc "I can't argue with that."
    mc "Je ne peux pas te contredire là-dessus."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3137
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_defe69fb:

    # bet "Guys, just a reminder that it's past 4. We need to get some sleep if we have to be at the base by 8 tomorrow."
    bet "Les gars, juste un rappel qu'il est plus de 4 heures. On doit dormir un peu si on doit être à la base à 8 heures demain."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3138
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_337435f8:

    # mc "You're going to sleep more? You spent almost the whole flight sleeping!"
    mc "Tu vas encore dormir ? Tu as passé presque tout le vol à roupiller !"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3140
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_ce05bbbe:

    # bet "*Laugh* At my age, a girl needs her beauty sleep."
    bet "*Rire* À mon âge, une fille a besoin de son sommeil de beauté."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3142
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_823cdb3f:

    # ama "Leave the big suitcases in the kitchen. We'll sort everything out tomorrow. It's too late to start unpacking today."
    ama "Laissez les grosses valises dans la cuisine. On s'occupera de tout demain. Il est trop tard pour commencer à déballer aujourd'hui."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3143
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_32d864f3:

    # ama "Grab the essentials for the night."
    ama "Prenez juste l'essentiel pour la nuit."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3144
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_dbe078ec:

    # mc "My toiletry bag and not much else."
    mc "Ma trousse de toilette et pas grand-chose d'autre."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3146
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_bc145742:

    # "[ama] walks [bet] to her room first, before showing you to yours."
    "[ama] accompagne d'abord [bet] à sa chambre, avant de vous montrer la vôtre."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3147
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_de7cc760:

    # "It's exactly like the photos you saw, with spectacular views of the Caribbean."
    "C'est exactement comme sur les photos que vous avez vues, avec des vues spectaculaires sur les Caraïbes."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3149
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_97ff6797:

    # ama "This is the master bedroom. There's the restroom, and over there are the stairs down to the panic room."
    ama "C'est la chambre principale. Il y a les toilettes, et par là, les escaliers qui descendent vers la panic room."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3150
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_dc2088e7:

    # mc "I hope I never have to use them."
    mc "J'espère que je n'aurai jamais à les utiliser."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3151
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_afdf5be0:

    # ama "Me too. The house has never been attacked, so that room has only been used as a command and surveillance center."
    ama "Moi aussi. La maison n'a jamais été attaquée, donc cette pièce n'a servi que de centre de commandement et de surveillance."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3155
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_d259401b:

    # ama "Good night, [mc]. I'll see you tomorrow... Or in about two and a half hours."
    ama "Bonne nuit, [mc]. On se voit demain... Ou dans environ deux heures et demie."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3156
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_47450581:

    # mc "Good night, sweetheart. Get some rest."
    mc "Bonne nuit, ma chérie. Repose-toi bien."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3158
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_b391b72f:

    # mc "[ama]..."
    mc "[ama]..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3160
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_09360d88:

    # ama "Yes...?"
    ama "Oui... ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3161
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_a17fb7e0:

    # mc "Are you going to be okay? If you want to stay the night, that bed is big."
    mc "Ça va aller ? Si tu veux rester pour la nuit, ce lit est grand."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3163
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_016fcb47:

    # ama "Don't worry about me. I'll be fine. But thanks anyway."
    ama "Ne t'inquiète pas pour moi. Ça ira. Mais merci quand même."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3164
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_0307e973:

    # mc "If you need me, you know where I live. *Laugh*"
    mc "Si tu as besoin de moi, tu sais où j'habite. *Rires*"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3165
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_5e0780c6:

    # ama "I'll keep that in mind. Get some rest."
    ama "Je garderai ça en tête. Repose-toi bien."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3167
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_d4e77122:

    # "You undress and freshen up. You leave your boxers on just in case one of the two women decides to make an appearance in the room."
    "Tu te déshabilles et te rafraîchis. Tu gardes ton caleçon au cas où l'une des deux femmes déciderait de faire une apparition dans la chambre."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3168
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_fb690820:

    # "You're not sleepy after the time you spent sleeping on the plane."
    "Tu n'as pas sommeil après le temps que tu as passé à dormir dans l'avion."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3169
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_45763d5d:

    # mcp "(Tomorrow is going to be an interesting day.)"
    mcp "(Demain va être une journée intéressante.)"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3171
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_3b889a27:

    # "You pour yourself some pineapple juice and step out onto the room's balcony."
    "Tu te sers du jus d'ananas et tu sors sur le balcon de la chambre."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3172
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_656c6488:

    # "The Caribbean shines beneath the stars."
    "Les Caraïbes brillent sous les étoiles."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3173
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_88d83a1b:

    # "If you haven't lost your sense of direction, you figure this balcony faces East, so the sun will wake you up when it rises."
    "Si tu n'as pas perdu ton sens de l'orientation, tu te dis que ce balcon est orienté à l'est, donc le soleil te réveillera quand il se lèvera."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3175
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_892927af:

    # "You can only imagine what the house would look like from a boat on the sea."
    "Tu ne peux qu'imaginer à quoi ressemblerait la maison depuis un bateau sur la mer."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3176
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_669c279f:

    # "It's probably just a dark mass against the starry sky right now. You'll have to see it during the day."
    "Ce n'est probablement qu'une masse sombre contre le ciel étoilé en ce moment. Il faudra que tu la voies de jour."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3177
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_c34fa20d:

    # mcp "(I should go to sleep. It wouldn't make a very good impression if the CEO fell asleep in the middle of meetings on his first day.)"
    mcp "(Je devrais aller dormir. Ça ne ferait pas très bonne impression si le PDG s'endormait en plein milieu des réunions pour son premier jour.)"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3179
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_dd0461ef:

    # "*Knock-Knock*"
    "*Toc-Toc*"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3180
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_ab770f08:

    # "A knock snaps you out of your daydreams. Some habits never change, even if you change countries."
    "Un coup à la porte te tire de tes rêveries. Certaines habitudes ne changent jamais, même quand on change de pays."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3181
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_2ffbba0b:

    # ama "*Through the door* It's me. Can I come in?"
    ama "*À travers la porte* C'est moi. Je peux entrer ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3182
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_3b55a4ab:

    # mc "Yes, come in."
    mc "Oui, entre."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3184
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_0269f882:

    # mc "Did you forget something?"
    mc "Tu as oublié quelque chose ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3185
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_203fd4fe:

    # ama "To accept your offer to stay the night."
    ama "D'accepter ton offre de rester pour la nuit."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3186
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_98c81edc:

    # ama "I saw a light on your balcony and..."
    ama "J'ai vu de la lumière sur ton balcon et..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3187
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_6e83634c:

    # mc "You don't have to explain yourself for accepting an offer I made you."
    mc "Tu n'as pas à te justifier pour avoir accepté une offre que je t'ai faite."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3189
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_5d454985:

    # ama "This is going to be really hard..."
    ama "Ça va être vraiment difficile..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3190
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_96bd13db:

    # mc "Nothing we can't overcome together, [ama]."
    mc "Rien qu'on ne puisse surmonter ensemble, [ama]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3191
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_b5587787:

    # mc "And you survived [emm]'s room without gouging your eyes out."
    mc "Et tu as survécu à la chambre de [emm] sans t'arracher les yeux."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3192
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_06edb69f:

    # mc "I don't think a few clones will be able to defeat you."
    mc "Je ne pense pas que quelques clones pourront te vaincre."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3194
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_f0ab3851:

    # ama "The problem isn't going to be the clones... Or at least they won't be the main problem."
    ama "Le problème ne sera pas les clones... Ou du moins, ce ne sera pas le problème principal."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3195
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_63f18179:

    # ama "I don't know how the rest of the staff will take the changes we want to make to the company."
    ama "Je ne sais pas comment le reste du personnel prendra les changements que nous voulons apporter à l'entreprise."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3196
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_74d2ffe2:

    # mc "Me neither, but you know what?"
    mc "Moi non plus, mais tu sais quoi ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3198
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_e44310b5:

    # ama "What?"
    ama "Quoi ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3199
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_58c4108e:

    # mc "That's something we'll start figuring out tomorrow. Let's not worry about it today."
    mc "C'est quelque chose qu'on commencera à régler demain. Ne nous en soucions pas aujourd'hui."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3201
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_c1cd90f3:

    # mc "Today all I want is to sleep with my wife. Even if it's only for two and a half hours."
    mc "Aujourd'hui, tout ce que je veux, c'est dormir avec ma femme. Même si ce n'est que pour deux heures et demie."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3203
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_86ee3907:

    # ama "Two and a quarter hours. But it's just going to be sleeping..."
    ama "Deux heures et quart. Mais ce sera juste pour dormir..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3204
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_214247f0:

    # mc "Yeah, don't worry. I don't want our first time to be like this, or so rushed."
    mc "Ouais, t'inquiète pas. Je ne veux pas que notre première fois soit comme ça, ou si précipitée."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3205
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_a73b2ab8:

    # mc "Besides, we're tired from the trip today."
    mc "En plus, on est fatigués par le voyage d'aujourd'hui."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3207
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_69c786b7:

    # ama "You're right. And no. I'm not going to buy you that shirt."
    ama "Tu as raison. Et non. Je ne vais pas t'acheter ce t-shirt."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3208
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_f7270242:

    # mc "*Laugh* I think I'll end up having to order it online."
    mc "*Rires* Je crois que je vais finir par devoir le commander en ligne."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3212
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_bd33b22a:

    # ama "Then, let's go to bed."
    ama "Alors, allons nous coucher."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3213
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_c898a30c:

    # mc "After you."
    mc "Après toi."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3215
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_28bd9c12:

    # ama "By the way... I heard you slept naked. I don't know whether to feel disappointed."
    ama "Au fait... J'ai entendu dire que tu dormais nu. Je ne sais pas si je dois être déçue."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3216
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_f826b8e1:

    # mc "That's something I can fix, if you want."
    mc "C'est quelque chose que je peux arranger, si tu veux."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3217
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_7ed56edc:

    # ama "*Laugh* I don't think I want to."
    ama "*Rires* Je ne crois pas en avoir envie."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3219
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_f5187d42:

    # ama "At least, not today."
    ama "Du moins, pas aujourd'hui."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3220
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_f4cc3d5f:

    # ama "Remember we had cameras in your room. I've already seen everything there is to see."
    ama "N'oublie pas qu'on avait des caméras dans ta chambre. J'ai déjà vu tout ce qu'il y a à voir."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3221
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_f1c647f7:

    # mc "Changing the subject, I love the Zeus nightgown."
    mc "Pour changer de sujet, j'adore la chemise de nuit Zeus."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3222
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_3fa66fd4:

    # ama "I bought it before I met him, so it was just a nightgown with a bunch of cats on it."
    ama "Je l'ai achetée avant de le rencontrer, donc c'était juste une chemise de nuit avec plein de chats dessus."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3223
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_ada77496:

    # mc "Are you going to take long to get into bed?"
    mc "Tu vas mettre longtemps à venir te coucher ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3224
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_0a2c7118:

    # ama "No..."
    ama "Non..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3226
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_5f11d045:

    # "Finally, [ama] decides to turn off the lights and get into bed with you."
    "Finalement, [ama] décide d'éteindre les lumières et de se mettre au lit avec toi."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3227
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_390ccea4:

    # "As soon as you settle into each other's arms, you fall asleep like dormice under the moonlight filtering through the large window."
    "Dès que vous vous installez dans les bras l'un de l'autre, vous vous endormez comme des loirs sous la lumière de la lune qui filtre à travers la grande fenêtre."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3228
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_1c43d281:

    # "The day has been longer than either of you expected, and exhaustion has taken its toll on you."
    "La journée a été plus longue que ce que vous espériez tous les deux, et l'épuisement a eu raison de vous."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3230
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_f2ebf9cc:

    # "You sleep with your wife for the first time. Even if it's just for a little over two hours."
    "Tu dors avec ta femme pour la première fois. Même si ce n'est que pour un peu plus de deux heures."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3231
translate french c31s005_houseArrival_bdb3931a:

    # "You're going to have a month to sleep with her plenty of nights."
    "Tu vas avoir un mois pour dormir avec elle plein de nuits."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3236
translate french c31s006_Caroline_1a10c5f8:

    # "After breakfast, [ama] drives you to the base. It's less than 30 minutes from the house."
    "Après le petit-déjeuner, [ama] te conduit à la base. C'est à moins de 30 minutes de la maison."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2451
translate french c31s006_Caroline_020a6dc8:

    # "After breakfast, [ama] takes you to the base. It's less than 15 minutes from the house."
    "Après le petit-déjeuner, [ama] t'emmène à la base. C'est à moins de 15 minutes de la maison."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2452
translate french c31s006_Caroline_36340068:

    # ama "Well, here we are. This is NTR's main base."
    ama "Eh bien, nous y voilà. C'est la base principale de NTR."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2453
translate french c31s006_Caroline_b8d84426:

    # mc "It's impressive. Although it looks more like a factory than what you'd imagine a military base to be."
    mc "C'est impressionnant. Bien que ça ressemble plus à une usine qu'à ce qu'on imagine d'une base militaire."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2455
translate french c31s006_Caroline_e6d884d4:

    # bet "It has acted as a factory of clones, death, and misery for a long time."
    bet "Ça a servi d'usine à clones, de mort et de misère pendant longtemps."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2456
translate french c31s006_Caroline_1e4592a3:

    # mc "You're right..."
    mc "Tu as raison..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2458
translate french c31s006_Caroline_0ac894ba:

    # ama "We're going to start the tour with the most important person you'll have to deal with in the coming months."
    ama "On va commencer la visite par la personne la plus importante à qui tu auras affaire dans les mois à venir."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2459
translate french c31s006_Caroline_263e99ec:

    # mc "[mael], the Head of the Science Department? Or [vin], from Accounting? I thought we had a meeting with them later."
    mc "[mael], le chef du département scientifique ? Ou [vin], de la comptabilité ? Je croyais qu'on avait une réunion avec eux plus tard."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2461
translate french c31s006_Caroline_7619f015:

    # ama "[car], your secretary."
    ama "[car], ta secrétaire."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2462
translate french c31s006_Caroline_27bb2658:

    # "That index finger pointing to the sky is such a Marks pose... You haven't been here a day and you're already missing the family."
    "Cet index pointé vers le ciel, c'est tellement une pose des Marks... Tu n'es même pas là depuis un jour et la famille te manque déjà."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2463
translate french c31s006_Caroline_23850e58:

    # mc "I wasn't expecting that. I read her file... She was Daniels' secretary... And Richards' before him."
    mc "Je ne m'attendais pas à ça. J'ai lu son dossier... Elle était la secrétaire de Daniels... Et celle de Richards avant lui."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2464
translate french c31s006_Caroline_ef968228:

    # mc "And Uncle Mike's. She's been here since the company moved to Aruba."
    mc "Et celle de l'oncle Mike. Elle est ici depuis que l'entreprise a déménagé à Aruba."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2465
translate french c31s006_Caroline_a78ce96d:

    # ama "She's loyal to the company, not the CEO of the moment. If you win her over, she'll be a great help to you."
    ama "Elle est loyale à l'entreprise, pas au PDG du moment. Si tu la mets dans ta poche, elle te sera d'une grande aide."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2466
translate french c31s006_Caroline_759e31a4:

    # ama "You won't be able to make this work without her help. She knows everything and everyone."
    ama "Tu ne pourras pas t'en sortir sans son aide. Elle connaît tout et tout le monde."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2467
translate french c31s006_Caroline_33ab9927:

    # ama "And don't let her looks fool you. She could chew bullets if she wanted to."
    ama "Et ne te laisse pas avoir par son apparence. Elle pourrait mâcher des balles si elle le voulait."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2469
translate french c31s006_Caroline_237d6a3c:

    # bet "A secretary can make your life very easy or very difficult."
    bet "Une secrétaire peut vous rendre la vie très facile ou très difficile."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2470
translate french c31s006_Caroline_7b639aef:

    # bet "I think [ama] is right that she should be the first person you meet."
    bet "Je pense qu'[ama] a raison de dire qu'elle devrait être la première personne que tu rencontres."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2471
translate french c31s006_Caroline_3dc08b87:

    # bet "And remember, first impressions are important. Don't fuck it up."
    bet "Et n'oublie pas, les premières impressions sont importantes. Ne foire pas tout."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2472
translate french c31s006_Caroline_f02557ac:

    # mc "*Laughs* The confidence you place in me is reassuring."
    mc "*Rit* La confiance que tu places en moi est rassurante."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2473
translate french c31s006_Caroline_ff41ca5a:

    # mc "Let's go meet the fearsome [car]."
    mc "Allons rencontrer la redoutable [car]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2475
translate french c31s006_Caroline_b8f4b2ad:

    # ama "Caroline, meet [mc] Marks. The new CEO."
    ama "Caroline, je vous présente [mc] Marks. Le nouveau PDG."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2476
translate french c31s006_Caroline_f4df7136:

    # ama "[bet] Cavendish is also here, the surgeon who's going to operate on [gav]."
    ama "[bet] Cavendish est également ici, la chirurgienne qui va opérer [gav]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2477
translate french c31s006_Caroline_2e8abe0d:

    # car "Nice to meet you. I hope the house was to your liking, Mr. Marks."
    car "Ravie de vous rencontrer. J'espère que la maison était à votre goût, M. Marks."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2478
translate french c31s006_Caroline_d982c5ca:

    # mc "Likewise, [car]."
    mc "De même, [car]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2479
translate french c31s006_Caroline_05f1df77:

    # mc "The house is impressive, thank you."
    mc "La maison est impressionnante, merci."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2481
translate french c31s006_Caroline_a543b3ea:

    # car "You have a tight schedule today, Mr. Marks."
    car "Vous avez un emploi du temps chargé aujourd'hui, M. Marks."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2482
translate french c31s006_Caroline_86007264:

    # mc "Call me [mc], please."
    mc "Appelez-moi [mc], s'il vous plaît."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2483
translate french c31s006_Caroline_4046077a:

    # car "First up is the sightseeing tour of the main base facilities."
    car "Pour commencer, voici la visite touristique des installations de la base principale."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2485
translate french c31s006_Caroline_aa575e46:

    # bet "*Laughs* The 'sightseeing tour' part sounded funny, [car]."
    bet "*Rit* La partie 'visite touristique' m'a fait rire, [car]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2487
translate french c31s006_Caroline_f114ee19:

    # car "It's the first time we've had to show the facilities to a CEO. Until now, previous CEOs had risen through the ranks of the company."
    car "C'est la première fois que nous devons montrer les installations à un PDG. Jusqu'à présent, les PDG précédents avaient gravi les échelons de l'entreprise."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2488
translate french c31s006_Caroline_2210dd78:

    # car "They had earned the right to be here after years of service."
    car "Ils avaient gagné le droit d'être ici après des années de service."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2489
translate french c31s006_Caroline_1bf6c3c8:

    # mc "I hope I can earn that right."
    mc "J'espère pouvoir gagner ce droit."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2491
translate french c31s006_Caroline_eae358d5:

    # car "I hope so too, Mr. Marks."
    car "Je l'espère aussi, M. Marks."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2492
translate french c31s006_Caroline_e2a2531e:

    # car "There's been a problem with David, the operative who was supposed to give you the tour."
    car "Il y a eu un problème avec David, l'agent qui devait vous faire la visite."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2494
translate french c31s006_Caroline_2c93df91:

    # ama "Is he okay?"
    ama "Est-ce qu'il va bien ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2495
translate french c31s006_Caroline_ad909581:

    # car "Just a sprained ankle. I'm waiting for [aar] to tell me who's going to replace him for the tour."
    car "Juste une entorse à la cheville. J'attends que [aar] me dise qui va le remplacer pour la visite."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2497
translate french c31s006_Caroline_232d656f:

    # ama "Don't worry about that. Tell [aar] that I'll show [mc] around the base."
    ama "Ne t'en fais pas pour ça. Dis à [aar] que je vais faire visiter la base à [mc]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2498
translate french c31s006_Caroline_d5aa9e6d:

    # car "Sounds like a good solution. If we have to wait for [aar], we'd probably have to cut the tour short."
    car "Ça me semble être une bonne solution. Si on doit attendre [aar], on devrait probablement écourter la visite."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2499
translate french c31s006_Caroline_720cfcd9:

    # mc "So that's one problem solved. Anything else?"
    mc "Voilà donc un problème de réglé. Autre chose ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2501
translate french c31s006_Caroline_9d99232a:

    # car "After the tour, you have the meeting with the department heads. In two hours."
    car "Après la visite, vous avez la réunion avec les chefs de service. Dans deux heures."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2502
translate french c31s006_Caroline_287f1372:

    # mc "Sweet, [car]."
    mc "Super, [car]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2505
translate french c31s006_Caroline_fa033f4c:

    # bet "Bam Bam Baa."
    bet "Bam Bam Baa."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2507
translate french c31s006_Caroline_ebfa80d0:

    # car "..."
    car "..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2509
translate french c31s006_Caroline_103e00b6:

    # car "After that, you have a meeting with IT Support, where they'll give you a brief training on the company's software."
    car "Après ça, vous avez une réunion avec le support informatique, où ils vous donneront une brève formation sur les logiciels de l'entreprise."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2510
translate french c31s006_Caroline_0b829346:

    # car "And, whenever you have a moment, I need to give you the Employee Handbook, where you'll find all the information you need."
    car "Et, quand vous aurez un moment, je dois vous remettre le manuel de l'employé, où vous trouverez toutes les informations dont vous avez besoin."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2511
translate french c31s006_Caroline_9f74374e:

    # car "I've left enough time between both meetings so you won't be stressed for time on your first day."
    car "J'ai laissé suffisamment de temps entre les deux réunions pour que vous ne soyez pas pressé par le temps pour votre premier jour."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2512
translate french c31s006_Caroline_da378e55:

    # mc "Thanks, [car]."
    mc "Merci, [car]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2516
translate french c31s006_Caroline_9402cb80:

    # car "In the afternoon, you have a meeting with [aar]. He will give you an {b}{u}exhaustive{/u}{/b} report on his management these past few days."
    car "Dans l'après-midi, vous avez une réunion avec [aar]. Il vous fera un rapport {b}{u}exhaustif{/u}{/b} sur sa gestion de ces derniers jours."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2517
translate french c31s006_Caroline_76404822:

    # mc "That sounds like you've suffered through [aar]'s reports too."
    mc "On dirait que vous avez aussi souffert des rapports de [aar]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2519
translate french c31s006_Caroline_49687396:

    # car "Executive reports should be concise, Mr. Marks."
    car "Les rapports de direction doivent être concis, M. Marks."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2520
translate french c31s006_Caroline_bd7d9df9:

    # mc "[mc]."
    mc "[mc]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2521
translate french c31s006_Caroline_4725d612:

    # car "You're not going to have time to worry about whether the ammo stock will last nine months and two days or only nine months."
    car "Vous n'aurez pas le temps de vous soucier de savoir si le stock de munitions durera neuf mois et deux jours ou seulement neuf mois."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2522
translate french c31s006_Caroline_7f36e1a2:

    # mc "I agree."
    mc "Je suis d'accord."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2524
translate french c31s006_Caroline_d8af4fd3:

    # car "You should leave now if you don't want to cut the visit short. We'll talk later when the first meeting is over."
    car "Vous devriez partir maintenant si vous ne voulez pas écourter la visite. Nous parlerons plus tard une fois la première réunion terminée."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2525
translate french c31s006_Caroline_b3b3c37a:

    # mc "Perfect, [car]."
    mc "Parfait, [car]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2527
translate french c31s006_Caroline_4f14db7a:

    # mc "[bet], I think you forgot about the first impression thing."
    mc "[bet], je crois que tu as oublié le truc de la première impression."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2528
translate french c31s006_Caroline_17051cf0:

    # bet "I didn't forget. But ever since I heard her name, I've had that song stuck in my head."
    bet "Je n'ai pas oublié. Mais depuis que j'ai entendu son nom, j'ai cette chanson coincée dans la tête."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2529
translate french c31s006_Caroline_568bf98f:

    # bet "And if she focuses on the CEO's eccentric aunt, you'll look better by comparison."
    bet "Et si elle se concentre sur la tante excentrique du PDG, tu paraîtras mieux en comparaison."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2530
translate french c31s006_Caroline_941197f0:

    # ama "I don't know what song you're talking about, nor did I understand your gesture, Aunt [bet]."
    ama "Je ne sais pas de quelle chanson tu parles, et je n'ai pas non plus compris ton geste, Tante [bet]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2532
translate french c31s006_Caroline_1b5e90ca:

    # bet "We need to start working on your musical education, my girl. It's a classic from '69!"
    bet "Il va falloir qu'on commence à bosser sur ton éducation musicale, ma fille. C'est un classique de 69 !"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2533
translate french c31s006_Caroline_7d262a9a:

    # ama "There will be time for that later. We should start the tour now."
    ama "On aura le temps pour ça plus tard. On devrait commencer la visite maintenant."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2534
translate french c31s006_Caroline_4f9d9d29:

    # mc "Whenever you're ready. I think I would've gotten lost a couple of times by now."
    mc "Quand tu veux. Je crois que je me serais déjà perdu plusieurs fois à ce stade."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3136
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_a0b85b73:

    # ama "This way. I'll try not to overwhelm you, but there's a lot to see."
    ama "Par ici. Je vais essayer de ne pas te submerger, mais il y a beaucoup à voir."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3137
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_4bb2aef5:

    # mc "Don't worry. I prefer to see everything at once and get a real feel for the place."
    mc "T'inquiète pas. Je préfère tout voir d'un coup pour vraiment m'imprégner des lieux."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3138
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_0c5b78d4:

    # ama "As you wish. Let's start with the troop dorms."
    ama "Comme tu voudras. Commençons par les dortoirs des troupes."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3141
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_c5972219:

    # ama "The operatives sleep here. Bunk beds, individual lockers, common area at the back."
    ama "Les agents dorment ici. Lits superposés, casiers individuels, espace commun au fond."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3142
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_744b9b50:

    # mc "It's... functional."
    mc "C'est... fonctionnel."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3144
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_10e00322:

    # ama "That's the nicest thing you could say about it."
    ama "C'est la chose la plus gentille que tu puisses en dire."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3145
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_214be116:

    # mc "How many share a room?"
    mc "Combien partagent une chambre ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3147
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_d9244d75:

    # ama "Sixteen per module. There are six modules in this block. There are six blocks."
    ama "Seize par module. Il y a six modules dans ce bloc. Il y a six blocs."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3148
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_620f54f4:

    # mc "And this hasn't changed in years?"
    mc "Et ça n'a pas changé depuis des années ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3149
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_aa62e8ee:

    # ama "No. The previous management saw no reason to improve what they considered sufficient."
    ama "Non. L'ancienne direction ne voyait aucune raison d'améliorer ce qu'elle jugeait suffisant."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3150
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_f985dcb7:

    # mc "Well, I do."
    mc "Eh bien, moi oui."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3152
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_af45e037:

    # ama "I know."
    ama "Je sais."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3150
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_1f2a88c0:

    # mc "Did you grow up here?"
    mc "Tu as grandi ici ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3152
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_a216b640:

    # ama "In a smaller module, just for the girls. It's basically the same, but our common area is bigger."
    ama "Dans un module plus petit, juste pour les filles. C'est en gros la même chose, mais notre espace commun est plus grand."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3153
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_e71c5eb9:

    # ama "We had to specialize in more things, so we had to train with different devices."
    ama "On devait se spécialiser dans plus de domaines, donc on devait s'entraîner avec différents appareils."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3154
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_d56b9c53:

    # mc "I get it."
    mc "Je comprends."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3154
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_db787fdc:

    # bet "I'd say it smells like a gym locker room, but I don't want to be cruel... with gym locker rooms."
    bet "Je dirais que ça sent le vestiaire de sport, mais je ne veux pas être cruelle... envers les vestiaires de sport."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3155
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_460a30af:

    # mc "You notice it too?"
    mc "Tu le remarques aussi ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3156
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_2318742c:

    # bet "I've been here five minutes and I'm already getting used to it. That's scarier."
    bet "Ça fait cinq minutes que je suis là et je m'y habitue déjà. C'est ça le plus flippant."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3158
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_7bead8a2:

    # ama "Poor ventilation. It's been on the pending renovations list for two years."
    ama "Mauvaise ventilation. C'est sur la liste des rénovations en attente depuis deux ans."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3159
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_fc784a98:

    # mc "Let me know when it moves to the top of that list."
    mc "Préviens-moi quand ça passera en tête de liste."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3160
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_53dd844a:

    # ama "Noted. Let's continue the visit."
    ama "C'est noté. Continuons la visite."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3163
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_d4e96205:

    # ama "Main laboratory. Analysis, protocol development, applied research."
    ama "Laboratoire principal. Analyse, développement de protocoles, recherche appliquée."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3164
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_772f75f4:

    # mc "Applied to what exactly?"
    mc "Appliquée à quoi, exactement ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3165
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_8591b7a4:

    # ama "Physical performance enhancements, recovery treatments, field adaptations."
    ama "Améliorations des performances physiques, traitements de récupération, adaptations sur le terrain."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3166
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_c102562d:

    # ama "And, obviously, improvements in cloning protocols."
    ama "Et, bien sûr, l'amélioration des protocoles de clonage."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3168
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_3a86785f:

    # bet "This place is going to be a treat for [dap] and [sca]..."
    bet "Cet endroit va être un vrai régal pour [dap] et [sca]..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3169
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_48cc3e9a:

    # mc "I don't understand what half the things I'm seeing are, but it all looks high-tech."
    mc "Je ne comprends pas la moitié des trucs que je vois, mais tout a l'air très high-tech."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3171
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_fe823e67:

    # ama "[mael], the head of the Science Department, has very refined tastes when it comes to ordering equipment."
    ama "[mael], le chef du département des sciences, a des goûts très raffinés en matière de commande d'équipement."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3172
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_f349d67a:

    # ama "And the most interesting part is what has been developed here, as proprietary technology."
    ama "Et le plus intéressant, c'est ce qui a été développé ici, en tant que technologie exclusive."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3173
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_4c9e2cef:

    # mc "That could be the cornerstone of what we want to do for the company's change in direction."
    mc "Ça pourrait être la pierre angulaire de ce qu'on veut faire pour le changement de direction de l'entreprise."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3175
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_4811af7c:

    # ama "I think we have a good foundation to start growing, but it will be clearer to you in the meeting in a little while."
    ama "Je pense qu'on a de bonnes bases pour commencer à se développer, mais ce sera plus clair pour vous lors de la réunion tout à l'heure."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3176
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_eb9629cd:

    # mc "Was all this operational before I got the job?"
    mc "Est-ce que tout ça était opérationnel avant que j'obtienne le poste ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3177
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_8be0bdfa:

    # ama "The lab, yes. Although some projects were put on hold with the change in management."
    ama "Le labo, oui. Bien que certains projets aient été mis en attente avec le changement de direction."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3178
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_276a0d79:

    # mc "Which ones?"
    mc "Lesquels ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3180
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_1d155b77:

    # ama "The ones that weren't profitable in the short term. Which coincidentally were the most interesting."
    ama "Ceux qui n'étaient pas rentables à court terme. Ce qui, par coïncidence, étaient les plus intéressants."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3181
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_5feeb067:

    # mc "Can I see what was put on hold?"
    mc "Je peux voir ce qui a été mis en attente ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3182
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_6b7fdc17:

    # ama "I'll prepare a report for you. But let's keep moving for now."
    ama "Je vais vous préparer un rapport. Mais continuons d'avancer pour le moment."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3184
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_30a04035:

    # mc "Is no one working?"
    mc "Personne ne travaille ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3185
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_b2e407c2:

    # ama "I think there are several team meetings going on, where they're finalizing the information they'll present to you shortly."
    ama "Je crois qu'il y a plusieurs réunions d'équipe en cours, où ils finalisent les informations qu'ils vont vous présenter sous peu."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3186
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_8c0b8827:

    # ama "I get the feeling no one wanted to run into you before that meeting."
    ama "J'ai l'impression que personne ne voulait vous croiser avant cette réunion."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3187
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_3fac017b:

    # mc "I understand."
    mc "Je comprends."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3190
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_18890a76:

    # ama "Cloning Room 1."
    ama "Salle de clonage 1."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3193
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_437a7119:

    # mc "For God's sake!"
    mc "Bon sang !"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3191
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_0a835d55:

    # mc "For God's sake!"
    mc "Bon sang !"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3194
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_61ec9ea1:

    # ama "Yeah. [eva] and I were born in there."
    ama "Ouais. [eva] et moi sommes nées là-dedans."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3196
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_b55592fd:

    # ama "Yes. [eri], [dap], and [emm] were born in there."
    ama "Oui. [eri], [dap] et [emm] sont nées là-dedans."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3197
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_6109e69f:

    # ama "I haven't been here in years..."
    ama "Je ne suis pas venue ici depuis des années..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3201
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_a1060dd4:

    # "You feel tempted to hug the mercenary, but the emotional weight in her voice tells you it's not the best time."
    "Tu te sens tenté de prendre la mercenaire dans tes bras, mais le poids émotionnel dans sa voix t'indique que ce n'est pas le meilleur moment."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3203
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_874cb6b0:

    # "The emotional weight in her voice tells you that, even though she wasn't born in this room, it's not a pleasant place for her."
    "Le poids émotionnel dans sa voix t'indique que, même si elle n'est pas née dans cette pièce, ce n'est pas un endroit agréable pour elle."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3198
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_6c0f2e3f:

    # mc "Is it still active?"
    mc "C'est toujours actif ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3200
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_f0d573c0:

    # ama "Yes, all the cloning tubes are full. [mael] can give you the details on them."
    ama "Oui, tous les tubes de clonage sont pleins. [mael] peut t'en donner les détails."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3201
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_df3eb5ca:

    # ama "I'm not going to give you the numbers right now."
    ama "Je ne vais pas te donner les chiffres tout de suite."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3202
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_442d7fdf:

    # mc "Why not?"
    mc "Pourquoi pas ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3204
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_4b72efc3:

    # ama "Because we're on a tour and I prefer you go into today's meeting with a clear head."
    ama "Parce qu'on fait une visite et je préfère que tu ailles à la réunion d'aujourd'hui avec les idées claires."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3206
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_973dfa6e:

    # bet "It's her way of saying they're impressive numbers."
    bet "C'est sa façon de dire que ce sont des chiffres impressionnants."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3207
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_bf29b46d:

    # mc "Are they?"
    mc "Vraiment ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3208
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_ce891c2e:

    # bet "Very. I've been talking to [mael] these past few days."
    bet "Très. J'ai parlé à [mael] ces derniers jours."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3210
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_41618d42:

    # mc "What do we do with all this? With the room, with the equipment?"
    mc "Qu'est-ce qu'on fait de tout ça ? De la pièce, de l'équipement ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3211
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_5d21dd38:

    # ama "That's exactly the kind of question we need you to ask at the meeting. And answer it."
    ama "C'est exactement le genre de question qu'on a besoin que tu poses à la réunion. Et que tu y répondes."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3212
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_e6326af3:

    # mc "I don't have an answer yet."
    mc "Je n'ai pas encore de réponse."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3213
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_76b508e2:

    # ama "You don't need one today."
    ama "Tu n'en as pas besoin aujourd'hui."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3215
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_3a77c5a2:

    # mc "Can we go in? [bet] is going to smash her nose against the glass..."
    mc "On peut entrer ? [bet] va s'écraser le nez contre la vitre..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3216
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_5bc34429:

    # ama "Not in street clothes. We have to wear protective suits and go through a decontamination process first."
    ama "Pas en vêtements de ville. Nous devons d'abord enfiler des combinaisons de protection et passer par un processus de décontamination."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3223
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_714d05fb:

    # ama "You enter from the back. This door is only used when there's no cloning process underway and the room doesn't need to be sterile."
    ama "On entre par l'arrière. Cette porte n'est utilisée que lorsqu'il n'y a pas de processus de clonage en cours et que la pièce n'a pas besoin d'être stérile."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3217
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_19e1bb29:

    # mc "Makes sense."
    mc "C'est logique."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3219
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_77840939:

    # bet "Some things take time to process. I think this is one of them."
    bet "Certaines choses prennent du temps à assimiler. Je pense que c'en est une."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3220
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_feaf16a6:

    # mc "How are you holding up? It's giving me the creeps."
    mc "Comment tu tiens le coup ? Ça me fout les jetons."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3221
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_7bccaec0:

    # bet "I'm going to focus on being useful. On doing what I know how to do."
    bet "Je vais me concentrer sur le fait d'être utile. Sur ce que je sais faire."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3226
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_c407e765:

    # bet "There are things that take time to digest. I think this room is one of them."
    bet "Il y a des choses qui prennent du temps à digérer. Je pense que cette pièce en fait partie."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3229
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_801f91e4:

    # bet "I'm not going to judge what was done here previously. I'll judge if it doesn't stop."
    bet "Je ne vais pas juger ce qui a été fait ici avant. Je jugerai si ça ne s'arrête pas."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3224
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_5606b665:

    # ama "Medical facilities. Operating rooms, recovery, and consultation rooms."
    ama "Installations médicales. Salles d'opération, de réveil et de consultation."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3225
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_54346d53:

    # mc "Impressive. It's bigger than I expected."
    mc "Impressionnant. C'est plus grand que ce que j'imaginais."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3227
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_cf26a2dc:

    # bet "I suppose a small hospital is needed in a place like this."
    bet "Je suppose qu'un petit hôpital est nécessaire dans un endroit pareil."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3228
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_ba9d6eb4:

    # bet "I imagine the injuries can be quite diverse, knowing what the company does."
    bet "J'imagine que les blessures peuvent être assez diverses, sachant ce que fait l'entreprise."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3230
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_20b85ec0:

    # ama "Diverse is a very diplomatic word."
    ama "Diverses est un mot très diplomatique."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3232
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_c15af9f7:

    # bet "I'm a doctor. Diplomacy is part of the job."
    bet "Je suis médecin. La diplomatie fait partie du métier."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3233
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_460bdb97:

    # mc "How many recovery beds are there?"
    mc "Combien y a-t-il de lits de convalescence ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3235
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_1f28ec2e:

    # ama "Twenty-four. Although we've had more occupancy than desirable."
    ama "Vingt-quatre. Bien que nous ayons eu un taux d'occupation plus élevé que souhaitable."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3236
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_716f5230:

    # mc "And right now?"
    mc "Et en ce moment ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3238
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_93a1d949:

    # ama "Nine patients, from what I've read. Ranging from a flu to... [gav] and several wounded from the Clone War."
    ama "Neuf patients, d'après ce que j'ai lu. Allant d'une grippe à... [gav] et plusieurs blessés de la Guerre des Clones."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3239
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_7c29365d:

    # mc "Is [gav] still here?"
    mc "Est-ce que [gav] est toujours là ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3241
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_d9d3c8b1:

    # bet "After talking to him, I thought it would be best if he stayed in a controlled environment."
    bet "Après lui avoir parlé, j'ai pensé qu'il serait préférable qu'il reste dans un environnement contrôlé."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3242
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_2fd9fae1:

    # bet "He can leave his room and move around the base, but no more excursions to the beach for now."
    bet "Il peut quitter sa chambre et se déplacer dans la base, mais plus d'excursions à la plage pour le moment."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3243
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_871edece:

    # mc "Is the arm thing going to work well?"
    mc "Est-ce que le truc avec son bras va bien marcher ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3245
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_ac4a8c8b:

    # bet "It's going to work better than the original. That's no exaggeration, it's an engineering marvel."
    bet "Ça va marcher mieux que l'original. Ce n'est pas une exagération, c'est une merveille d'ingénierie."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3246
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_918d07e8:

    # bet "I'm looking forward to seeing the real device. So far I've only seen photos and blueprints."
    bet "J'ai hâte de voir le vrai dispositif. Jusqu'à présent, je n'ai vu que des photos et des plans."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3247
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_b1ec7853:

    # mc "When is the surgery?"
    mc "C'est quand l'opération ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3249
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_2a7468a5:

    # bet "On Sunday. If everything goes well, he'll be in physical therapy in two weeks."
    bet "Dimanche. Si tout se passe bien, il sera en rééducation dans deux semaines."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3250
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_d88fdbbc:

    # mc "And does [gav] know how it's going to turn out?"
    mc "Et est-ce que [gav] sait ce que ça va donner ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3252
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_4f0709d4:

    # bet "I explained every step to him. He asked if he could go back to the field."
    bet "Je lui ai expliqué chaque étape. Il a demandé s'il pourrait retourner sur le terrain."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3253
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_5c602d0c:

    # mc "And?"
    mc "Et ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3254
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_ac93f27d:

    # bet "I told him probably yes. That the arm wasn't going to be his limit."
    bet "Je lui ai dit que probablement oui. Que le bras n'allait pas être sa limite."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3255
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_457c1076:

    # mc "And how did he react?"
    mc "Et comment a-t-il réagi ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3265
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_33cfb197:

    # ama "He must have been happy."
    ama "Il a dû être content."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3257
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_c759d1da:

    # bet "His face lit up. It was sweet."
    bet "Son visage s'est illuminé. C'était mignon."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3258
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_5e02bf30:

    # ama "You hadn't told me."
    ama "Tu ne me l'avais pas dit."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3259
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_84c34bcb:

    # bet "Doctor-patient confidentiality..."
    bet "Le secret médical..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3260
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_0dd13cac:

    # mc "Thanks for doing this, really."
    ama "Merci de faire ça, vraiment."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3261
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_323f3ee6:

    # bet "It's my job. But also... after talking to the kid... I care."
    bet "C'est mon boulot. Mais aussi... après avoir parlé au gamin... ça me tient à cœur."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3263
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_391f88cf:

    # ama "We have to keep going. The hangar is waiting for us."
    ama "Nous devons continuer. Le hangar nous attend."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3264
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_46ba6c1e:

    # bet "I'm going to stay here. I have no interest in seeing weapons. Let's see if I can find someone to show me this in depth."
    bet "Je vais rester ici. Ça ne m'intéresse pas de voir des armes. Voyons si je peux trouver quelqu'un pour me montrer ça plus en détail."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3265
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_aa2ffe0d:

    # ama "Will you know how to find the meeting room? We have one in forty minutes with the department heads."
    ama "Tu sauras comment trouver la salle de réunion ? On en a une dans quarante minutes avec les chefs de service."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3267
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_542718fc:

    # bet "I hadn't thought about that..."
    bet "Je n'y avais pas pensé..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3268
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_b830a32c:

    # ama "Second door on the right from the elevator on the second floor."
    ama "Deuxième porte à droite depuis l'ascenseur au deuxième étage."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3269
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_9eff3961:

    # bet "I'll find something resembling that and trust my intuition."
    bet "Je trouverai quelque chose qui y ressemble et je ferai confiance à mon intuition."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3272
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_72521cef:

    # mc "How long have we been here? I don't want to be late for the meeting."
    mc "Ça fait combien de temps qu'on est là ? Je ne veux pas être en retard pour la réunion."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3273
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_2bfccbf6:

    # ama "There are forty minutes left. We have some time."
    ama "Il reste quarante minutes. On a un peu de temps."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3274
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_66b76905:

    # mc "What's in the hangar?"
    mc "Qu'est-ce qu'il y a dans le hangar ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3275
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_c47cb59c:

    # ama "Operational vehicles. What we use on the training ground."
    ama "Des véhicules opérationnels. Ce qu'on utilise sur le terrain d'entraînement."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3278
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_41701d6a:

    # ama "Main hangar. This is where we keep the vehicles in regular use."
    ama "Hangar principal. C'est ici qu'on garde les véhicules utilisés régulièrement."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3279
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_dd2ebd94:

    # mc "There are more than I thought."
    mc "Il y en a plus que je ne le pensais."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3280
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_bcc6af59:

    # ama "NTR operates in varied environments. We need versatility."
    ama "La NTR opère dans des environnements variés. On a besoin de polyvalence."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3281
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_777b2cc3:

    # mc "Can you explain them to me?"
    mc "Tu peux m'expliquer ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3283
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_14786c38:

    # ama "Light vehicles for recon and rapid deployment. Trucks for logistics and personnel."
    ama "Véhicules légers pour la reconnaissance et le déploiement rapide. Camions pour la logistique et le personnel."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3284
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_0a4a32b3:

    # ama "AFVs for areas with moderate resistance. And IFVs for direct combat operations."
    ama "Des VBC pour les zones à résistance modérée. Et des VCI pour les opérations de combat direct."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3285
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_d4107052:

    # ama "Many of them are captures we've brought to the base so we can train with them and get to know different types of vehicles."
    ama "Beaucoup d'entre eux sont des prises de guerre qu'on a ramenées à la base pour s'entraîner avec et apprendre à connaître différents types de véhicules."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3296
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_0ce93641:

    # "You follow her gestures with your eyes, trying to guess which vehicle corresponds to which acronym. You're only able to name the trucks."
    "Tu suis ses gestes des yeux, en essayant de deviner quel véhicule correspond à quel acronyme. Tu n'arrives à nommer que les camions."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3286
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_18a46dcd:

    # mc "Are these the vehicles we rent out to other companies?"
    mc "Ce sont les véhicules qu'on loue à d'autres compagnies ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3288
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_3a71b47d:

    # ama "Some of them. In most infiltration missions we don't use land vehicles, or they're provided for us at the destination."
    ama "Certains d'entre eux. Dans la plupart des missions d'infiltration, on n'utilise pas de véhicules terrestres, ou ils nous sont fournis à destination."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3289
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_734bc7f6:

    # ama "Most of them are used for training or transport."
    ama "La plupart servent à l'entraînement ou au transport."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3290
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_49346031:

    # mc "Wait. Is that a tank over there?"
    mc "Attends. C'est un tank là-bas ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3303
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_a17f9edc:

    # ama "That one?"
    ama "Celui-là ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3294
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_b5e6776f:

    # ama "No, that isn't a tank."
    ama "Non, ce n'est pas un tank."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3295
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_27d7305e:

    # mc "It looks like a tank."
    mc "Ça ressemble à un tank."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3296
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_f9bba86a:

    # ama "It has tracks, a turret, and a cannon. I get it. But it's not a tank."
    ama "Il a des chenilles, une tourelle et un canon. Je comprends. Mais ce n'est pas un tank."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3308
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_535a70b6:

    # "She seems genuinely surprised that you don't know. To you, it still looks like a tank."
    "Elle semble sincèrement surprise que tu ne saches pas. Pour toi, ça ressemble toujours à un tank."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4093
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_0b7ce2f7:

    # "She seems genuinely surprised that you don't know. It still looks like a tank to you."
    "Elle semble sincèrement surprise que tu ne saches pas. Ça ressemble toujours à un tank pour toi."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3297
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_65325c94:

    # mc "What is it then?"
    mc "C'est quoi alors ?"


# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3298
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_3122cafb:

    # ama "An IFV. Infantry Fighting Vehicle. A Bradley, if you want the specific name."
    ama "Un VCI. Véhicule de Combat d'Infanterie. Un Bradley, si tu veux le nom exact."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3299
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_9f66fff7:

    # ama "That one in particular came out of Lebanon a few years ago."
    ama "Celui-là en particulier a été ramené du Liban il y a quelques années."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3300
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_2399641f:

    # mc "What's the difference between an IFV and a tank?"
    mc "C'est quoi la différence entre un VCI et un char ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3302
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_e8712b86:

    # ama "A tank is designed to destroy other armored vehicles and fortified positions."
    ama "Un char est conçu pour détruire d'autres véhicules blindés et des positions fortifiées."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3303
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_261cb618:

    # ama "The IFV carries infantry into combat and provides fire support. It's a different philosophy."
    ama "Le VCI transporte l'infanterie au combat et fournit un appui feu. C'est une philosophie différente."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3304
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_44e6c996:

    # mc "And NTR doesn't have tanks?"
    mc "Et NTR n'a pas de chars ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3306
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_fdb1c96e:

    # ama "No. We don't even need them."
    ama "Non. On n'en a même pas besoin."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3307
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_442d7fdf_1:

    # mc "Why not?"
    mc "Pourquoi ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3308
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_11187978:

    # ama "NTR doesn't do conventional warfare. We aren't an army. We do precision operations, espionage, extraction, elimination..."
    ama "NTR ne fait pas dans la guerre conventionnelle. On n'est pas une armée. On fait des opérations de précision, de l'espionnage, de l'extraction, de l'élimination..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3309
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_d4dcc286:

    # ama "A tank in that context is a huge logistical problem and a very visible signal."
    ama "Dans ce contexte, un char est un énorme problème logistique et un signal très visible."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3310
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_ac15cdf7:

    # mc "We don't want visibility."
    mc "On ne veut pas de visibilité."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3312
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_58fb179c:

    # ama "Exactly. IFVs give us protection and firepower without announcing that we're coming."
    ama "Exactement. Les VCI nous offrent protection et puissance de feu sans annoncer notre arrivée."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3326
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_974c9428:

    # "Her smile tells you that you guessed right. She looks happy that you're starting to understand her world. A world that's going to be yours too."
    "Son sourire t'indique que tu as deviné juste. Elle a l'air heureuse que tu commences à comprendre son monde. Un monde qui sera bientôt le tien aussi."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3313
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_d3b5cf1c:

    # ama "If one falls into our hands on a mission, we're trained to use it at a basic level, but it's not the norm."
    ama "S'il y en a un qui tombe entre nos mains lors d'une mission, on est formés pour l'utiliser à un niveau basique, mais ce n'est pas la norme."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3314
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_67dcdea5:

    # mc "Makes sense."
    mc "C'est logique."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3316
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_17a38d52:

    # ama "Besides, moving tanks, maintaining them, crewing them... requires infrastructure we don't have here."
    ama "En plus, déplacer des chars, les entretenir, les équiper en personnel... ça demande des infrastructures qu'on n'a pas ici."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3317
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_ce77575f:

    # ama "And capturing a tank is much rarer, so we don't need that training."
    ama "Et capturer un char est beaucoup plus rare, donc on n'a pas besoin de cet entraînement."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3318
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_f4f0bbbf:

    # mc "I see. How many IFVs do we have?"
    mc "Je vois. Combien de VCI on a ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3320
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_62d67e93:

    # ama "Four operational ones of different models. A couple more are non-operational, but we also use them for training."
    ama "Quatre opérationnels de différents modèles. Quelques autres ne sont pas opérationnels, mais on les utilise aussi pour l'entraînement."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4120
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_092456e0:

    # ama "There are eight AFVs. They're like an IFV, but with wheels instead of tracks. In some places they're called the same thing."
    ama "Il y a huit VBC. C'est comme un VCI, mais avec des roues au lieu de chenilles. À certains endroits, on les appelle de la même façon."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3321
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_4851b21c:

    # ama "There are eight AFVs. They're like an IFV but with wheels instead of tracks. In some places they're called the same thing."
    ama "Il y a huit VBC. C'est comme un VCI mais avec des roues au lieu de chenilles. À certains endroits, on les appelle de la même façon."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3322
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_c1661fd9:

    # mc "Does all of this fit in here?"
    mc "Tout ça rentre ici ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3324
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_314abfa6:

    # ama "This is the main hangar of the base. There's another one, even bigger, at the training facilities."
    ama "C'est le hangar principal de la base. Il y en a un autre, encore plus grand, dans les installations d'entraînement."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3325
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_8f8a907a:

    # mc "What about the planes and helicopters?"
    mc "Et pour les avions et les hélicoptères ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3326
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_a3430981:

    # ama "At the airport or the training facilities. They're a bit away from the base."
    ama "À l'aéroport ou dans les installations d'entraînement. Ils sont un peu à l'écart de la base."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3327
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_73982012:

    # mc "How far are they?"
    mc "À quelle distance sont-ils ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3329
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_b637b71b:

    # ama "About three kilometers. Over there is the training ground, the weapons depots, the airstrip, the aircraft hangar, and the other vehicle hangar."
    ama "À environ trois kilomètres. Là-bas se trouvent le terrain d'entraînement, les dépôts d'armes, la piste d'atterrissage, le hangar à avions et l'autre hangar à véhicules."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3330
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_c438ab01:

    # mc "Why are they separate?"
    mc "Pourquoi sont-ils séparés ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3331
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_d531339f:

    # ama "Security and logistics. If something fails at one point, it doesn't compromise the other."
    ama "Pour des raisons de sécurité et de logistique. Si quelque chose échoue à un endroit, ça ne compromet pas l'autre."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3332
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_fb8daad5:

    # mc "Will we see it today?"
    mc "On va le voir aujourd'hui ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3334
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_60167086:

    # ama "We don't have time before the meeting. I'll schedule it for tomorrow if you want."
    ama "Nous n'avons pas le temps avant la réunion. Je vais le programmer pour demain si tu veux."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3335
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_c9243ff0:

    # mc "Yes. I want to see everything."
    mc "Oui. Je veux tout voir."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3336
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_3d9906cf:

    # ama "I figured."
    ama "Je m'en doutais."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3338
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_27f0abd1:

    # mc "Hey."
    mc "Hé."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3339
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_45b012e8:

    # ama "Yeah?"
    ama "Ouais ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3340
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_29e72cc7:

    # mc "This is really big."
    mc "C'est vraiment énorme."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3341
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_af45e037_1:

    # ama "I know."
    ama "Je sais."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3342
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_e39094cc:

    # mc "I don't mean it in a logistical sense, nor am I referring to the base. I mean it in the sense of... it's a lot of responsibility."
    mc "Je ne dis pas ça d'un point de vue logistique, et je ne parle pas de la base. Je veux dire dans le sens où... ça fait beaucoup de responsabilités."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3343
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_c1fc5fcc:

    # mc "While we were at home everything was very abstract. Now I'm seeing that it's... real."
    mc "Quand on était à la maison, tout ça était très abstrait. Maintenant je vois que c'est... réel."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3345
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_8f0140e6:

    # ama "I know that too."
    ama "Je le sais aussi."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3346
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_2437b094:

    # mc "And you think I can handle this?"
    mc "Et tu penses que je peux gérer ça ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3347
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_4f80d06f:

    # ama "I wouldn't have supported you if I didn't believe it."
    ama "Je ne t'aurais pas soutenu si je n'y croyais pas."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3348
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_b2ff6979:

    # mc "That doesn't exactly answer my question."
    mc "Ça ne répond pas exactement à ma question."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3350
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_64b655c1:

    # ama "*Laugh* Yes it does. You just have to listen carefully to the answer."
    ama "*Rire* Si, ça y répond. Il faut juste écouter attentivement la réponse."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3351
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_63fd57b4:

    # mc "You're very direct when you want to be."
    mc "Tu es très directe quand tu le veux."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3352
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_18975b19:

    # ama "*Laugh* I'm always direct. The thing is, this place..."
    ama "*Rire* Je suis toujours directe. Le truc, c'est que cet endroit..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3353
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_51492c4a:

    # mc "Is coming back getting to you?"
    mc "Ça te fait quelque chose de revenir ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3355
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_ca001451:

    # ama "A little. This company needed a real change, not a cosmetic one."
    ama "Un peu. Cette entreprise avait besoin d'un vrai changement, pas juste de façade."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3356
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_7bf6aaa2:

    # ama "What you've planned for today, the meeting in a little while..."
    ama "Ce que tu as prévu pour aujourd'hui, la réunion de tout à l'heure..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3357
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_445ce296:

    # ama "That's not what the previous CEO did. Not at all."
    ama "Ce n'est pas ce que faisait l'ancien PDG. Pas du tout."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3358
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_cfcb856a:

    # mc "The bar wasn't very high."
    mc "La barre n'était pas bien haute."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3360
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_6517222d:

    # ama "No. But you raised it anyway. That matters. And you haven't even started working yet..."
    ama "Non. Mais tu l'as quand même relevée. Ça compte. Et tu n'as même pas encore commencé à bosser..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3361
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_872828eb:

    # mc "Thanks, Amanda."
    mc "Merci, Amanda."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3362
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_3330b244:

    # ama "Don't thank me yet. There's a lot of work left."
    ama "Ne me remercie pas tout de suite. Il reste beaucoup de boulot."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3363
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_50d8828a:

    # mc "I know."
    mc "Je sais."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3365
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_93634100:

    # ama "We have twenty minutes left before the meeting. Do you have any questions before we go in?"
    ama "Il nous reste vingt minutes avant la réunion. Tu as des questions avant qu'on entre ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3366
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_46661b66:

    # mc "Several. But they can wait."
    mc "Plusieurs. Mais elles peuvent attendre."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3367
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_868eb3a1:

    # ama "Good. Oh, and one more thing."
    ama "Bien. Oh, et encore une chose."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3368
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_a3db9a7f:

    # mc "What?"
    mc "Quoi ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3370
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_827244e5:

    # ama "If they ask something you don't know how to answer, don't pretend you do."
    ama "S'ils te demandent un truc auquel tu ne sais pas répondre, ne fais pas semblant de savoir."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3385
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_6197c694:

    # "It seems the conversation about the not-tank right behind her has opened her eyes to the fact that you're a rookie at this."
    "Il semble que la conversation sur le pseudo-char juste derrière elle lui ait ouvert les yeux sur le fait que tu es un bleu dans ce domaine."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3371
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_aa3d4492:

    # mc "Does that happen a lot in these meetings?"
    mc "Ça arrive souvent dans ces réunions ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3372
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_abe99241:

    # ama "With the department heads, always."
    ama "Avec les chefs de département, toujours."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3373
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_54ae708d:

    # mc "Advice noted."
    mc "C'est noté."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3375
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_e9d0c3cc:

    # ama "They're good at what they do, but they haven't had to answer to anyone for years."
    ama "Ils sont doués dans ce qu'ils font, mais ils n'ont eu de comptes à rendre à personne depuis des années."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3376
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_dc214e2a:

    # mc "Is that a warning?"
    mc "C'est un avertissement ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3377
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_a65f3029:

    # ama "It's context. The warning is that some of them will try to confuse you with technicalities."
    ama "C'est pour le contexte. L'avertissement, c'est que certains d'entre eux vont essayer de t'embrouiller avec des détails techniques."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3378
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_520db1fc:

    # mc "And what do I do?"
    mc "Et qu'est-ce que je dois faire ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3380
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_64550313:

    # ama "Listen. Ask questions. And don't sign anything you don't understand."
    ama "Écoute. Pose des questions. Et ne signe rien que tu ne comprends pas."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3381
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_daf55b5f:

    # mc "Has that happened before?"
    mc "C'est déjà arrivé avant ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3382
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_b2952f57:

    # ama "With Daniels, yes. Several times. He let them do as they pleased as long as they met the objectives."
    ama "Avec Daniels, oui. Plusieurs fois. Il les laissait faire ce qu'ils voulaient tant qu'ils atteignaient les objectifs."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3383
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_6ba3cf84:

    # mc "And how did that end?"
    mc "Et comment ça s'est terminé ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3385
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_d3b0eca8:

    # ama "You know how it ended. Badly. That's why I'm telling you now."
    ama "Tu sais comment ça s'est terminé. Mal. C'est pour ça que je te le dis maintenant."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3386
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_035146fc:

    # mc "Are you going to be in the meeting?"
    mc "Tu seras à la réunion ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3387
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_0051c6a3:

    # ama "By your side. The whole time. I'm not going to leave you alone among the sharks."
    ama "À tes côtés. Tout le temps. Je ne vais pas te laisser seul au milieu des requins."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3388
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_9a2a7c2b:

    # mc "Good."
    mc "Bien."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3391
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_b5ecfb44:

    # "At the door of the meeting room, a few minutes later..."
    "À la porte de la salle de réunion, quelques minutes plus tard..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3392
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_e7c0540e:

    # ama "Anything else before we go in?"
    ama "Autre chose avant qu'on entre ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3393
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_5956fca8:

    # mc "Yeah. One thing."
    mc "Ouais. Une chose."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3394
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_ebe0f4ba:

    # ama "Tell me."
    ama "Dis-moi."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3395
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_8d0e1a50:

    # mc "I want to meet with the clones. With the operatives."
    mc "Je veux rencontrer les clones. Les agents."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3397
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_63f13e2e:

    # ama "When? Today?"
    ama "Quand ? Aujourd'hui ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3398
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_9c149142:

    # mc "After the department heads meeting. If possible."
    mc "Après la réunion des chefs de département. Si possible."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3400
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_5c8cd1b7:

    # ama "[aar] told me they've formed a committee. To talk to you in an organized manner."
    ama "[aar] m'a dit qu'ils ont formé un comité. Pour te parler de manière organisée."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3401
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_185554ac:

    # mc "Perfect. That's exactly what I want."
    mc "Parfait. C'est exactement ce que je veux."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3402
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_0b2f1aca:

    # ama "When do you suggest?"
    ama "Tu suggères quand ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3403
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_06d1e40e:

    # mc "An hour after we finish with the department heads. Is that doable?"
    mc "Une heure après avoir fini avec les chefs de département. C'est faisable ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3419
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_c39437dd:

    # mc "I need to talk to [car] and IT Support. I can meet with the clones in between."
    mc "Je dois parler à [car] et au support informatique. Je peux rencontrer les clones entre les deux."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3405
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_30108ff2:

    # ama "I can set that up. Give me a second to let them know so they can be ready in a couple of hours."
    ama "Je peux organiser ça. Donne-moi une seconde pour les prévenir pour qu'ils soient prêts dans quelques heures."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3406
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_eca8e830:

    # mc "Good. I don't want it to seem like an imposition. I want them to know I'm the one asking."
    mc "Bien. Je ne veux pas que ça paraisse être une obligation. Je veux qu'ils sachent que c'est moi qui le demande."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3407
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_a647bd2d:

    # ama "I'll let them know."
    ama "Je vais les prévenir."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3408
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_b2516466:

    # mc "Thanks."
    mc "Merci."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3410
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_df4ae749:

    # ama "Do you know what you're going to say to them?"
    ama "Tu sais ce que tu vas leur dire ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3411
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_7bcfe1d1:

    # mc "Not yet. But I know I'm going to listen to them."
    mc "Pas encore. Mais je sais que je vais les écouter."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3412
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_3a6c3597:

    # ama "That's enough to start with."
    ama "C'est suffisant pour commencer."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3413
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_31fd88d8:

    # mc "Do you think they'll trust me?"
    mc "Tu penses qu'ils me feront confiance ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3415
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_0969eb05:

    # ama "Some of them will. Others will need time. It's normal."
    ama "Certains oui. D'autres auront besoin de temps. C'est normal."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3416
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_e703eb26:

    # mc "And do you trust me?"
    mc "Et toi, tu me fais confiance ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3417
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_d3a517c8:

    # ama "I've told you before. There's no one I trust more than you when it comes to this."
    ama "Je te l'ai déjà dit. Il n'y a personne en qui j'ai plus confiance que toi quand il s'agit de ça."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3418
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_a223bcfb:

    # mc "I know, but I like hearing it."
    mc "Je sais, mais j'aime l'entendre."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3420
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_0a05c01e:

    # ama "*Laugh* I'm not going to repeat it again or it'll end up going to your head."
    ama "*Rires* Je ne vais pas le répéter, sinon ça va te monter à la tête."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3421
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_c03e6302:

    # mc "*Laugh* Alright. I had to try."
    mc "*Rires* D'accord. Il fallait que j'essaie."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3422
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_3673040a:

    # ama "Come on. The meeting awaits us."
    ama "Allez. La réunion nous attend."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3423
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_63cd8ebd:

    # mc "Let's go."
    mc "Allons-y."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3424
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_de79a378:

    # "[ama] sends a couple of text messages before going in."
    "[ama] envoie quelques SMS avant d'entrer."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3425
translate french c31s006_baseArrival_1d1dfe8b:

    # "A chill runs down your spine."
    "Un frisson te parcourt l'échine."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2869
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_23940c53:

    # "Upon entering the room, everyone sits down quickly. [gav]'s future arm looks impressive."
    "En entrant dans la salle, tout le monde s'assoit rapidement. Le futur bras de [gav] est impressionnant."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2870
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_13f81308:

    # "You have to hold yourself back from going over to look at it in detail. It looks like something out of a sci-fi movie."
    "Tu dois te retenir d'aller l'examiner en détail. On dirait un truc sorti d'un film de science-fiction."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2871
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_824948ce:

    # "You realize you're going to hate this room as soon as you walk in. It's dark and oppressive. Right in line with the company's image."
    "Tu te rends compte que tu vas détester cette salle dès que tu y entres. Elle est sombre et oppressante. Parfaitement en accord avec l'image de l'entreprise."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2873
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_b5425eca:

    # "[aar] makes the introductions. Nobody stands up to shake your hand."
    "[aar] fait les présentations. Personne ne se lève pour te serrer la main."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2874
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_68e75baa:

    # aar "[flo], Head of the Commercial Department."
    aar "[flo], Directeur du Département Commercial."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2876
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_f7532d1f:

    # aar "[vin], Head of the Financial Department."
    aar "[vin], Directeur du Département Financier."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2878
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_3f0b9abf:

    # aar "[mael], Head of the Cloning and Medicine Department."
    aar "[mael], Directeur du Département de Clonage et de Médecine."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2880
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_54f4ccaf:

    # aar "[cal], Cloning and Medicine Department."
    aar "[cal], Département de Clonage et de Médecine."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2881
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_a694a0a1:

    # "You notice the absence of the title 'Head' when naming [cal]. He's the designer of the arm."
    "Vous remarquez l'absence du titre de 'Directeur' en nommant [cal]. C'est le concepteur du bras."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2883
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_4412ee22:

    # mc "Good. Thank you all for coming."
    mc "Bien. Merci à tous d'être venus."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2885
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_6c0fdd61:

    # "You point to the electromechanical arm before continuing. You would have liked to examine it closely before starting the meeting."
    "Vous montrez du doigt le bras électromécanique avant de continuer. Vous auriez aimé l'examiner de près avant de commencer la réunion."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2886
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_e86b371d:

    # "Everyone looks at it, following the direction your hand is pointing."
    "Tout le monde le regarde, suivant la direction que pointe votre main."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2887
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_36cd575a:

    # mc "I know it's not the most conventional way to start a management meeting, but I wanted it here."
    mc "Je sais que ce n'est pas la façon la plus conventionnelle de commencer une réunion de direction, mais je le voulais ici."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2888
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_ad70f504:

    # mc "To remind myself, and to remind you, of what we're capable of when we look in the right direction."
    mc "Pour me rappeler, et pour vous rappeler, ce dont nous sommes capables quand nous regardons dans la bonne direction."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2890
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_d321dd09:

    # mc "Before getting down to business, I'd like each of you to give me a summary of your area."
    mc "Avant de passer aux choses sérieuses, j'aimerais que chacun de vous me fasse un résumé de son secteur."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2891
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_aa402515:

    # mc "What state is the company in? No sugarcoating. Let's start with you, [aar]."
    mc "Dans quel état se trouve l'entreprise ? Pas de langue de bois. Commençons par toi, [aar]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2893
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_233b51bd:

    # aar "Alright. The Operations Area is active and running at full capacity."
    aar "Très bien. Le secteur des opérations est actif et tourne à plein régime."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2894
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_560d333d:

    # aar "We have signed commitments with several clients for the next two quarters: Colombia, the United States, the United Kingdom, and France."
    aar "Nous avons signé des engagements avec plusieurs clients pour les deux prochains trimestres : la Colombie, les États-Unis, le Royaume-Uni et la France."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2895
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_2ff5a840:

    # aar "In total, there are seven contracts of varying scope, all in the execution or advanced preparation phase."
    aar "Au total, il y a sept contrats d'envergure variable, tous en phase d'exécution ou de préparation avancée."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2896
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_70600eb1:

    # aar "The field teams are operational. There are no serious casualties at the moment, except for [gav]'s case, which you already know about."
    aar "Les équipes sur le terrain sont opérationnelles. Il n'y a pas de pertes graves pour le moment, à l'exception du cas de [gav], dont tu es déjà au courant."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2898
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_96b7f82a:

    # aar "Apart from that, we have several support contracts with other PMCs. Iron Fist and Walküre are our main clients in that area."
    aar "À part ça, nous avons plusieurs contrats de soutien avec d'autres SMP. Iron Fist et Walküre sont nos principaux clients dans ce domaine."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2899
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_0ba968c5:

    # aar "Atlas and Chimera are clients with smaller, but more continuous contracts. I sent you a detailed list of the rest of the clients."
    aar "Atlas et Chimera sont des clients avec des contrats plus petits, mais plus continus. Je t'ai envoyé une liste détaillée du reste des clients."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2900
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_920a77d8:

    # mc "I know. I saw it. And I saw that it included clients we haven't worked with in ten years."
    mc "Je sais. Je l'ai vue. Et j'ai vu qu'elle incluait des clients avec lesquels nous n'avons pas travaillé depuis dix ans."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2902
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_e085fbfc:

    # "[aar] turns a deaf ear to your veiled criticism before continuing."
    "[aar] fait la sourde oreille à ta critique voilée avant de continuer."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2903
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_646688bc:

    # aar "The problem is that all those contracts, both operations and support, have deadlines."
    aar "Le problème est que tous ces contrats, tant les opérations que le soutien, ont des échéances."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2904
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_f55cc2c5:

    # aar "If we touch the operational structure, I need to know with enough time so we don't leave anyone stranded in the middle of a mission."
    aar "Si on touche à la structure opérationnelle, j'ai besoin de le savoir suffisamment à l'avance pour ne laisser personne en plan au milieu d'une mission."


# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2905
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_962b4142:

    # mc "Understood."
    mc "Compris."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2907
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_64d383ed:

    # mc "[flo], Commercial Department?"
    mc "[flo], Département Commercial ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2908
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_003a31f7:

    # flo "The outlook is interesting. We have open negotiations with the Colombian government for three medium-term covert operations."
    flo "Les perspectives sont intéressantes. Nous avons des négociations ouvertes avec le gouvernement colombien pour trois opérations secrètes à moyen terme."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2909
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_b4c7cb3e:

    # flo "With the United States, there are preliminary talks about six extra operations on top of the ones already contracted. Our contact with them is solid."
    flo "Avec les États-Unis, il y a des pourparlers préliminaires pour six opérations supplémentaires en plus de celles déjà sous contrat. Notre contact avec eux est solide."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2910
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_d092d406:

    # flo "The UK and France each have one ongoing operation. I'm in negotiations with France to expand our area of operations to the Sahel."
    flo "Le Royaume-Uni et la France ont chacun une opération en cours. Je suis en négociation avec la France pour étendre notre zone d'opérations au Sahel."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2911
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_a3167936:

    # flo "They're all high-paying, repeat clients."
    flo "Ce sont tous des clients réguliers qui paient très bien."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2913
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_d4bd0ba1:

    # flo "China and Israel have wanted to hire us on several occasions, but Richards never wanted to reach an agreement with them. They pay well."
    flo "La Chine et Israël ont voulu nous engager à plusieurs reprises, mais Richards n'a jamais voulu trouver d'accord avec eux. Ils paient bien."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2914
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_a75bc9e3:

    # flo "North Korea and Iran have reached out several times, but they were vetoed because it could cause us to lose contracts with other clients."
    flo "La Corée du Nord et l'Iran nous ont contactés plusieurs fois, mais ils ont fait l'objet d'un veto car cela pourrait nous faire perdre des contrats avec d'autres clients."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2916
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_128e5c09:

    # flo "That being said... and I know it might sound weird coming from me... I think there's a huge market waiting in the medical sector."
    flo "Cela étant dit... et je sais que ça peut paraître bizarre venant de moi... je pense qu'il y a un marché énorme qui nous attend dans le secteur médical."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2917
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_5b9b1d71:

    # flo "High tech, hospital equipment, and consumer devices."
    flo "La haute technologie, l'équipement hospitalier et les appareils grand public."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2918
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_ee75ed15:

    # flo "If we pivot well, we could compete in a sector with very different margins and much less legal exposure."
    flo "Si on pivote bien, on pourrait être compétitifs dans un secteur avec des marges très différentes et beaucoup moins de risques juridiques."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2919
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_f4046e66:

    # mc "That's exactly the direction I want us to think in. Thank you."
    mc "C'est exactement la direction dans laquelle je veux qu'on réfléchisse. Merci."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2921
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_6f9238d1:

    # mc "[vin], the numbers."
    mc "[vin], les chiffres."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2922
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_b7df0e0b:

    # vin "Yes, the numbers."
    vin "Oui, les chiffres."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2923
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_50a9e85e:

    # vin "Available funds: two hundred twelve million dollars. Monthly operating costs: twenty-six million."
    vin "Fonds disponibles : deux cent douze millions de dollars. Coûts de fonctionnement mensuels : vingt-six millions."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2924
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_58c0faea:

    # vin "Which means that, without new income, we have a little over eight months before the situation gets... uncomfortable."
    vin "Ce qui signifie que, sans nouveaux revenus, nous avons un peu plus de huit mois avant que la situation ne devienne... inconfortable."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2925
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_21c61ebd:

    # "He has one of those voices that makes continental drift seem fun to listen to."
    "Il a une de ces voix qui rendrait la dérive des continents amusante à écouter."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2927
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_9665be25:

    # vin "However, in the next quarter we expect an influx of one hundred eighty-three million from operations already completed and pending collection."
    vin "Cependant, au prochain trimestre, nous prévoyons une rentrée de cent quatre-vingt-trois millions provenant d'opérations déjà terminées et en attente d'encaissement."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2928
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_0536ab7d:

    # vin "So, in strictly financial terms, we're good."
    vin "Donc, en termes strictement financiers, on est bons."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2929
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_94125296:

    # mc "Good good, or good for now?"
    mc "Bons bons, ou bons pour le moment ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2931
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_c626803d:

    # vin "Good for now, as always in this industry. But good."
    vin "Bons pour le moment, comme toujours dans cette industrie. Mais bons."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2932
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_da6f08cb:

    # vin "The previous CEO, Daniels... was of the opinion that the numbers always added up if you knew where to look."
    vin "L'ancien PDG, Daniels... était d'avis que les chiffres tombaient toujours juste si on savait où regarder."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2933
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_46424ae7:

    # mc "Daniels is in prison for things like that, [vin]."
    mc "Daniels est en prison pour des choses comme ça, [vin]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2935
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_9ee1c93a:

    # vin "Yes. I know."
    vin "Oui. Je sais."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2936
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_bf1b3875:

    # "He pauses briefly before continuing."
    "Il fait une brève pause avant de continuer."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2937
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_b4dedfd0:

    # vin "It was just a comment on his accounting philosophy. Not on his other... hobbies."
    vin "C'était juste un commentaire sur sa philosophie comptable. Pas sur ses autres... passe-temps."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2938
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_1b3e3cc3:

    # "You just realized that he has ridiculously small hands."
    "Tu viens de réaliser qu'il a des mains ridiculement petites."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2939
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_e2f3bb15:

    # "It takes a bit of effort to hold back your laughter imagining him counting bills with those hands."
    "Il te faut un peu d'effort pour retenir ton rire en l'imaginant compter des billets avec ces mains-là."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2941
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_157c1ec8:

    # mc "[mael], your turn."
    mc "[mael], à votre tour."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2942
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_43daf923:

    # "[mael]'s attitude makes you uncomfortable."
    "L'attitude de [mael] te met mal à l'aise."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2943
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_7319db52:

    # "It's the attitude of someone who has spent years waiting to be asked this so they can say exactly the opposite of what people want to hear."
    "C'est l'attitude de quelqu'un qui a passé des années à attendre qu'on lui pose cette question pour pouvoir dire exactement le contraire de ce que les gens veulent entendre."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2944
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_9001b5f1:

    # mael "The cloning and genetics department is the real technological core of this company."
    mael "Le département de clonage et de génétique est le véritable cœur technologique de cette entreprise."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2945
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_9f573c51:

    # mael "Everything else, the operations, the contracts, even that arm you have there on the table..."
    mael "Tout le reste, les opérations, les contrats, même ce bras que vous avez là sur la table..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2947
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_a17cf71d:

    # mael "All of that exists because we've spent over 20 years pushing the limits of what biology and science allow."
    mael "Tout cela existe parce que nous avons passé plus de 20 ans à repousser les limites de ce que la biologie et la science permettent."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2948
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_4d7e8f81:

    # mael "We currently have forty-two subjects in advanced stages of gestation. They will be born in the coming weeks."
    mael "Nous avons actuellement quarante-deux sujets à un stade avancé de gestation. Ils naîtront dans les semaines à venir."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2950
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_f33b7a5f:

    # mael "They are viable human beings, and we'll have to decide what to do with them regardless of any strategic decision."
    mael "Ce sont des êtres humains viables, et nous devrons décider quoi en faire, indépendamment de toute décision stratégique."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2951
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_4c67d937:

    # mael "[aar] said you want to shut down the Cloning Department. I think that's a mistake."
    mael "[aar] a dit que vous vouliez fermer le département de clonage. Je pense que c'est une erreur."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2952
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_80b136cb:

    # mc "Why? If we stop producing clones? What exactly do we lose?"
    mc "Pourquoi ? Si on arrête de produire des clones ? Qu'est-ce qu'on perd exactement ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2954
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_d8f998f2:

    # mael "We lose living knowledge. Cloning isn't just a product, it's a process."
    mael "Nous perdons un savoir vivant. Le clonage n'est pas seulement un produit, c'est un processus."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2955
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_3c382f8c:

    # mael "Every batch teaches us something new about gene expression, about cellular differentiation, about the limits of embryonic development."
    mael "Chaque lot nous apprend quelque chose de nouveau sur l'expression génétique, sur la différenciation cellulaire, sur les limites du développement embryonnaire."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2956
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_60d48f74:

    # mael "If we turn off the tap, in five years we'll have lost technical capacity that took us decades to build."
    mael "Si nous fermons le robinet, dans cinq ans nous aurons perdu une capacité technique qu'il nous a fallu des décennies à construire."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2957
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_073cda67:

    # mc "I understand the logic. But... I don't know..."
    mc "Je comprends la logique. Mais... je ne sais pas..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2958
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_aa20c7a3:

    # mc "Couldn't we maintain that knowledge by making... I don't know... animal clones or something? Cloning a loose pancreas for transplants?"
    mc "Ne pourrions-nous pas maintenir ces connaissances en faisant... je ne sais pas... des clones d'animaux ou quelque chose comme ça ? Cloner un pancréas isolé pour des greffes ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2959
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_b5345e3d:

    # "You feel a bit stupid. You should have studied alternatives for NTR's central department."
    "Vous vous sentez un peu stupide. Vous auriez dû étudier des alternatives pour le département central de NTR."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2960
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_8f120e10:

    # "You feel like you're just talking without knowing what you are talking about. You finally understand how [emm] feels a lot of the time."
    "Vous avez l'impression de parler sans savoir de quoi vous parlez. Vous comprenez enfin ce que ressent [emm] la plupart du temps."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2962
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_a69e0430:

    # mael "A loose pancreas?"
    mael "Un pancréas en vrac ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2963
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_53b10eb4:

    # mc "Or whatever. A kidney. I'm just improvising, I'm not a biologist or a geneticist."
    mc "Ou peu importe. Un rein. J'improvise, je ne suis ni biologiste ni généticien."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2964
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_f52d080e:

    # mael "No, yeah... I can see you're improvising."
    mael "Non, ouais... Je vois bien que tu improvises."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2965
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_84fa2f30:

    # "His tone seems to say that if he had a gun in his hands right now, he'd rather pull the trigger than have to deal with you."
    "Son ton semble dire que s'il avait un flingue entre les mains en ce moment, il préférerait appuyer sur la détente plutôt que d'avoir affaire à vous."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2967
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_60ddea4a:

    # "[mael] takes a deep breath before continuing, as if gathering the patience to explain something basic to a child."
    "[mael] prend une grande inspiration avant de continuer, comme s'il rassemblait la patience nécessaire pour expliquer quelque chose de basique à un enfant."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2968
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_4809f22b:

    # mael "Animals would be viable, yes."
    mael "Les animaux seraient viables, oui."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2969
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_146d7360:

    # mael "There wouldn't be any legal problems in Aruba, and from a technical standpoint, it would allow us to maintain the team's skills and keep researching."
    mael "Il n'y aurait aucun problème juridique à Aruba, et d'un point de vue technique, cela nous permettrait de maintenir les compétences de l'équipe et de continuer les recherches."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2970
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_78660419:

    # mael "Pigs, primates, even endangered animals if we want to give it a positive public image angle."
    mael "Des porcs, des primates, même des animaux en voie de disparition si on veut donner un angle positif à notre image publique."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2972
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_0398d4eb:

    # mael "Isolated human organs are a different story."
    mael "Les organes humains isolés, c'est une autre histoire."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2973
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_7e196cab:

    # mael "It's technically possible, but there are huge obstacles: vascularization, immune rejection, maturation outside of a complete organism. It hasn't been solved."
    mael "C'est techniquement possible, mais il y a d'énormes obstacles : la vascularisation, le rejet immunitaire, la maturation en dehors d'un organisme complet. Ça n'a pas été résolu."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2974
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_e9a74422:

    # mael "It would be a research project, not a short-term product."
    mael "Ce serait un projet de recherche, pas un produit à court terme."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2975
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_8941e2bd:

    # mc "But is it worth a try?"
    mc "Mais est-ce que ça vaut le coup d'essayer ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2977
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_fc69572f:

    # mael "I need to study it in more detail before giving you an honest answer."
    mael "Je dois l'étudier plus en détail avant de vous donner une réponse honnête."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2978
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_89babaaa:

    # mael "What I can tell you is that the idea of keeping the department open with that direction... doesn't displease me. In fact, I like it."
    mael "Ce que je peux vous dire, c'est que l'idée de maintenir le département ouvert avec cette orientation... ne me déplaît pas. En fait, ça me plaît bien."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2979
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_cf1ffbc6:

    # "A slight feeling of surprise runs across the table. It seems no one expected [mael] to accept the change so easily."
    "Un léger sentiment de surprise parcourt la table. Il semble que personne ne s'attendait à ce que [mael] accepte le changement aussi facilement."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2981
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_af97d9fc:

    # mael "Most of the medical products that have come out of my department have been happy accidents."
    mael "La plupart des produits médicaux sortis de mon département ont été d'heureux accidents."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2982
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_b4a35668:

    # mael "Side effects of research where we were heading in another direction. Do you know how our rapid pregnancy test came about?"
    mael "Des effets secondaires de recherches où nous nous dirigions dans une autre direction. Savez-vous comment notre test de grossesse rapide a vu le jour ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2984
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_762a101a:

    # flo "The one we'll start marketing in the European Union next month?"
    flo "Celui que nous allons commencer à commercialiser dans l'Union européenne le mois prochain ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2985
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_b415f974:

    # mael "Yes, that exact one."
    mael "Oui, exactement celui-là."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2987
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_fd64c5fa:

    # mael "Well, it came about because we were studying molecular markers in early-stage embryos and one of my researchers detected something weird."
    mael "Eh bien, c'est arrivé parce que nous étudiions les marqueurs moléculaires chez les embryons à un stade précoce et l'un de mes chercheurs a détecté quelque chose de bizarre."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2988
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_1b694428:

    # mael "There was a molecule that the body produces long before hCG levels, the traditional pregnancy hormone, are detectable."
    mael "Il y avait une molécule que le corps produit bien avant que les niveaux d'hCG, l'hormone de grossesse traditionnelle, ne soient détectables."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2989
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_e53d55a4:

    # mael "We detect pregnancies several weeks earlier than any test on the market."
    mael "Nous détectons les grossesses plusieurs semaines plus tôt que n'importe quel test sur le marché."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2991
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_b0910916:

    # mael "Were we looking for that? No. We were looking for something completely different."
    mael "Est-ce qu'on cherchait ça ? Non. On cherchait quelque chose de complètement différent."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2992
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_03400293:

    # mael "But that's how frontier research works. If you close the lab, you also close doors you don't even know are there."
    mael "Mais c'est comme ça que fonctionne la recherche de pointe. Si vous fermez le labo, vous fermez aussi des portes dont vous ignorez même l'existence."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2993
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_43446e1d:

    # mael "The doors might not even exist, or what's behind them might not be worth it, but sometimes..."
    mael "Ces portes n'existent peut-être même pas, ou ce qu'il y a derrière n'en vaut peut-être pas la peine, mais parfois..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2994
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_b6967b68:

    # mc "I get it..."
    mc "J'ai compris..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2996
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_8e10ced4:

    # "[bet], who until that moment had been looking at the arm with the concentration of someone taking a patient's pulse, looks up."
    "[bet], qui jusqu'à ce moment regardait le bras avec la concentration de quelqu'un prenant le pouls d'un patient, lève les yeux."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2997
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_152c853e:

    # bet "Sorry to interrupt... how many of those forty-two subjects have genetic anomalies detected at this stage?"
    bet "Désolée d'interrompre... combien de ces quarante-deux sujets présentent des anomalies génétiques détectées à ce stade ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2998
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_aa92ca51:

    # mael "None. Our clones are perfect within the parameters. Nothing we haven't handled before."
    mael "Aucun. Nos clones sont parfaits selon les paramètres. Rien que nous n'ayons déjà géré."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2999
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_c502921a:

    # bet "And the protocol if there are complications during... birth?"
    bet "Et le protocole s'il y a des complications pendant... la naissance ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3000
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_bed15091:

    # mael "We have an internal medical team specialized in that."
    mael "Nous avons une équipe médicale interne spécialisée là-dedans."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3001
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_dfc3ea70:

    # bet "Neonatologists?"
    bet "Des néonatologistes ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3002
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_4ff43295:

    # mael "Hired externally when necessary."
    mael "Embauchés en externe si nécessaire."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3003
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_715b8968:

    # bet "Alright. Just asking."
    bet "D'accord. Je demandais juste."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3005
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_f82768d2:

    # "[bet] looks at the arm again. She doesn't seem entirely satisfied with the answer, but she doesn't push it."
    "[bet] regarde à nouveau le bras. Elle ne semble pas entièrement satisfaite de la réponse, mais elle n'insiste pas."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3006
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_0c5d71f1:

    # mc "Good. Let's move on. [cal]."
    mc "Bien. Passons à la suite. [cal]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3008
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_41a92896:

    # "[cal] hasn't spoken until now. He has been looking at the arm, just like [bet], although with a very different expression."
    "[cal] n'a pas parlé jusqu'à présent. Il regardait le bras, tout comme [bet], bien qu'avec une expression très différente."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3009
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_19d12001:

    # "That of someone looking proudly at something they built with their own hands because no one paid them enough attention."
    "Celle de quelqu'un qui regarde fièrement quelque chose qu'il a construit de ses propres mains parce que personne ne lui a accordé assez d'attention."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3010
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_92496b3f:

    # "He is one of the few clones who have left field operations and successfully retrained for other roles."
    "Il est l'un des rares clones à avoir quitté les opérations sur le terrain et à s'être reconverti avec succès dans d'autres rôles."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3011
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_dc816664:

    # cal "The arm is functional. All the tests we've been able to run without an actual implantation give results within the expected parameters."
    cal "Le bras est fonctionnel. Tous les tests que nous avons pu effectuer sans implantation réelle donnent des résultats dans les paramètres attendus."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3012
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_a453d02d:

    # cal "The neuromuscular integration system is the most delicate part."
    cal "Le système d'intégration neuromusculaire est la partie la plus délicate."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3013
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_1898ae7a:

    # cal "Basically, we tell the peripheral nervous system that this piece of titanium and rubber is a limb, and we hope it believes it."
    cal "En gros, on dit au système nerveux périphérique que ce morceau de titane et de caoutchouc est un membre, et on espère qu'il y croira."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3015
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_28871556:

    # flo "And does the peri... the nervous system believe it?"
    flo "Et est-ce que le péri... le système nerveux y croit ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3016
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_7aabb92b:

    # cal "The simulation models say yes. But until we do it on a real person, it's just theory."
    cal "Les modèles de simulation disent que oui. Mais tant qu'on ne l'aura pas fait sur une vraie personne, ça reste de la théorie."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3017
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_e11cf90e:

    # flo "Right, right..."
    flo "C'est ça, c'est ça..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3018
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_fe32cd00:

    # "[flo] nods with that kind of nod people do when they're actually thinking about something else. Maybe they're starting to think about where they can sell it."
    "[flo] hoche la tête avec ce genre de signe que font les gens quand ils pensent en fait à autre chose. Peut-être qu'il commence à réfléchir à l'endroit où il pourrait le vendre."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3019
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_2a29672a:

    # mc "What can that arm do that a natural one can't?"
    mc "Qu'est-ce que ce bras peut faire qu'un bras naturel ne peut pas faire ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3021
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_514e0087:

    # cal "In terms of strength, quite a bit more. We're not going to turn [gav] into the Autumn Soldier, just to be clear."
    cal "En termes de force, pas mal de choses en plus. On ne va pas transformer [gav] en Soldat de l'Automne, que ce soit clair."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3022
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_93ecd837:

    # cal "But he will have muscular strength in that arm equivalent to two to three times that of his original arm."
    cal "Mais il aura une force musculaire dans ce bras équivalente à deux ou trois fois celle de son bras d'origine."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3024
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_466e155d:

    # cal "Fine motor control, precision tasks, that's going to require rehabilitation and time. It's a process."
    cal "La motricité fine, les tâches de précision, ça va demander de la rééducation et du temps. C'est un processus."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3025
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_1db19429:

    # cal "It's not an instant upgrade; it's a recovery with added perks."
    cal "Ce n'est pas une amélioration instantanée ; c'est une convalescence avec des avantages supplémentaires."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3026
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_35859867:

    # mc "And could we do the same with other limbs? Legs, for example? Or hands...?"
    mc "Et pourrions-nous faire la même chose avec d'autres membres ? Les jambes, par exemple ? Ou les mains... ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3028
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_bbb8fa51:

    # cal "In principle, the architecture can be extrapolated. Legs have more mass, more structural load, the balance system adds complexity..."
    cal "En principe, l'architecture peut être extrapolée. Les jambes ont plus de masse, plus de charge structurelle, le système d'équilibre ajoute de la complexité..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3029
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_ae5be5b0:

    # cal "A hand or a forearm would be simple to design based on the arm. The problem would be the total weight and battery life."
    cal "Une main ou un avant-bras serait simple à concevoir en se basant sur le bras. Le problème serait le poids total et l'autonomie de la batterie."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3031
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_1b4c2492:

    # cal "But if [gav]'s surgery goes well, I don't see why not."
    cal "Mais si l'opération de [gav] se passe bien, je ne vois pas pourquoi pas."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3032
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_4c4d1ff4:

    # cal "It's work, not magic. And we've already done the hardest part."
    cal "C'est du travail, pas de la magie. Et on a déjà fait le plus dur."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3034
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_7554c245:

    # bet "How long have you been developing this?"
    bet "Depuis combien de temps développez-vous ça ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3035
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_9dd5abb2:

    # cal "Seven years. In my free time."
    cal "Sept ans. Sur mon temps libre."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3036
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_31e6f40a:

    # bet "In your free time?"
    bet "Sur votre temps libre ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3037
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_64d26b3a:

    # cal "The company didn't consider it a priority until I put the prototype on the table."
    cal "L'entreprise ne considérait pas ça comme une priorité jusqu'à ce que je pose le prototype sur la table."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3039
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_9326bc02:

    # bet "And do you have...?"
    bet "Et vous avez... ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3040
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_9296ded0:

    # cal "A mechanical hand? Me? No. I never made it that high up the priority list."
    cal "Une main mécanique ? Moi ? Non. Je ne suis jamais monté aussi haut dans la liste des priorités."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3041
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_dbf775cd:

    # bet "Well, that's the first thing we should fix when we're done with [gav]."
    bet "Eh bien, c'est la première chose qu'on devrait régler quand on aura fini avec [gav]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3043
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_a1aac41c:

    # "[bet] looks at you apologetically in case she overstepped."
    "[bet] vous regarde d'un air désolé au cas où elle aurait dépassé les bornes."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3044
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_8e1a0aed:

    # "[cal] says nothing, but looks at you with a mix of anticipation and hope."
    "[cal] ne dit rien, mais vous regarde avec un mélange d'anticipation et d'espoir."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3045
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_8cbf93b6:

    # mc "I agree with that proposal."
    mc "Je suis d'accord avec cette proposition."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3046
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_ad04ddba:

    # vin "From a budgetary standpoint, an additional unit of the prototype shouldn't be a..."
    vin "D'un point de vue budgétaire, une unité supplémentaire du prototype ne devrait pas être un..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3047
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_2ff084c3:

    # mc "[vin], it's not a budgetary decision. It's a debt."
    mc "[vin], ce n'est pas une décision budgétaire. C'est une dette."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3048
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_f8dca959:

    # vin "Understood."
    vin "Compris."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3050
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_d1155cd4:

    # flo "If you'll allow me to get back to the commercial side for a moment..."
    flo "Si vous me permettez de revenir à l'aspect commercial un instant..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3051
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_590b3479:

    # flo "If [gav]'s operation is a success, and I'm convinced it will be, we're looking at something that doesn't exist anywhere else."
    flo "Si l'opération de [gav] est un succès, et je suis convaincu qu'elle le sera, nous sommes face à quelque chose qui n'existe nulle part ailleurs."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3053
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_8c744874:

    # flo "There is no prosthesis on the market with this level of neuromuscular integration."
    flo "Il n'y a aucune prothèse sur le marché avec ce niveau d'intégration neuromusculaire."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3054
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_82b40b02:

    # flo "None. I've studied it and the most advanced competitors are years away."
    flo "Aucune. J'ai étudié la question et les concurrents les plus avancés ont des années de retard."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3055
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_65a0f41a:

    # flo "The potential market is huge: military, civilians, elite athletes, workplace accidents, degenerative diseases..."
    flo "Le marché potentiel est énorme : militaires, civils, athlètes de haut niveau, accidents du travail, maladies dégénératives..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3056
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_788216b8:

    # flo "We could go from the premium hospital segment to medical insurance agreements. It's exactly the kind of high-tech product you were talking about, [mc]."
    flo "Nous pourrions passer du segment hospitalier premium aux accords d'assurance médicale. C'est exactement le genre de produit high-tech dont vous parliez, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3057
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_0325cf8a:

    # mc "That's exactly it."
    mc "C'est exactement ça."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3059
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_081f9d77:

    # ama "Although the patent issue would have to be resolved first. If this was developed inside the company in... free time, you said?"
    ama "Bien que le problème des brevets doive être résolu en premier. Si cela a été développé au sein de l'entreprise pendant... du temps libre, vous avez dit ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3060
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_4d33f325:

    # cal "Yes."
    cal "Oui."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3061
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_5b5b1de6:

    # ama "That could create ambiguity in intellectual property. We'd need to clean that up before launching to market."
    ama "Cela pourrait créer une ambiguïté au niveau de la propriété intellectuelle. Nous devrions clarifier ça avant de lancer sur le marché."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3062
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_729cfafb:

    # cal "Whatever is necessary."
    cal "Tout ce qui sera nécessaire."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3063
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_8ef747fc:

    # mc "Good. Then let's recap what we have on the table, literally and metaphorically."
    mc "Bien. Alors récapitulons ce que nous avons sur la table, littéralement et métaphoriquement."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3065
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_b89df83f:

    # mc "The covert operations committed for the next two quarters will be carried out. [aar], we're not going to leave any contracts unfulfilled."
    mc "Les opérations secrètes engagées pour les deux prochains trimestres seront menées à bien. [aar], nous n'allons laisser aucun contrat inachevé."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3066
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_99d46b80:

    # aar "Thank you."
    aar "Merci."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3068
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_afbdee79:

    # mc "[flo], negotiations with Colombia and the United States are moving forward for now."
    mc "[flo], les négociations avec la Colombie et les États-Unis avancent pour le moment."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3069
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_c8c77ded:

    # mc "China and Israel need to be studied carefully. North Korea and Iran remain banned, or we run the risk of sanctions."
    mc "La Chine et Israël doivent être étudiés attentivement. La Corée du Nord et l'Iran restent bannis, sinon nous courons le risque de sanctions."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3070
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_bc3fbb39:

    # mc "But I want you to start exploring contacts in the medical sector in parallel."
    mc "Mais je veux que vous commenciez à explorer des contacts dans le secteur médical en parallèle."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3071
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_79762cb3:

    # mc "Hospitals, insurance companies, healthcare investment funds. Not for tomorrow, but I want to know what's out there."
    mc "Hôpitaux, compagnies d'assurance, fonds d'investissement dans la santé. Pas pour demain, mais je veux savoir ce qu'il y a sur le marché."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3072
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_e5df2b21:

    # mc "I also want to know what technologies we have that can be sold or manufactured, and whose commercial possibilities we haven't explored yet."
    mc "Je veux aussi savoir quelles technologies nous possédons qui peuvent être vendues ou fabriquées, et dont nous n'avons pas encore exploré les possibilités commerciales."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3073
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_605259e4:

    # flo "Consider it done."
    flo "Considérez que c'est fait."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3075
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_569c1da7:

    # mc "[mael], I want a report in two weeks on the real viability of keeping the cloning department focused on animals and organ research."
    mc "[mael], je veux un rapport dans deux semaines sur la viabilité réelle de maintenir le département de clonage concentré sur les animaux et la recherche d'organes."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3076
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_00eb2451:

    # mc "No compromises, just data."
    mc "Pas de compromis, juste des données."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3077
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_d30b29a9:

    # mael "Two weeks. Understood."
    mael "Deux semaines. Compris."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3078
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_0e2e7a77:

    # mc "The forty-two subjects currently in gestation... we're going to guarantee they get a proper welcome and are given a suitable outcome, whatever that may be."
    mc "Les quarante-deux sujets actuellement en gestation... nous allons garantir qu'ils reçoivent un accueil approprié et qu'on leur donne une issue convenable, quelle qu'elle soit."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3079
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_84c837a9:

    # mc "We're not who we used to be. I don't think they'll become field operatives."
    mc "Nous ne sommes plus ce que nous étions. Je ne pense pas qu'ils deviendront des agents de terrain."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3081
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_854445a9:

    # mc "[vin], I need you to prepare three financial scenarios for me."
    mc "[vin], j'ai besoin que vous me prépariez trois scénarios financiers."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3082
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_e4d39871:

    # mc "One with the company as it is, one with the gradual shutdown of covert operations, and one with a serious investment in the medical division."
    mc "Un avec l'entreprise telle qu'elle est, un avec l'arrêt progressif des opérations secrètes, et un avec un investissement sérieux dans la division médicale."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3083
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_1d0a32fe:

    # mc "Real numbers, not optimistic projections."
    mc "De vrais chiffres, pas des projections optimistes."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3084
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_d267c4b5:

    # vin "When?"
    vin "Pour quand ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3085
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_b3e51eee:

    # mc "Next week."
    mc "La semaine prochaine."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3086
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_4783c894:

    # vin "Sure."
    vin "Bien sûr."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3088
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_85ec888d:

    # mc "[ama], operational security during the transition. I need no one on the outside to know we're changing course until we're ready to announce it ourselves."
    mc "[ama], la sécurité opérationnelle pendant la transition. Je veux que personne à l'extérieur ne sache que nous changeons de cap jusqu'à ce que nous soyons prêts à l'annoncer nous-mêmes."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3089
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_4a06d11e:

    # ama "Understood."
    ama "Compris."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3091
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_11b93c94:

    # mc "And [cal]..."
    mc "Et [cal]..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3092
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_3a412510:

    # mc "What you and your team have done is extraordinary."
    mc "Ce que toi et ton équipe avez fait est extraordinaire."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3093
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_f483d35b:

    # mc "I want [gav]'s operation to be a success, and I want you to have your hand."
    mc "Je veux que l'opération de [gav] soit un succès, et je veux que tu aies ta main."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3094
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_6312b14e:

    # mc "In that order, but I want both."
    mc "Dans cet ordre, mais je veux les deux."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3095
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_e4a4f714:

    # cal "Agreed."
    cal "D'accord."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3097
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_80ede5b5:

    # bet "I've reviewed the implantation protocol three times and I have some suggestions for the procedure that I'd like to discuss with you, [cal], before going into surgery."
    bet "J'ai revu le protocole d'implantation trois fois et j'ai quelques suggestions pour la procédure dont j'aimerais discuter avec toi, [cal], avant de passer au bloc."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3098
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_6e5a6591:

    # cal "Whenever you want."
    cal "Quand tu veux."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3099
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_1027abb3:

    # bet "This afternoon?"
    bet "Cet après-midi ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3100
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_4643f46b:

    # cal "This afternoon."
    cal "Cet après-midi."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3102
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_ef97fcde:

    # flo "Do you know what would be a perfect marketing story?"
    flo "Vous savez ce qui ferait une histoire marketing parfaite ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3103
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_8ca89ddc:

    # flo "The engineer who designed the prosthesis because he needed it, receiving the prosthesis he designed. That's worth more than any ad campaign."
    flo "L'ingénieur qui a conçu la prothèse parce qu'il en avait besoin, recevant la prothèse qu'il a conçue. Ça vaut plus que n'importe quelle campagne publicitaire."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3104
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_e4888b9b:

    # cal "I'm not an ad campaign, [flo]."
    cal "Je ne suis pas une campagne publicitaire, [flo]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3105
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_139e482b:

    # flo "I know. That's why it would work."
    flo "Je sais. C'est pour ça que ça marcherait."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3107
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_ee5012d9:

    # ama "[flo]..."
    ama "[flo]..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3108
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_1c50af4c:

    # flo "What? It's true."
    flo "Quoi ? C'est vrai."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3109
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_e25971c4:

    # ama "It is true. And even so..."
    ama "C'est vrai. Et même si..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3110
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_1b9e71c5:

    # vin "If we're done with the emotional part... can we wrap up this meeting? I have to prepare three reports..."
    vin "Si on en a fini avec la partie émotionnelle... on peut conclure cette réunion ? Je dois préparer trois rapports..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3111
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_4aab074c:

    # mc "I don't think there's anything else to talk about."
    mc "Je ne pense pas qu'il y ait autre chose dont on doive parler."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3113
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_271e4c07:

    # "People start getting up."
    "Les gens commencent à se lever."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3114
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_0fc156a4:

    # "[bet] slowly walks around the table and stops next to the electromechanical arm. She looks at it closely, without touching it, as if she were reading something written on it."
    "[bet] contourne lentement la table et s'arrête à côté du bras électromécanique. Elle le regarde de près, sans le toucher, comme si elle lisait quelque chose écrit dessus."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3115
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_19d2a449:

    # bet "How much does it weigh? It looks heavier than in the specs you sent me."
    bet "Combien ça pèse ? Ça a l'air plus lourd que dans les spécifications que vous m'avez envoyées."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3117
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_6be20864:

    # cal "This is the prototype. It weighs a little more than the one you'll implant. Four kilos, one hundred grams. And it doesn't have the batteries."
    cal "C'est le prototype. Il pèse un peu plus que celui que vous allez implanter. Quatre kilos, cent grammes. Et il n'a pas les batteries."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3118
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_87a6afc6:

    # cal "The one you'll put on [gav], three kilos, eight hundred grams in total."
    cal "Celui que vous allez mettre sur [gav], trois kilos, huit cents grammes au total."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3119
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_67a68b86:

    # "He sounds like a proud father."
    "Il a l'air d'un père fier."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3121
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_9a8b8a88:

    # bet "Less than I expected."
    bet "Moins que ce à quoi je m'attendais."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3122
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_709652dc:

    # cal "It was a design requirement. If it weighs too much, the shoulder pays for it in the long run."
    cal "C'était une exigence de conception. S'il pèse trop lourd, l'épaule en paie le prix à long terme."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3123
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_4328d08d:

    # bet "You thought of everything."
    bet "Vous avez pensé à tout."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3124
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_2e29ef91:

    # cal "I had seven years to do it."
    cal "J'ai eu sept ans pour le faire."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3126
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_5e264f03:

    # vin "*Muttering to himself* Daniels also thought he had everything figured out."
    vin "*Marmonnant pour lui-même* Daniels aussi pensait avoir tout compris."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3127
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_0f8ef23c:

    # "You prefer not to answer and head with [ama] to your office to review the files of the clones you'll be meeting with in a little over an hour."
    "Tu préfères ne pas répondre et tu te diriges avec [ama] vers ton bureau pour examiner les dossiers des clones que tu vas rencontrer dans un peu plus d'une heure."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3129
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_31652e76:

    # "You stop for a moment in front of a window."
    "Tu t'arrêtes un instant devant une fenêtre."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3130
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_017a6969:

    # "Outside, the Caribbean shines in the distance with that perfect indifference the sea has when it doesn't know someone is watching it."
    "Dehors, les Caraïbes brillent au loin avec cette parfaite indifférence qu'a la mer quand elle ignore qu'on l'observe."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3131
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_38152f55:

    # "Someone who has just inherited an illegal enterprise and who has the intention, still without a precise shape, to turn it into something different."
    "Quelqu'un qui vient d'hériter d'une entreprise illégale et qui a l'intention, encore sans forme précise, d'en faire quelque chose de différent."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:3132
translate french c31s006_departmentMeeting_d4666650:

    # "It's a good start. Or at least, it's a start."
    "C'est un bon début. Ou du moins, c'est un début."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2541
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_5d882aa2:

    # "Later, back in the meeting room and after the introductions..."
    "Plus tard, de retour dans la salle de réunion et après les présentations..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2542
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_d9a84e78:

    # mc "Thank you all for coming on such short notice. I know this is new for a lot of you."
    mc "Merci à tous d'être venus avec un préavis aussi court. Je sais que c'est nouveau pour beaucoup d'entre vous."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2543
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_36093761:

    # mc "First of all, let me introduce myself. I'm [mc] Marks and I'm acting as the new CEO. This is as new to me as it is to you."
    mc "Tout d'abord, permettez-moi de me présenter. Je suis [mc] Marks et j'agis en tant que nouveau PDG. C'est aussi nouveau pour moi que pour vous."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2544
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_92a548af:

    # mc "My intention is to listen to you. You have the floor to raise whatever you need."
    mc "Mon intention est de vous écouter. Vous avez la parole pour soulever tout ce dont vous avez besoin."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2546
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_40b3e942:

    # aar "We appreciate the gesture, [mc]. The guys have been wanting to talk to management for a while. They've never been given this opportunity before."
    aar "Nous apprécions le geste, [mc]. Les gars voulaient parler à la direction depuis un moment. On ne leur a jamais donné cette opportunité auparavant."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2548
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_0a0a0928:

    # ama "[mc] wanted this meeting to be open and unfiltered. You can speak freely."
    ama "[mc] voulait que cette réunion soit ouverte et sans filtre. Vous pouvez parler librement."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2549
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_f2431388:

    # ama "[mc] is... different from the previous management."
    ama "[mc] est... différent de la direction précédente."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2551
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_5920525f:

    # dam "Seriously? We can ask for whatever we want?"
    dam "Sérieusement ? On peut demander tout ce qu'on veut ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2552
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_52e3172c:

    # dam "Because I have a pretty interesting list..."
    dam "Parce que j'ai une liste plutôt intéressante..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2554
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_267a1e65:

    # gav "[dam], please. Let's start with what's important. We agreed on a series of points yesterday."
    gav "[dam], s'il te plaît. Commençons par ce qui est important. Nous nous sommes mis d'accord sur une série de points hier."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2556
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_6545731e:

    # fred "[gav] is right. There are urgent matters on the table."
    fred "[gav] a raison. Il y a des questions urgentes sur la table."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2558
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_d22e1119:

    # carl "I've prepared a summary of the requests we agreed on in the previous meeting."
    carl "J'ai préparé un résumé des demandes sur lesquelles nous nous sommes mis d'accord lors de la réunion précédente."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2559
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_b62c57a5:

    # carl "If it's alright with you, I'll go over them one by one."
    carl "Si ça vous va, je vais les passer en revue une par une."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2560
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_bec1d115:

    # mc "Go ahead, Carl."
    mc "Vas-y, Carl."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2562
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_98cff6b5:

    # carl "The first request is of a personal nature. The operatives want to be able to grow beards, or change their haircuts. The current regulations prohibit it."
    carl "La première demande est d'ordre personnel. Les agents veulent pouvoir se laisser pousser la barbe ou changer de coupe de cheveux. Le règlement actuel l'interdit."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2563
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_11aa53e4:

    # carl "[aar] is the only operative you'll see with a beard on base, and that's because he let it grow while he was... off duty."
    carl "[aar] est le seul agent que vous verrez avec une barbe sur la base, et c'est parce qu'il l'a laissée pousser pendant qu'il était... en dehors du service."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2565
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_d3af2b5f:

    # dam "I've been wanting to grow a beard for two years. Two years!"
    dam "Ça fait deux ans que je veux me laisser pousser la barbe. Deux ans !"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2567
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_1a59eca7:

    # gav "It's a matter of identity. For us... it means more than it seems."
    gav "C'est une question d'identité. Pour nous... ça signifie plus qu'il n'y paraît."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2568
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_a2603103:

    # mc "I understand. Is there any operational reason to keep that restriction, [ama]?"
    mc "Je comprends. Y a-t-il une raison opérationnelle de maintenir cette restriction, [ama] ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2570
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_5fe2c92c:

    # ama "None that I can see. In some infiltration missions it might be relevant, but that can be handled on a case-by-case basis."
    ama "Aucune que je puisse voir. Dans certaines missions d'infiltration, ça pourrait être pertinent, mais ça peut être géré au cas par cas."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2571
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_012f0ad6:

    # ama "As long as it doesn't interfere with the equipment... gas masks, helmets, night vision goggles... I don't see a problem."
    ama "Tant que ça n'interfère pas avec l'équipement... masques à gaz, casques, lunettes de vision nocturne... je n'y vois pas d'inconvénient."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2572
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_70a1e99b:

    # mc "Alright. From now on, every operative can wear whatever personal style they prefer."
    mc "Très bien. À partir de maintenant, chaque agent peut adopter le style personnel qu'il préfère."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2573
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_e379e758:

    # mc "If there's a mission that requires a specific look, you'll be notified in advance."
    mc "S'il y a une mission qui nécessite une apparence spécifique, vous serez prévenus à l'avance."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2575
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_350bba27:

    # gav "Thank you, [mc]. Really."
    gav "Merci, [mc]. Vraiment."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2576
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_dafd1765:

    # fred "It was the bare minimum, but it's appreciated."
    fred "C'était le strict minimum, mais c'est apprécié."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2577
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_b7ad0f36:

    # dam "Finally! I'm going to grow some epic sideburns."
    dam "Enfin ! Je vais me laisser pousser des favoris épiques."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2578
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_c9821169:

    # aar "[dam]..."
    aar "[dam]..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2580
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_6e6be4ea:

    # dam "What? It's legit!"
    dam "Quoi ? J'ai le droit !"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2582
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_5edb2419:

    # "Carl decides to ignore his partner and continue with the requests."
    "Carl décide d'ignorer son partenaire et de continuer avec les requêtes."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2583
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_6445500f:

    # carl "The second request is more delicate. It's about Eric."
    carl "La deuxième requête est plus délicate. Ça concerne Eric."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2584
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_443be3c6:

    # fred "Eric has been detained for a month, accused of treason."
    fred "Eric est détenu depuis un mois, accusé de trahison."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2585
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_290f8b0f:

    # dam "I never liked him... I didn't like anyone from E, but it's unfair."
    dam "Je ne l'ai jamais aimé... Je n'aimais personne de E, mais c'est injuste."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2586
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_09fdf597:

    # aar "He acted against the owners of the company, yes. But there's context."
    aar "Il a agi contre les propriétaires de l'entreprise, oui. Mais il y a un contexte."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2587
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_19c6561a:

    # mc "I know. I was reviewing the file. He was following Daniels' orders. He was his superior..."
    mc "Je sais. J'examinais le dossier. Il suivait les ordres de Daniels. C'était son supérieur..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2589
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_ff5c7a7f:

    # ama "A superior who is now also under arrest, by the way."
    ama "Un supérieur qui est maintenant aussi en état d'arrestation, d'ailleurs."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2590
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_6054290a:

    # ama "A superior who ordered the murders of my sisters, the A's, and your family."
    ama "Un supérieur qui a ordonné les meurtres de mes sœurs, les A, et de ta famille."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2592
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_43ce085f:

    # gav "Nobody is saying Eric is a good guy, far from it. But he was caught in the crossfire. He didn't have a real choice."
    gav "Personne ne dit qu'Eric est un mec bien, loin de là. Mais il a été pris entre deux feux. Il n'avait pas vraiment le choix."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2594
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_97c7d6f5:

    # fred "We didn't have one either, back in those days. We did what we were told... Or there were consequences."
    fred "Nous n'en avions pas non plus, à l'époque. Nous faisions ce qu'on nous disait... Ou il y avait des conséquences."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2595
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_ef160ee3:

    # fred "I was in the other operation at that time... We were misled, and if Eric should be arrested, [gav] or I should be too."
    fred "J'étais dans l'autre opération à ce moment-là... Nous avons été induits en erreur, et si Eric doit être arrêté, [gav] ou moi devrions l'être aussi."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2596
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_a4e84d83:

    # mc "I'm aware of that. The previous structure left no room for disobedience."
    mc "J'en suis conscient. La structure précédente ne laissait aucune place à la désobéissance."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2598
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_d1d190a1:

    # fred "I'm sorry, [ama]..."
    fred "Je suis désolé, [ama]..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2599
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_f9671a0f:

    # "[ama] doesn't bother to answer. Beatrice and Diana died at the hands of the group [fred] belonged to."
    "[ama] ne prend pas la peine de répondre. Beatrice et Diana sont mortes aux mains du groupe auquel [fred] appartenait."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2601
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_a52d66e4:

    # dam "Eric is not a traitor. He's someone who survived however he could. He remained loyal to whoever was in command at the time."
    dam "Eric n'est pas un traître. C'est quelqu'un qui a survécu comme il a pu. Il est resté loyal à celui qui commandait à ce moment-là."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2603
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_a33e4933:

    # carl "The formal request is his immediate release and the dropping of the charges."
    carl "La demande officielle est sa libération immédiate et l'abandon des poursuites."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2604
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_7218061a:

    # mc "I'm not going to make that decision lightly today. I need to review the whole case."
    mc "Je ne vais pas prendre cette décision à la légère aujourd'hui. J'ai besoin de revoir tout le dossier."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2605
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_587a9a90:

    # mc "But I give you my word that I will look into it personally. Eric will have a fair review."
    mc "Mais je vous donne ma parole que je vais m'y pencher personnellement. Eric aura droit à un examen équitable."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2606
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_defcc6d3:

    # carl "We'll settle for that. For now, sir."
    carl "On s'en contentera. Pour l'instant, monsieur."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2607
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_e32a1a09:

    # "That 'sir' at the end of the sentence almost sounds like a challenge for you not to keep your word."
    "Ce « monsieur » à la fin de la phrase sonne presque comme un défi de ne pas tenir votre parole."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2609
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_bd556b53:

    # carl "Third request: the operatives request a leave system to go off-base."
    carl "Troisième demande : les agents demandent un système de permission pour sortir de la base."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2610
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_bc448111:

    # carl "Currently, they cannot leave the perimeter without an active mission."
    carl "Actuellement, ils ne peuvent pas quitter le périmètre sans mission active."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2612
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_aa45883c:

    # fred "We've gone years without being able to go to a bar, to the movies, to see anyone."
    fred "Ça fait des années qu'on n'a pas pu aller dans un bar, au cinéma, ou voir qui que ce soit."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2613
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_e0add868:

    # dam "Without being able to get laid, let's get to the important stuff."
    dam "Sans pouvoir tirer un coup, venons-en à l'essentiel."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2614
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_30c6f52e:

    # gav "Without being able to breathe any air other than this."
    gav "Sans pouvoir respirer un autre air que celui-ci."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2615
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_dd5407b0:

    # aar "It's one of the harshest restrictions. It keeps them isolated from the world."
    aar "C'est l'une des restrictions les plus dures. Ça les garde isolés du monde."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2616
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_c76ddba6:

    # mc "Is that literal? You can't leave under any circumstances?"
    mc "C'est au sens propre ? Vous ne pouvez sortir sous aucun prétexte ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2618
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_2da319ae:

    # ama "That was the rule, yes. Total movement control."
    ama "C'était la règle, oui. Un contrôle total des mouvements."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2619
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_36e05359:

    # mc "That's... unacceptable. You aren't prisoners."
    mc "C'est... inacceptable. Vous n'êtes pas des prisonniers."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2621
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_17a3be4b:

    # fred "For years they treated us like we were."
    fred "Pendant des années, ils nous ont traités comme si nous l'étions."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2622
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_660a0965:

    # mc "That's over. We're going to establish a leave system immediately."
    mc "C'est terminé. Nous allons mettre en place un système de sorties immédiatement."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2623
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_653c9398:

    # mc "Individual outings with reasonable notice. No asking for permission like you're children."
    mc "Des sorties individuelles avec un préavis raisonnable. Plus besoin de demander la permission comme si vous étiez des enfants."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2625
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_11db2a81:

    # gav "Seriously?"
    gav "Sérieusement ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2626
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_5f6a2c7a:

    # mc "Seriously. You're no longer slaves. You never should have been."
    mc "Sérieusement. Vous n'êtes plus des esclaves. Vous n'auriez jamais dû l'être."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2627
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_c9bdddee:

    # aar "That... means a lot, [mc]. More than you can imagine."
    aar "Ça... signifie beaucoup, [mc]. Plus que tu ne peux l'imaginer."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2628
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_6f54b9bc:

    # dam "Yeah! Freedom! First stop: anywhere but here!"
    dam "Ouais ! La liberté ! Premier arrêt : n'importe où sauf ici !"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2629
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_3df29d04:

    # fred "Thank you, [mc]."
    fred "Merci, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2631
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_50973adb:

    # "There's a brief silence in the room. Several of the clones exchange glances."
    "Il y a un bref silence dans la pièce. Plusieurs clones échangent des regards."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2632
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_db0ff1e8:

    # "You don't know them well enough yet to interpret those glances, but you detect a hint of hope."
    "Tu ne les connais pas encore assez bien pour interpréter ces regards, mais tu détectes une lueur d'espoir."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2634
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_3a371344:

    # carl "The fourth request is related to [gav]."
    carl "La quatrième requête concerne [gav]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2635
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_907ec0ae:

    # carl "The operatives want everyone who lost limbs or suffered serious injuries to receive the same treatment that has been approved for [gav]."
    carl "Les agents veulent que tous ceux qui ont perdu des membres ou subi de graves blessures reçoivent le même traitement que celui qui a été approuvé pour [gav]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2636
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_66a8af5e:

    # carl "Within what's possible and the availability of prosthetics and other devices, of course."
    carl "Dans la limite du possible et de la disponibilité des prothèses et autres dispositifs, bien sûr."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2638
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_003f416c:

    # gav "It doesn't seem fair that I get this opportunity and the others don't. There are several other guys with amputations. And others with permanent damage."
    gav "Ça ne me semble pas juste que j'aie cette opportunité et pas les autres. Il y a plusieurs autres gars avec des amputations. Et d'autres avec des séquelles permanentes."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2639
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_d8f8a3d1:

    # mc "How many operatives are in that situation?"
    mc "Combien d'agents sont dans cette situation ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2641
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_e55778cc:

    # aar "With amputations, 19 counting [gav]. [gav] is the most... recent. And the only one we have a prosthesis ready for."
    aar "Avec des amputations, 19 en comptant [gav]. [gav] est le plus... récent. Et le seul pour qui nous avons une prothèse de prête."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2642
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_09d2579d:

    # aar "They were working on what's going to be his prosthesis before the... incident."
    aar "Ils travaillaient sur ce qui sera sa prothèse avant l'... incident."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2643
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_6e9ec8f2:

    # aar "With severe permanent injuries, another six or seven."
    aar "Avec des blessures permanentes graves, six ou sept autres."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2644
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_d26e96d6:

    # aar "[carl] would fall into this category because of his eye, for example, but we don't have any device that can help him."
    aar "[carl] entrerait dans cette catégorie à cause de son œil, par exemple, mais nous n'avons aucun appareil qui puisse l'aider."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2646
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_3b3e3fd0:

    # ama "High-end prosthetics don't grow on trees. We'd have to look into the development costs."
    ama "Les prothèses haut de gamme ne poussent pas sur les arbres. Il faudrait qu'on se penche sur les coûts de développement."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2647
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_09d3f3e7:

    # ama "I don't even know what we have available, apart from [gav]'s arm."
    ama "Je ne sais même pas ce que nous avons de disponible, à part le bras de [gav]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2648
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_aa3483b3:

    # mc "I know. But it's the right thing to do. I can't look the other way."
    mc "Je sais. Mais c'est la bonne chose à faire. Je ne peux pas détourner le regard."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2649
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_8ffdce37:

    # mc "I can't promise it'll be immediate, but it's on my list of real priorities."
    mc "Je ne peux pas promettre que ce sera immédiat, mais c'est sur ma liste de vraies priorités."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2650
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_97f8a630:

    # mc "I'll talk to Caleb. If he was able to make the prototype in his free time..."
    mc "J'en parlerai à Caleb. S'il a réussi à fabriquer le prototype pendant son temps libre..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2652
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_b503035e:

    # fred "That's good enough for us for now."
    fred "C'est suffisant pour nous pour le moment."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2653
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_4d7e5b76:

    # gav "Thank you, [mc]. For all of them."
    gav "Merci, [mc]. Pour eux tous."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2654
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_8be5769f:

    # dam "Hey, what if they give me a prosthetic arm even though I have both of mine..."
    dam "Hé, et s'ils me donnaient un bras prothétique même si j'ai déjà les deux miens..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2655
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_732c07b7:

    # dam "Would I have three arms? Asking for scientific curiosity."
    dam "Est-ce que j'aurais trois bras ? Je demande par curiosité scientifique."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2657
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_488b001f:

    # carl "[dam]..."
    carl "[dam]..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2658
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_7c5120c7:

    # dam "Just kidding. Mostly."
    dam "Je plaisante. Enfin, presque."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2660
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_6b0ae0e2:

    # carl "Fifth request: Salary. The operatives feel that the compensation does not reflect the risk or the nature of their work."
    carl "Cinquième requête : le salaire. Les agents estiment que la rémunération ne reflète pas les risques ni la nature de leur travail."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2661
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_8f3e2338:

    # "At that moment, you realize what's weird every time [carl] speaks."
    "À ce moment-là, tu réalises ce qui est bizarre à chaque fois que [carl] parle."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2662
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_7dec5d66:

    # "He never says 'we' or 'the clones'. He always talks about 'the operatives', as if he wants to distance himself emotionally from the requests."
    "Il ne dit jamais 'nous' ou 'les clones'. Il parle toujours des 'agents', comme s'il voulait prendre une distance émotionnelle par rapport aux requêtes."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2664
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_fd08ef19:

    # fred "We've gone years without any income... Just two things: room and board."
    fred "Nous avons passé des années sans aucun revenu... Juste deux choses : le gîte et le couvert."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2665
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_51009217:

    # fred "You said we aren't slaves. But that sounds a lot like slavery. Without a salary, we'll remain so."
    fred "Tu as dit que nous n'étions pas des esclaves. Mais ça y ressemble beaucoup. Sans salaire, nous le resterons."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2666
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_f3d381eb:

    # mc "That's a reasonable request. I'm not going to say no."
    mc "C'est une demande raisonnable. Je ne vais pas dire non."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2667
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_b0308632:

    # mc "But I need to sit down and review the numbers before committing to concrete figures."
    mc "Mais je dois m'asseoir et examiner les chiffres avant de m'engager sur des montants concrets."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2669
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_96d356a7:

    # ama "NTR's finances aren't at their best after the last few months, [fred]."
    ama "Les finances de NTR ne sont pas au mieux après ces derniers mois, [fred]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2670
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_6e9d39d7:

    # mc "Even so, this has to change. The company owes it to you."
    mc "Même ainsi, ça doit changer. L'entreprise vous le doit."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2672
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_1eb2cb12:

    # gav "No one expects you to solve it today, [mc]."
    gav "Personne ne s'attend à ce que tu règles ça aujourd'hui, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2673
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_8209b7f8:

    # dam "I do, a little."
    dam "Un peu, ouais."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2674
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_1758e8bc:

    # fred "[dam]..."
    fred "[dam]..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2675
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_dac900f8:

    # dam "I'm kidding. Sort of."
    dam "Je déconne. En quelque sorte."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2676
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_25abb483:

    # dam "But I think a 40%% raise would be good."
    dam "Mais je pense qu'une augmentation de 40%% serait pas mal."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2678
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_885eaeec:

    # gav "You realize that 40%% of zero is still zero, right?"
    gav "Tu te rends compte que 40%% de zéro, ça fait toujours zéro, hein ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2679
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_f5cd6f0f:

    # fred "Wasn't there another D that could come to this meeting?"
    fred "Il n'y avait pas un autre D qui pouvait venir à cette réunion ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2680
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_2ebc5798:

    # carl "The Ds... There's not much to choose from..."
    carl "Les D... Y a pas trop le choix..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2681
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_6fae1d7d:

    # dam "Hey! We're the best..."
    dam "Hé ! On est les meilleurs..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2682
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_df3c1e0f:

    # aar "Yeah, at talking bullshit."
    aar "Ouais, pour dire des conneries."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2683
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_44a5e86c:

    # mc "Be patient. But know that I take it seriously."
    mc "Soyez patients. Mais sachez que je prends ça au sérieux."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2685
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_f017a5ef:

    # dam "Speaking of compensation... I had another request that I don't think made it to the agenda."
    dam "En parlant de compensation... J'avais une autre requête qui, je crois, n'a pas été mise à l'ordre du jour."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2686
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_7798aff2:

    # dam "What about sports cars? One for each operative. At least for those of us old enough to drive..."
    dam "Et pourquoi pas des voitures de sport ? Une pour chaque agent. Du moins pour ceux d'entre nous qui sont en âge de conduire..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2688
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_90cb4332:

    # carl "[dam], we already discussed that in the previous meeting. We ruled it out in the first five minutes."
    carl "[dam], on en a déjà discuté lors de la dernière réunion. On a écarté l'idée dans les cinq premières minutes."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2690
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_55506672:

    # dam "Yeah, but it seems [mc] is open to things we thought he'd reject. Maybe he sees it differently."
    dam "Ouais, mais il semble que [mc] soit ouvert à des choses qu'on pensait qu'il rejetterait. Peut-être qu'il voit ça différemment."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2691
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_a78db22b:

    # carl "He'll see it the same way we do. It's an absurd request. He's already used the excuse of funds..."
    carl "Il verra ça de la même façon que nous. C'est une demande absurde. Il a déjà utilisé l'excuse des fonds..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2692
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_4d5c0c4f:

    # dam "It's a legitimate employee wellness request!"
    dam "C'est une demande légitime pour le bien-être des employés !"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2693
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_bd3ad819:

    # carl "A Ferrarini isn't employee wellness, [dam]."
    carl "Une Ferrarini, ce n'est pas du bien-être pour les employés, [dam]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2694
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_e4a1a67c:

    # dam "And what do you know? Have you ever tried driving a Ferrarini?"
    dam "Et qu'est-ce que t'en sais ? T'as déjà essayé de conduire une Ferrarini ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2695
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_8f6962fb:

    # gav "[dam], please..."
    gav "[dam], s'il te plaît..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2696
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_9e391f69:

    # mc "I appreciate the enthusiasm, [dam]. But I think we can focus the budget on other things."
    mc "J'apprécie l'enthousiasme, [dam]. Mais je pense qu'on peut concentrer le budget sur d'autres choses."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2698
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_d8f2cdcc:

    # ama "Much more urgent things."
    ama "Des choses bien plus urgentes."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2699
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_2f9869dc:

    # dam "Fine. But let the record show that I tried."
    dam "D'accord. Mais que le procès-verbal indique que j'ai essayé."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2700
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_4ed99d1c:

    # aar "Noted, noted. Don't worry. I'm also going to put on the record that you're an idiot."
    aar "C'est noté, c'est noté. T'inquiète pas. Je vais aussi consigner dans le dossier que t'es un idiot."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2702
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_ff0bb406:

    # carl "Getting back to the salaries. The request includes that the salary, if approved, be retroactive. Going back several years."
    carl "Pour en revenir aux salaires. La demande inclut que le salaire, s'il est approuvé, soit rétroactif. Remontant à plusieurs années."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2704
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_4cf65e13:

    # fred "We've been working for a long time without getting paid what we deserved. It's a real debt. And not just a financial one."
    fred "Ça fait un bail qu'on bosse sans être payés ce qu'on mérite. C'est une vraie dette. Et pas seulement financière."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2705
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_c9697095:

    # fred "Starting to pay us now won't fix the historical injustice."
    fred "Commencer à nous payer maintenant ne réparera pas l'injustice historique."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2706
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_45c8c975:

    # mc "I understand the logic. And you're right. Morally and legally."
    mc "Je comprends la logique. Et vous avez raison. Moralement et légalement."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2707
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_351a5f1f:

    # mc "The problem is that right now there aren't enough funds to cover that amount."
    mc "Le problème, c'est qu'en ce moment, il n'y a pas assez de fonds pour couvrir ce montant."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2709
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_ef2f9cea:

    # gav "How much are we talking about?"
    gav "On parle de combien ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2710
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_888f293b:

    # ama "With the accumulated years and the number of operatives, it would be a very substantial amount."
    ama "Avec les années accumulées et le nombre d'agents, ce serait un montant très substantiel."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2711
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_76829767:

    # fred "We know. But that doesn't make the debt disappear."
    fred "On sait. Mais ça ne fait pas disparaître la dette pour autant."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2712
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_d8b6fce0:

    # dam "Of course not. We work. We risk our lives. We deserve recognition."
    dam "Bien sûr que non. On bosse. On risque nos vies. On mérite d'être reconnus."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2713
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_c142e264:

    # mc "You're right. Completely. But if I promise something I can't deliver, I'll be failing you just like the previous management."
    mc "Vous avez raison. Totalement. Mais si je promets un truc que je ne peux pas tenir, je vous laisserai tomber tout comme l'ancienne direction."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2714
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_0582f20e:

    # mc "I need to look into how to compensate you in another way."
    mc "Il faut que je cherche comment vous dédommager autrement."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2716
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_eb822c4e:

    # fred "In what way?"
    fred "De quelle façon ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2717
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_34d2d78e:

    # mc "I don't know yet. But I'll figure it out. I promise you."
    mc "Je ne sais pas encore. Mais je vais trouver. Je vous le promets."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2719
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_61d93fdf:

    # carl "With all due respect, [mc], we've heard promises before."
    carl "Avec tout le respect que je vous dois, [mc], on a déjà entendu des promesses."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2720
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_40646422:

    # mc "I know, [carl]. And I understand that those promises don't mean much to you anymore."
    mc "Je sais, [carl]. Et je comprends que ces promesses ne signifient plus grand-chose pour vous."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2721
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_f351a33a:

    # mc "I can only ask for time and prove it with actions."
    mc "Je ne peux que demander du temps et le prouver par des actes."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2723
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_75deed05:

    # gav "Listen to me for a moment. We've been in this meeting for half an hour."
    gav "Écoutez-moi un instant. Ça fait une demi-heure qu'on est en réunion."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2724
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_a4b4835f:

    # gav "We're talking about the promises that were made to us and weren't kept. And the best of those promises was improving the ranch."
    gav "On parle des promesses qui nous ont été faites et qui n'ont pas été tenues. Et la meilleure de ces promesses était d'améliorer le ranch."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2726
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_270d8286:

    # gav "[mc] said yes to the beards and the time off. He promised to look into Eric's situation, the prosthetics, and the wages."
    gav "[mc] a dit oui pour les barbes et les congés. Il a promis de se pencher sur la situation d'Eric, les prothèses et les salaires."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2727
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_5e468e30:

    # gav "Daniels wouldn't even let us in this room. And Richards, before him, wasn't much better at this."
    gav "Daniels ne nous laissait même pas entrer dans cette pièce. Et Richards, avant lui, n'était pas beaucoup mieux pour ça."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2728
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_8247a637:

    # gav "Let's give him the benefit of the doubt. At least for a while..."
    gav "Accordons-lui le bénéfice du doute. Au moins pour un temps..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2730
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_3af2bc72:

    # fred "It's true. You're right."
    fred "C'est vrai. Tu as raison."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2731
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_7cf0ccd8:

    # dam "You're getting a new arm and he promised to take you with him to the States. It's normal for you to support him..."
    dam "Tu vas avoir un nouveau bras et il a promis de t'emmener avec lui aux États-Unis. C'est normal que tu le soutiennes..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2732
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_3698fcc9:

    # carl "I don't think [gav]'s support has anything to do with that."
    carl "Je ne pense pas que le soutien de [gav] ait quoi que ce soit à voir avec ça."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2734
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_1db3544a:

    # gav "It has nothing to do with that, [dam]. I promise you. I was there when... the Eric thing happened. Daniels would never have acted the way [mc] did."
    gav "Ça n'a rien à voir avec ça, [dam]. Je te le promets. J'étais là quand... le truc avec Eric est arrivé. Daniels n'aurait jamais agi comme [mc] l'a fait."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2735
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_6f6ba7bf:

    # gav "He probably would have ordered [ama] and [eva] to execute us all."
    gav "Il aurait probablement ordonné à [ama] et [eva] de tous nous exécuter."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2736
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_e1f6efbe:

    # mcp "(At that time I didn't even know their names. It wouldn't have occurred to me to order them to do anything.)"
    mcp "(À ce moment-là, je ne connaissais même pas leurs noms. Il ne me serait pas venu à l'esprit de leur ordonner de faire quoi que ce soit.)"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2737
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_68908b9b:

    # mcp "(And having you killed wouldn't be among the orders I would have given them, if I could have given them any.)"
    mcp "(Et vous faire tuer ne ferait pas partie des ordres que je leur aurais donnés, si j'avais pu leur en donner.)"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2738
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_cf677da0:

    # gav "I'm not saying we should settle for crumbs. But we have to recognize the difference."
    gav "Je ne dis pas qu'on devrait se contenter de miettes. Mais on doit reconnaître la différence."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2739
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_d2466246:

    # gav "[mc] is listening. That's already something none of us expected a month ago... Or an hour ago."
    gav "[mc] est à l'écoute. C'est déjà quelque chose qu'aucun de nous n'attendait il y a un mois... Ou il y a une heure."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2741
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_64dd59a0:

    # dam "[gav] is right. And I, being the biggest complainer, admit it."
    dam "[gav] a raison. Et moi, qui suis le plus gros râleur, je l'admets."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2742
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_e3efb808:

    # aar "The kid's got a good head on his shoulders. I mean [gav], not [dam]..."
    aar "Le gamin a la tête sur les épaules. Je parle de [gav], pas de [dam]..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2743
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_38f4ac6a:

    # mc "Thanks, [gav]. That... means a lot."
    mc "Merci, [gav]. Ça... signifie beaucoup pour moi."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2744
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_4ebd9be0:

    # ama "And they aren't just empty promises. [mc] has been working on this for days since he took over."
    ama "Et ce ne sont pas que des promesses en l'air. [mc] travaille là-dessus depuis des jours depuis qu'il a pris la relève."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2745
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_8d81aa3d:

    # ama "[aar] and I have flooded him with information. Think about it, it can't be easy for him either."
    ama "[aar] et moi l'avons inondé d'informations. Pensez-y, ça ne doit pas être facile pour lui non plus."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2747
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_0ee149c1:

    # carl "I think we're demanding that [mc] take responsibility for the mistakes of the previous management. It's his first day here and so far he's listening to us."
    carl "Je pense que nous exigeons que [mc] assume la responsabilité des erreurs de l'ancienne direction. C'est son premier jour ici et jusqu'à présent, il nous écoute."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2748
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_708f9b21:

    # carl "I'm not saying we should give up on our demands, but I think we should give him the benefit of the doubt."
    carl "Je ne dis pas que nous devrions abandonner nos revendications, mais je pense que nous devrions lui accorder le bénéfice du doute."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2749
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_a4ba8285:

    # "Surprisingly, everyone nods. You realize you're starting to like [carl]. And you think he's starting to like you too."
    "Étonnamment, tout le monde hoche la tête. Vous réalisez que vous commencez à bien aimer [carl]. Et vous pensez qu'il commence à bien vous aimer aussi."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2751
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_e1766345:

    # carl "Let's continue, then. The next request is the most important one for many of us."
    carl "Continuons, alors. La prochaine requête est la plus importante pour beaucoup d'entre nous."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2752
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_260fe742:

    # carl "The operatives want to be able to choose their future. Their position within NTR. And, in the long term, to be able to terminate their contracts if they so decide."
    carl "Les agents veulent pouvoir choisir leur avenir. Leur position au sein de NTR. Et, à long terme, pouvoir résilier leurs contrats s'ils le décident."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2754
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_cbc49dee:

    # "The room falls silent for a few seconds. It's the request they're most excited about of all the ones they've made. You can read it on their faces."
    "La pièce devient silencieuse pendant quelques secondes. C'est la requête qui les enthousiasme le plus parmi toutes celles qu'ils ont faites. Vous pouvez le lire sur leurs visages."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2755
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_3a9dd54b:

    # aar "This is the one that matters most to us. To all of us."
    aar "C'est celle qui compte le plus pour nous. Pour nous tous."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2756
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_534c6c70:

    # fred "We don't want to be anyone's property. We were already the company's property once, and [aar] told us that it's not going to happen again."
    fred "Nous ne voulons être la propriété de personne. Nous avons déjà été la propriété de l'entreprise autrefois, et [aar] nous a dit que ça n'allait pas se reproduire."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2757
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_50d8828a:

    # mc "I know."
    mc "Je sais."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2758
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_985d148b:

    # dam "We want to be able to say 'I want to leave' and have it be a real option. Not a sentence."
    dam "On veut pouvoir dire 'Je veux partir' et que ce soit une vraie option. Pas une condamnation."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2759
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_afd3c51c:

    # gav "Or stay. But let it be our choice."
    gav "Ou rester. Mais que ce soit notre choix."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2760
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_45aef16d:

    # mc "I hear you. And I understand you."
    mc "Je vous entends. Et je vous comprends."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2761
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_42d9f9ce:

    # mc "Changing positions within the company: we can start structuring that shortly."
    mc "Changer de poste au sein de l'entreprise : on peut commencer à structurer ça sous peu."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2762
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_417a1c7d:

    # mc "That everyone can apply for different roles, train, grow. Of course. As long as the person is qualified for that role."
    mc "Que chacun puisse postuler pour différents rôles, se former, évoluer. Bien sûr. Tant que la personne est qualifiée pour ce rôle."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2764
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_f83340c0:

    # "None of them can hide their smile... Or their surprise."
    "Aucun d'eux ne peut cacher son sourire... Ou sa surprise."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2765
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_bfe72352:

    # ama "We'll have to create an internal promotion system, but it's viable."
    ama "Il faudra créer un système de promotion interne, mais c'est viable."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2766
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_b4efce6e:

    # mc "As for terminating contracts... that's more complex."
    mc "Pour ce qui est de la résiliation des contrats... c'est plus complexe."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2767
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_04621e4a:

    # mc "Not because I don't want to allow it, but because there are legal and security implications regarding your own origins."
    mc "Pas parce que je ne veux pas l'autoriser, mais parce qu'il y a des implications juridiques et de sécurité concernant vos propres origines."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2768
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_c60be5bb:

    # mc "You are people. You deserve to choose. But I have to make sure that leaving protects you."
    mc "Vous êtes des personnes. Vous méritez de choisir. Mais je dois m'assurer que partir vous protège."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2769
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_aa2b0b0e:

    # mc "I don't want to sound patronizing, but I also don't want you to leave and have the outside world treat you worse than this place did."
    mc "Je ne veux pas avoir l'air condescendant, mais je ne veux pas non plus que vous partiez et que le monde extérieur vous traite pire qu'ici."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2771
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_f1fcd014:

    # fred "Is that a 'no'?"
    fred "C'est un 'non' ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2772
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_a81552cd:

    # mc "It's a 'we'll work together on it, so it's a yes in due time. Soon'."
    mc "C'est un 'on va y travailler ensemble, donc c'est un oui en temps voulu. Bientôt'."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2773
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_26733e06:

    # aar "I don't think we can expect a more positive answer on this matter."
    aar "Je ne pense pas qu'on puisse espérer une réponse plus positive à ce sujet."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2774
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_15a2dd8e:

    # gav "I'm staying. For the record. But I want to know that I could leave if I wanted to."
    gav "Je reste. Pour info. Mais je veux savoir que je pourrais partir si j'en avais envie."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2775
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_265ba84f:

    # mc "That's exactly what we're going to guarantee. Not today, but we will."
    mc "C'est exactement ce qu'on va garantir. Pas aujourd'hui, mais on le fera."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2776
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_7c3256b6:

    # mc "And I want to work with you so that no one wants to terminate that contract."
    mc "Et je veux travailler avec vous pour que personne n'ait envie de résilier ce contrat."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2778
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_cb1f10de:

    # "[carl] has a smile on his face as he begins to speak. You're becoming more and more convinced that he likes what he's hearing in this meeting."
    "[carl] a un sourire aux lèvres lorsqu'il commence à parler. Tu es de plus en plus convaincu qu'il apprécie ce qu'il entend lors de cette réunion."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2779
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_9b6d484d:

    # carl "Last request on the official list. We're requesting documentation with alternative identities."
    carl "Dernière demande sur la liste officielle. Nous voulons des papiers avec des identités alternatives."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2780
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_2a81a620:

    # carl "Passports and other documentation with real names so we can move around the world with some degree of normalcy."
    carl "Des passeports et autres documents avec de vrais noms pour qu'on puisse se déplacer dans le monde avec un minimum de normalité."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2781
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_2c7ff0f4:

    # mc "That's... illegal. And I wouldn't even know where to start. It's complicated territory..."
    mc "C'est... illégal. Et je ne saurais même pas par où commencer. C'est un terrain compliqué..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2783
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_87443324:

    # fred "We're illegal clones of living people, [mc]. We're already in complicated territory."
    fred "Nous sommes des clones illégaux de personnes vivantes, [mc]. On est déjà en terrain glissant."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2784
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_6cb0ef94:

    # aar "We don't have recognized identities. We don't exist to the official world."
    aar "Nous n'avons pas d'identités reconnues. Nous n'existons pas pour le monde officiel."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2785
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_b6aa904a:

    # gav "We can't take a commercial flight. We can't open a bank account. We can't exist outside these walls without being ghosts."
    gav "On ne peut pas prendre un vol commercial. On ne peut pas ouvrir de compte en banque. On ne peut pas exister en dehors de ces murs sans être des fantômes."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2786
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_70bd8a87:

    # dam "Or criminals. Even if we haven't done anything."
    dam "Ou des criminels. Même si on n'a rien fait."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2789
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_fac812b0:

    # ama "They're right, [mc]. Our legal situation is... peculiar."
    ama "Ils ont raison, [mc]. Notre situation légale est... particulière."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2791
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_5aa4184e:

    # ama "They're right, [mc]. Their legal situation is... peculiar."
    ama "Ils ont raison, [mc]. Leur situation légale est... particulière."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2792
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_964a076b:

    # ama "Without that documentation, the promise of being able to leave the company would be an empty promise."
    ama "Sans ces documents, la promesse de pouvoir quitter l'entreprise serait une promesse en l'air."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2793
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_e07341a8:

    # mc "I know. And it's a real problem that needs a real solution."
    mc "Je sais. Et c'est un vrai problème qui nécessite une vraie solution."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2794
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_c41e143f:

    # mc "Alternative documentation isn't something I can approve right now. There's a significant logistical cost. And there are legal risks for NTR."
    mc "Des documents alternatifs, ce n'est pas quelque chose que je peux approuver pour le moment. Il y a un coût logistique important. Et il y a des risques légaux pour NTR."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2796
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_fbbc292e:

    # fred "More risks than the ones we take every day in the field?"
    fred "Plus de risques que ceux qu'on prend tous les jours sur le terrain ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2797
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_e0b8fd70:

    # mc "No. You're right, [fred]."
    mc "Non. Tu as raison, [fred]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2798
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_1ac0ae7d:

    # mc "I'm going to look into how much it would cost and how to do it as safely as possible."
    mc "Je vais me renseigner sur le coût et sur la façon de le faire de la manière la plus sûre possible."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2799
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_a7f7fa71:

    # mc "For you guys and for the company. I'm not saying no. I'm saying I need to think about it."
    mc "Pour vous les gars et pour l'entreprise. Je ne dis pas non. Je dis que j'ai besoin d'y réfléchir."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2800
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_1a935044:

    # mc "I guess one of the governments we've worked with could help, but..."
    mc "Je suppose qu'un des gouvernements avec lesquels nous avons travaillé pourrait aider, mais..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2802
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_bc4cee13:

    # aar "It's more than we expected."
    aar "C'est plus que ce à quoi on s'attendait."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2803
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_92be3381:

    # gav "That works for me."
    gav "Ça me va."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2804
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_896fb231:

    # dam "I want a cool name. Something like... Dan Steel. Dan is dead. I can take his name."
    dam "Je veux un nom stylé. Un truc comme... Dan Steel. Dan est mort. Je peux prendre son nom."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2806
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_d1d35694:

    # carl "[dam], for the love of..."
    carl "[dam], pour l'amour de..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2807
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_687be014:

    # dam "It's for the passport! We have to think about it ahead of time!"
    dam "C'est pour le passeport ! Il faut y penser à l'avance !"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2808
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_c3c3efcd:

    # fred "Sometimes I wonder how he's survived so many missions."
    fred "Parfois, je me demande comment il a survécu à autant de missions."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2809
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_ba4c8276:

    # dam "Charisma. Pure and simple."
    dam "Le charisme. Pur et simple."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2811
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_60ee7b62:

    # "The initial tension has dissipated. The room now has a warmer atmosphere. As if they trust you."
    "La tension initiale s'est dissipée. La pièce a maintenant une atmosphère plus chaleureuse. Comme s'ils vous faisaient confiance."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2812
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_132a95ae:

    # "Not because of what [aar] has told them over the last few days, but because of what they've heard come out of your mouth."
    "Pas à cause de ce qu'[aar] leur a dit ces derniers jours, mais à cause de ce qu'ils ont entendu sortir de ta bouche."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2813
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_2b614ac8:

    # "You look at everyone present before speaking."
    "Tu regardes toutes les personnes présentes avant de parler."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2814
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_0087789a:

    # mc "Alright. I think, if you have no further requests, we've covered everything on the table."
    mc "Très bien. Je pense que si vous n'avez pas d'autres demandes, on a fait le tour de la question."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2815
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_17b74da1:

    # mc "I want you to know that this isn't the last meeting. It's the first."
    mc "Je veux que vous sachiez que ce n'est pas la dernière réunion. C'est la première."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2816
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_6331ccac:

    # ama "[mc] plans to establish a direct channel so you can submit new requests."
    ama "[mc] prévoit d'établir un canal direct pour que vous puissiez soumettre de nouvelles demandes."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2817
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_3a850659:

    # aar "That... has never existed before."
    aar "Ça... n'a jamais existé auparavant."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2818
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_b3fbfa36:

    # mc "Well, it exists now. And I want you to use it."
    mc "Eh bien, ça existe maintenant. Et je veux que vous l'utilisiez."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2819
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_d78b839c:

    # fred "When is the next meeting?"
    fred "C'est quand la prochaine réunion ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2820
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_3422f581:

    # mc "In a few weeks. I need time to make progress on the pending issues."
    mc "Dans quelques semaines. J'ai besoin de temps pour avancer sur les problèmes en suspens."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2821
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_efafc640:

    # mc "I don't want to call a meeting until I have something concrete to offer you. Progress on what you asked for today."
    mc "Je ne veux pas convoquer de réunion avant d'avoir quelque chose de concret à vous offrir. Des progrès sur ce que vous avez demandé aujourd'hui."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2822
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_a359479c:

    # gav "Sounds good to us."
    gav "Ça nous va."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2823
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_7fb9b9c6:

    # carl "I'll take note of the agreements reached and the issues pending resolution."
    carl "Je vais prendre note des accords conclus et des questions en attente de résolution."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2824
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_8e87bc32:

    # dam "And I'll take note of the cool names in case there are passports."
    dam "Et je vais prendre note des noms sympas au cas où il y aurait des passeports."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2826
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_c9821169_1:

    # aar "[dam]..."
    aar "[dam]..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2827
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_e81182d9:

    # dam "*Laugh* I'm doing it for the team!"
    dam "*Rires* Je le fais pour l'équipe !"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2828
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_e5663045:

    # "Some can't hide their smiles beneath the fuss caused by [dam]'s latest nonsense."
    "Certains ne peuvent cacher leurs sourires sous l'agitation causée par les dernières absurdités de [dam]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2829
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_32202f04:

    # "You think it's the first time that room has heard clones laughing."
    "Tu penses que c'est la première fois que cette pièce entend des clones rire."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2830
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_e660ffee:

    # mc "One more thing before you leave."
    mc "Encore une chose avant que vous ne partiez."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2832
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_a51d42fd:

    # "You stand up. Everyone looks at you for a moment before you start speaking. You know you have their attention."
    "Tu te lèves. Tout le monde te regarde un instant avant que tu ne commences à parler. Tu sais que tu as leur attention."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2833
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_9dcc6b4d:

    # mc "I know what you've been through here. What they did to you. What they denied you. Though I'll never fully understand what you went through."
    mc "Je sais ce que vous avez traversé ici. Ce qu'ils vous ont fait. Ce qu'ils vous ont refusé. Même si je ne comprendrai jamais totalement ce que vous avez vécu."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2834
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_e4d2717b:

    # mc "But I can't change the past. All I can do is make sure the future is different."
    mc "Mais je ne peux pas changer le passé. Tout ce que je peux faire, c'est m'assurer que l'avenir sera différent."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2835
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_0a023c18:

    # mc "Not as a favor. As an obligation. This company owes it to you. I owe it to you."
    mc "Pas comme une faveur. Comme une obligation. Cette entreprise vous le doit. Je vous le dois."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2837
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_2c06cb3d:

    # "No one speaks for a moment as you sit back down. They look at each other before reacting."
    "Personne ne parle pendant un moment alors que tu te rassois. Ils se regardent avant de réagir."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2838
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_c6f6798b:

    # "Despite everything that's been said in the meeting, there's still surprise in their voices when they start speaking."
    "Malgré tout ce qui a été dit pendant la réunion, il y a encore de la surprise dans leurs voix quand ils commencent à parler."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2839
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_c07c1cd5:

    # fred "It's the first time someone in that position has said something like that."
    fred "C'est la première fois que quelqu'un dans cette position dit une chose pareille."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2840
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_68bc852a:

    # carl "Or that someone in that position even bothers to listen to us."
    carl "Ou que quelqu'un dans cette position prenne la peine de nous écouter."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2841
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_bf1248f6:

    # gav "And he means it. You can tell."
    gav "Et il est sérieux. Ça se voit."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2842
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_9c08ca87:

    # aar "Thank you, [mc]. On behalf of everyone. Including those who aren't here."
    aar "Merci, [mc]. Au nom de tous. Y compris ceux qui ne sont pas là."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2843
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_6a1067c2:

    # ama "See you in a few weeks, then."
    ama "À dans quelques semaines, alors."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2845
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_51527a49:

    # carl "I think this meeting is over. We should leave [mc], [ama], and [aar] to discuss what we've talked about here."
    carl "Je crois que cette réunion est terminée. On devrait laisser [mc], [ama] et [aar] discuter de ce qu'on a abordé ici."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2847
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_45cd0cb2:

    # aar "I'm going to start preparing all the necessary documentation so you can make decisions having all the information."
    aar "Je vais commencer à préparer toute la documentation nécessaire pour que tu puisses prendre des décisions en ayant toutes les informations."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2848
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_1f861dbf:

    # mc "All the {b}relevant{/b} information, [aar]. I don't need to know how much shaving cream we're going to save because they can grow a beard now."
    mc "Toutes les informations {b}pertinentes{/b}, [aar]. Je n'ai pas besoin de savoir combien de mousse à raser on va économiser parce qu'ils peuvent se laisser pousser la barbe maintenant."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2850
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_7e991351:

    # aar "*Laugh* Am I too thorough in my reports?"
    aar "*Rires* Suis-je trop exhaustif dans mes rapports ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2851
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_ebaf1abf:

    # mc "*Laugh* I wouldn't say that. I don't know what word could be used for 'three orders of magnitude above too thorough'."
    mc "*Rire* Je ne dirais pas ça. Je ne sais pas quel mot on pourrait utiliser pour 'trois ordres de grandeur au-dessus de trop minutieux'."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2852
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_69379918:

    # aar "*Laugh* Okay. No shaving cream or time we'll save at the barbershop."
    aar "*Rire* D'accord. Pas de crème à raser ou de temps gagné chez le barbier."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2854
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_2714547c:

    # "The meeting slowly dissolves. The clones leave talking among themselves."
    "La réunion se dissipe lentement. Les clones partent en discutant entre eux."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2855
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_cd518edd:

    # "For the first time, there's something resembling hope at NTR headquarters. At least among the clones."
    "Pour la première fois, il y a quelque chose qui ressemble à de l'espoir au quartier général de NTR. Du moins parmi les clones."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2856
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_7e82245b:

    # dam "I'm already thinking about my sideburns. Maybe they're better than a beard..."
    dam "Je pense déjà à mes favoris. C'est peut-être mieux qu'une barbe..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2857
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_a7101ebe:

    # gav "[dam], stop it."
    gav "[dam], arrête ça."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2858
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_24012bf9:

    # dam "They're a symbol of freedom!"
    dam "C'est un symbole de liberté !"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2860
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_b391b72f:

    # mc "[ama]..."
    mc "[ama]..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2861
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_45b012e8:

    # ama "Yes?"
    ama "Oui ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2862
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_3bd14d0a:

    # mc "Do you think we'll do well?"
    mc "Tu penses qu'on va s'en sortir ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2864
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_ae2832b2:

    # ama "I think you're already doing well."
    ama "Je pense que vous vous en sortez déjà bien."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:2865
translate french c31s006_cloneMeeting_28818800:

    # "You nod, thoughtful. There's a lot of work ahead. But today, at least, someone listened to the people who have suffered the most at NTR."
    "Vous hochez la tête, pensif. Il y a beaucoup de travail en perspective. Mais aujourd'hui, au moins, quelqu'un a écouté les personnes qui ont le plus souffert chez NTR."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4233
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_5bc3d28a:

    # "The rest of the day flies by."
    "Le reste de la journée passe à toute vitesse."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4234
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_31873a0c:

    # "If the meeting room was oppressive, your office isn't much better. It looks like it's straight out of a 70s movie."
    "Si la salle de réunion était oppressante, votre bureau n'est guère mieux. On dirait qu'il sort tout droit d'un film des années 70."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4235
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_ceae195a:

    # "[car] gives you the Employee Handbook. It's a huge book with a bunch of outdated concepts."
    "[car] vous donne le manuel de l'employé. C'est un énorme bouquin rempli de concepts dépassés."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4236
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_7ae54631:

    # "There isn't a single mention of clones in it. It's meant for staff in non-operations departments."
    "Il n'y a pas la moindre mention des clones à l'intérieur. Il est destiné au personnel des départements non opérationnels."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4237
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_bbb50372:

    # "You leave it in a prominent place on your desk. Another thing for your to-do list."
    "Vous le laissez bien en évidence sur votre bureau. Encore une chose à ajouter à votre liste de tâches."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4239
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_4bce495a:

    # "You have a meeting with the head of the IT department, [geo]."
    "Vous avez une réunion avec le chef du département informatique, [geo]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4240
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_81a7ccbb:

    # "He seems like a good guy, although he has a bit of a weird sense of humor, especially regarding his wardrobe choices."
    "Il a l'air d'être un bon gars, bien qu'il ait un sens de l'humour un peu bizarre, surtout en ce qui concerne ses choix vestimentaires."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4241
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_84a9636e:

    # "The company's management application seems quite operational, although you see possible areas for improvement."
    "L'application de gestion de l'entreprise semble tout à fait opérationnelle, bien que vous voyiez des améliorations possibles."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4242
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_b3e74f2e:

    # "You think that, later on, you'll put [geo] in touch with Jamaal."
    "Vous vous dites que, plus tard, vous mettrez [geo] en contact avec Jamaal."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4243
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_d187b752:

    # "If your favorite IT guy was able to hack NTR's database, tech security should be increased."
    "Si votre informaticien préféré a pu pirater la base de données de NTR, la sécurité informatique devrait être renforcée."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4244
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_1a02dcb5:

    # "He leaves a folder with the IT systems manual on your desk. He also sends you the electronic version by email."
    "Il laisse un dossier avec le manuel des systèmes informatiques sur votre bureau. Il vous envoie également la version électronique par e-mail."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4247
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_f5af9d6f:

    # "You receive three visits from [vin] throughout the day."
    "Vous recevez trois visites de [vin] tout au long de la journée."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4248
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_285df287:

    # "He wants meticulous details about the reports you requested."
    "Il veut des détails méticuleux sur les rapports que vous avez demandés."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4249
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_015e3769:

    # "The only question of interest to you is whether you want the reports on 'Real Accounting' or 'Creative Accounting'."
    "La seule question qui vous intéresse est de savoir si vous voulez les rapports sur la « Comptabilité réelle » ou la « Comptabilité créative »."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4250
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_4cb0d9d4:

    # "You think you're going to hate [vin] and his tiny hands."
    "Vous pensez que vous allez détester [vin] et ses petites mains."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4251
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_5c08256c:

    # "After his last visit, you've lost track of how many coffees [car] has brought you."
    "Après sa dernière visite, vous avez perdu le compte du nombre de cafés que [car] vous a apportés."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4254
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_b95aee08:

    # "Late in the afternoon, [aar] shows up at your office. You haven't left it since lunchtime."
    "En fin d'après-midi, [aar] se pointe à votre bureau. Vous ne l'avez pas quitté depuis l'heure du déjeuner."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4255
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_fb3be0c9:

    # mc "Can I help you with anything, [aar]?"
    mc "Je peux t'aider pour quelque chose, [aar] ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4256
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_6729bbf0:

    # aar "I came to talk about Daniels."
    aar "Je suis venu parler de Daniels."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4257
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_1afe9f90:

    # mc "Tell me."
    mc "Dis-moi."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4261
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_e230c02e:

    # aar "You said you wanted to be part of whatever decision was made."
    aar "Tu as dit que tu voulais faire partie de la décision, quelle qu'elle soit."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4263
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_e6eb5187:

    # aar "I know you said you were leaving whatever decision was made in our hands."
    aar "Je sais que tu as dit que tu laissais la décision, quelle qu'elle soit, entre nos mains."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4264
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_30809b45:

    # mc "Is it necessary to do this on my first day here, [aar]? I'm still catching up on a thousand things..."
    mc "Est-ce vraiment nécessaire de faire ça dès mon premier jour ici, [aar] ? J'ai encore mille choses à rattraper..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4266
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_9fb22617:

    # aar "I think it'll be better to act as soon as possible... I haven't been able to find out if he still has supporters in the company and..."
    aar "Je pense qu'il vaut mieux agir le plus vite possible... Je n'ai pas réussi à savoir s'il a encore des soutiens dans l'entreprise et..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4267
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_9632c43c:

    # mc "And I think we can't do anything until [eva] is here."
    mc "Et je pense qu'on ne peut rien faire tant qu'[eva] n'est pas là."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4268
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_f8fd0e7f:

    # mc "It's not something that can be done over a video call with someone like her."
    mc "Ce n'est pas le genre de chose qu'on peut régler par appel vidéo avec quelqu'un comme elle."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4270
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_adbfb54e:

    # aar "What do you mean by 'someone like her'?"
    aar "Qu'est-ce que tu entends par 'quelqu'un comme elle' ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4271
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_7f8f069c:

    # mc "[eva] is impulsive and emotional. She's going to want to be here when the decision is made."
    mc "[eva] est impulsive et émotive. Elle voudra être là quand la décision sera prise."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4273
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_a1af67e0:

    # aar "Phew! You scared me for a second."
    aar "Ouf ! Tu m'as fait peur une seconde."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4274
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_322d2ec8:

    # aar "I was starting to think you guys had changed [eva] as much as [ama]."
    aar "Je commençais à croire que vous aviez autant changé [eva] qu'[ama]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4275
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_1bfaba52:

    # mc "Maybe a bit more than her."
    mc "Peut-être même un peu plus qu'elle."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4276
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_3dc0f085:

    # mc "Have you noticed she's changed a lot?"
    mc "Tu as remarqué qu'elle avait beaucoup changé ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4278
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_267ff005:

    # aar "Yesterday in the hangar... That was a surprise."
    aar "Hier dans le hangar... C'était une surprise."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4279
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_b74dda34:

    # aar "But today I had a really long meeting with her and... She's different."
    aar "Mais aujourd'hui, j'ai eu une très longue réunion avec elle et... Elle est différente."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4280
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_615fa532:

    # mc "What did you notice?"
    mc "Qu'est-ce que tu as remarqué ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4282
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_4cd641e2:

    # aar "She's more... assertive. More self-confident."
    aar "Elle est plus... affirmée. Plus sûre d'elle."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4283
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_445aac14:

    # aar "Before leaving her with your family, she would have accepted my orders without question. But now..."
    aar "Avant de la laisser avec ta famille, elle aurait accepté mes ordres sans poser de questions. Mais maintenant..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4284
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_351a34ca:

    # "You're not going to correct him to say that it's also [ama]'s family now."
    "Tu ne vas pas le corriger pour dire que c'est aussi la famille d'[ama] maintenant."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4285
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_2b486b52:

    # mc "*Laugh* Did you try to give her orders? You're even more brave than you look."
    mc "*Rires* Tu as essayé de lui donner des ordres ? Tu es encore plus courageux que tu en as l'air."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4286
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_fc7f2958:

    # mc "She's no longer under your command. You're the head of the Operations Department. She's the head of Security."
    mc "Elle n'est plus sous tes ordres. Tu es le chef du département des opérations. Elle est la chef de la sécurité."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4288
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_faefc4a8:

    # aar "I know, I know. But I expected... I don't know... I guess it's old habits."
    aar "Je sais, je sais. Mais je m'attendais à... Je ne sais pas... Je suppose que ce sont de vieilles habitudes."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4289
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_e0a2d44b:

    # mc "Everyone changes, [aar]. Some faster than others."
    mc "Tout le monde change, [aar]. Certains plus vite que d'autres."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4290
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_935b12ed:

    # mc "And getting back to Daniels... Where is he right now?"
    mc "Et pour en revenir à Daniels... Où est-il en ce moment ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4292
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_224198b2:

    # aar "In a cell, isolated. Guarded by two operatives at all times."
    aar "Dans une cellule, isolé. Gardé par deux agents en permanence."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4293
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_7cea5e69:

    # mc "Are they trustworthy?"
    mc "Sont-ils dignes de confiance ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4294
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_1f31b4f0:

    # aar "They do 8-hour shifts, which means there are six operatives involved in his surveillance."
    aar "Ils font des quarts de 8 heures, ce qui signifie qu'il y a six agents impliqués dans sa surveillance."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4295
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_7d163951:

    # aar "I think so, they are trustworthy. But..."
    aar "Je pense que oui, ils sont dignes de confiance. Mais..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4296
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_ad3deade:

    # mc "We have to trust our own men, [aar]."
    mc "Nous devons faire confiance à nos propres hommes, [aar]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4297
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_68b5d643:

    # mc "If you think we can trust them, we can postpone the decision until [eva] arrives."
    mc "Si tu penses qu'on peut leur faire confiance, on peut reporter la décision jusqu'à l'arrivée de [eva]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4299
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_4b956114:

    # aar "You surprise me... You... 'normals'... don't usually trust clones this much."
    aar "Tu me surprends... Vous... les 'normaux'... ne faites généralement pas autant confiance aux clones."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4301
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_040859a5:

    # mc "I've lived with [ama] and [eva] for three weeks."
    mc "J'ai vécu avec [ama] et [eva] pendant trois semaines."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4303
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_e0030a5d:

    # mc "I've lived with [eri], [emm], and [dap] my whole life."
    mc "J'ai vécu avec [eri], [emm] et [dap] toute ma vie."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4304
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_3feae8d5:

    # mc "I'd trust them with my life without hesitation. I don't care if they're clones or... 'normals'."
    mc "Je leur confierais ma vie sans hésiter. Je me fiche qu'elles soient des clones ou... des 'normales'."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4305
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_20211331:

    # mc "I think I'm going to hate that word."
    mc "Je crois que je vais détester ce mot."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4306
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_2aebb2ac:

    # mc "They're just as human as me or [mael]. You trust people for who they are. Not for how they were born."
    mc "Ils sont tout aussi humains que moi ou [mael]. On fait confiance aux gens pour ce qu'ils sont. Pas pour la façon dont ils sont nés."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4308
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_56db95f1:

    # aar "I'll say it again. You surprise me."
    aar "Je le répète. Tu me surprends."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4309
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_c7ee3827:

    # mc "Get ready for more surprises with the Marks, [aar]."
    mc "Prépare-toi à d'autres surprises avec les Marks, [aar]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4311
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_5c27be9e:

    # aar "About that..."
    aar "À ce propos..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4312
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_3b916da8:

    # mc "What's up?"
    mc "Qu'est-ce qu'il y a ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4313
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_82cb7a38:

    # aar "Could you tell [bet] to stop hugging me every time she sees me?"
    aar "Tu pourrais dire à [bet] d'arrêter de me faire des câlins à chaque fois qu'elle me voit ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4314
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_e7a4ddae:

    # mc "*Laugh* You're delusional if you think that's gonna happen."
    mc "*Rire* Tu te fais des illusions si tu penses que ça va arriver."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4315
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_b1e73e56:

    # mc "She's found a new great-nephew. Good luck getting her to stop hugging you."
    mc "Elle s'est trouvé un nouveau petit-neveu. Bonne chance pour qu'elle arrête de te serrer dans ses bras."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4317
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_719b1d35:

    # aar "I had to try..."
    aar "Il fallait que j'essaie..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4318
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_9aeb76ed:

    # mc "It's a losing battle, [aar]. But you can try telling her yourself."
    mc "C'est une bataille perdue d'avance, [aar]. Mais tu peux essayer de lui dire toi-même."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4320
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_474f4ce4:

    # aar "What? No! That woman scares me! I'm sure she'd treat me like a kid saying nonsense if I tried."
    aar "Quoi ? Non ! Cette femme me fait peur ! Je suis sûr qu'elle me traiterait comme un gamin qui dit n'importe quoi si j'essayais."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4321
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_14833ab2:

    # mc "*Laugh* That's probably exactly what she'd do."
    mc "*Rires* C'est probablement exactement ce qu'elle ferait."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4322
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_2ce522b5:

    # mc "But you're right. Beneath that sweet old lady exterior, Aunt [bet] is really tough and can be scary."
    mc "Mais tu as raison. Sous ses airs de douce vieille dame, Tante [bet] est vraiment coriace et peut être effrayante."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4323
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_7e5a79df:

    # mc "And she has a sixth sense for picking up on things."
    mc "Et elle a un sixième sens pour capter les choses."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4325
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_26a131b5:

    # aar "Sixth sense like in 'I see dead people'?"
    aar "Un sixième sens comme dans 'Je vois des gens qui sont morts' ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4326
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_c976430b:

    # mc "*Laugh* No, but she can tell when someone is keeping a secret."
    mc "*Rires* Non, mais elle sait quand quelqu'un garde un secret."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4327
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_ef9ea1d7:

    # mc "If she finds out you're afraid of her, you're a goner."
    mc "Si elle découvre que tu as peur d'elle, t'es foutu."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4329
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_b3729bea:

    # aar "*Laugh* My fear level went up a couple of notches just now."
    aar "*Rires* Mon niveau de peur vient de monter de quelques crans."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4330
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_8edf7e93:

    # aar "See you tomorrow?"
    aar "À demain ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4331
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_1035461a:

    # mc "Yeah, of course."
    mc "Ouais, bien sûr."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4333
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_e91e60c1:

    # "Half an hour after [aar] left..."
    "Une demi-heure après le départ de [aar]..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4334
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_dd0461ef:

    # "*Knock-Knock*"
    "*Toc-Toc*"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4335
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_2a46e597:

    # car "*Through the door* May I come in, Sir?"
    car "*À travers la porte* Puis-je entrer, Monsieur ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4336
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_75e013e9:

    # mc "Come in, [car]."
    mc "Entrez, [car]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4338
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_0e603514:

    # car "I came to tell you that I'm going home."
    car "Je suis venue vous dire que je rentre chez moi."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4339
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_db660419:

    # mc "Perfect, [car], and thank you. See you on Monday."
    mc "Parfait, [car], et merci. À lundi."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4341
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_b6221dd6:

    # car "Monday? Aren't you coming in tomorrow?"
    car "Lundi ? Vous ne venez pas demain ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4342
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_bfc9ec9e:

    # mc "It's Saturday... Do you work on Saturdays?"
    mc "C'est samedi... Vous travaillez le samedi ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4344
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_83d0ff1c:

    # car "Almost all the staff works on Saturdays, Sir. The Company is open 365 days a year."
    car "Presque tout le personnel travaille le samedi, Monsieur. L'entreprise est ouverte 365 jours par an."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4345
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_5ad60fc8:

    # mc "How many days off do you get a week?"
    mc "Combien de jours de congé avez-vous par semaine ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4346
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_312573f0:

    # car "Sundays and Mondays. On Sunday you'll meet [lar], the girl who covers for me when I have my days off."
    car "Les dimanches et lundis. Dimanche, vous rencontrerez [lar], la fille qui me remplace quand j'ai mes jours de congé."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4347
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_24d33c21:

    # car "Well, that's if you come to work on Sunday... It was Mr. Daniels' day off."
    car "Enfin, ça c'est si vous venez travailler dimanche... C'était le jour de congé de M. Daniels."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4348
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_f02e70cd:

    # mc "Yes, I'll come. At least this Sunday. It's [gav]'s surgery, and I want to be here."
    mc "Oui, je viendrai. Au moins ce dimanche. C'est l'opération de [gav], et je veux être là."


# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4350
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_48081ed2:

    # car "You are... different."
    car "Tu es... différent."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4351
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_9267f44a:

    # mc "If you mean different from Daniels, I'll take that as a compliment."
    mc "Si tu veux dire différent de Daniels, je prends ça comme un compliment."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4353
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_f95f1c9e:

    # car "Ms. [ama] told me she is waiting for you in the parking lot."
    car "Mme [ama] m'a dit qu'elle t'attend sur le parking."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4355
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_8b0ed010:

    # "After that, she disappears without saying anything else."
    "Après ça, elle disparaît sans rien dire de plus."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4357
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_442334d0:

    # "When you get home, you have dinner with [bet] and [ama]."
    "Quand tu rentres à la maison, tu dînes avec [bet] et [ama]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4358
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_bfdd6feb:

    # "Someone took care of sending catering to the house, which arrives 20 minutes after you do."
    "Quelqu'un s'est occupé de faire livrer un traiteur à la maison, qui arrive 20 minutes après toi."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4359
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_8b9dbb6e:

    # "They hit the mark with your favorite dishes, although [bet] complains about the size of the pizza."
    "Ils ont tapé dans le mille avec tes plats préférés, même si [bet] se plaint de la taille de la pizza."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4360
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_73dd2286:

    # "No one complains about the desserts being too plentiful."
    "Personne ne se plaint que les desserts soient trop copieux."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4361
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_3ea72f07:

    # "You have to thank [car]."
    "Tu dois remercier [car]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4362
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_3b458c9c:

    # "You tell each other how your first and exhausting day at NTR went."
    "Vous vous racontez comment s'est passée votre première journée épuisante chez NTR."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4363
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_1b388b6e:

    # "There are laughs and surprised comments. It was less tough for [ama] than she thought."
    "Il y a des rires et des commentaires surpris. Ça a été moins dur pour [ama] qu'elle ne le pensait."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4365
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_e4eddf89:

    # "You fall into bed exhausted once again."
    "Tu t'écroules de fatigue dans ton lit une fois de plus."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4366
translate french c31s006_DanielsFate_f7b1ca57:

    # "[ama] goes back to sleep in your bed. It's been a long day for her too."
    "[ama] se rendort dans ton lit. Ça a été une longue journée pour elle aussi."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4372
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_d6d5fd1a:

    # centered "{size=+20}{b}DAY 40 – SATURDAY{/b}{/size}"
    centered "{size=+20}{b}JOUR 40 – SAMEDI{/b}{/size}"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4374
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_aea2d136:

    # "Your second morning as CEO follows the same pattern as the afternoon of the first."
    "Ta deuxième matinée en tant que PDG suit le même schéma que l'après-midi de la première."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4375
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_163c1808:

    # "The occasional visitor leaving a folder on your desk."
    "Le visiteur occasionnel laissant un dossier sur ton bureau."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4376
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_64ffe962:

    # "If there are no visitors, it's [car] who hands you a new folder."
    "S'il n'y a pas de visiteurs, c'est [car] qui te remet un nouveau dossier."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4378
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_bafbf60f:

    # "After the last folder before lunchtime..."
    "Après le dernier dossier avant l'heure du déjeuner..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4379
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_5c69a606:

    # mc "[car], one moment, please."
    mc "[car], un instant, s'il te plaît."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4380
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_7a61fa95:

    # car "Yes, Sir?"
    car "Oui, Monsieur ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4381
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_87c206c0:

    # mc "Is there any reason why you're bringing me all the documentation on paper?"
    mc "Y a-t-il une raison pour laquelle tu m'apportes toute la documentation sur papier ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4382
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_2d96cacb:

    # mc "The only email I've received with documentation was from [geo]."
    mc "Le seul e-mail que j'ai reçu avec de la documentation venait de [geo]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4384
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_12e83ca4:

    # car "Mr. Daniels liked printed documentation. That's why he has so many filing cabinets here."
    car "M. Daniels aimait la documentation imprimée. C'est pour ça qu'il a autant d'armoires à dossiers ici."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4385
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_465d1089:

    # mc "I feel... buried under all these folders and dossiers."
    mc "Je me sens... enseveli sous tous ces dossiers et chemises."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4387
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_0979b03b:

    # car "So... I don't need to print out your emails or attachments anymore?"
    car "Donc... je n'ai plus besoin d'imprimer vos e-mails ou pièces jointes ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4388
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_3ca00806:

    # mc "I think you can just forward me whatever you think I should read."
    mc "Je pense que vous pouvez juste me transférer ce que vous pensez que je devrais lire."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4389
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_9d943355:

    # mc "And printing an email? Never, please. It'll be easier for me to find them on my laptop than in the filing cabinets."
    mc "Et imprimer un e-mail ? Plus jamais, s'il vous plaît. Ce sera plus facile pour moi de les trouver sur mon ordinateur portable que dans les armoires à dossiers."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4391
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_272c00ba:

    # car "Understood, Sir."
    car "Compris, Monsieur."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4392
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_bd7d9df9:

    # mc "[mc]."
    mc "[mc]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4393
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_154a2f8b:

    # car "At this rate, I wouldn't be able to see you over the folders."
    car "À ce rythme, je ne pourrais plus vous voir par-dessus les dossiers."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4394
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_f1c6d19f:

    # car "I'll let [lar] know not to print your messages."
    car "Je ferai savoir à [lar] de ne pas imprimer vos messages."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4395
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_da378e55:

    # mc "Thanks, [car]."
    mc "Merci, [car]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4398
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_0c2f92fb:

    # "A few minutes later, [ama] walks in without knocking, holding a bag."
    "Quelques minutes plus tard, [ama] entre sans frapper, tenant un sac."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4399
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_729887b3:

    # ama "I need to get out of here."
    ama "Il faut que je sorte d'ici."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4400
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_5d36d0c4:

    # mc "What's up? You told me you'd show me the training facilities today."
    mc "Qu'est-ce qu'il y a ? Tu m'avais dit que tu me montrerais les installations d'entraînement aujourd'hui."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4401
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_b38e7d1d:

    # mc "But I've had a... complicated day."
    mc "Mais j'ai eu une journée... compliquée."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4403
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_8c64f585:

    # ama "Today is going to be impossible."
    ama "Aujourd'hui, ça va être impossible."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4404
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_22da587c:

    # ama "Word got out that we were going to create a surveillance team for Newport."
    ama "Le bruit a couru qu'on allait créer une équipe de surveillance pour Newport."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4405
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_cabb2e9e:

    # ama "I have over 90 applications to join. And I have to interview them all!"
    ama "J'ai plus de 90 candidatures. Et je dois tous les interviewer !"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4406
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_0c1a63ae:

    # mc "I don't know how it could have leaked. We haven't made it public yet."
    mc "Je ne sais pas comment ça a pu fuiter. On ne l'a pas encore rendu public."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4408
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_bfa06431:

    # ama "[dam]. His application was the first one. I told you we'd have to run him over."
    ama "[dam]. Sa candidature était la première. Je t'avais dit qu'on devrait lui rouler dessus."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4409
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_877bd78e:

    # mc "*Laugh* I felt like doing that yesterday. Taking the Not-Tank and running him over."
    mc "*Rires* J'avais envie de faire ça hier. Prendre le Pas-Un-Tank et lui rouler dessus."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4411
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_7086b554:

    # ama "*Laugh* IFV. If you're going to run this, you have to learn the names of the vehicles and devices."
    ama "*Rires* VCI. Si tu vas diriger ça, tu dois apprendre les noms des véhicules et des appareils."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4412
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_41d5fd3d:

    # mc "Somewhere among these folders is an inventory of everything we have. With pictures for dummies like me."
    mc "Quelque part dans ces dossiers, il y a un inventaire de tout ce qu'on a. Avec des images pour les nuls comme moi."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4413
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_89ff149b:

    # mc "Someone thought it was a good idea to send it to me."
    mc "Quelqu'un a pensé que c'était une bonne idée de me l'envoyer."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4415
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_fe3cc708:

    # ama "*Laugh* [aar]. And you can't run him over."
    ama "*Rire* [aar]. Et tu ne peux pas l'écraser."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4416
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_53e3513d:

    # mc "*Laugh* That's the downside of him also being a shareholder."
    mc "*Rire* C'est l'inconvénient qu'il soit aussi actionnaire."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4417
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_a961595d:

    # mc "But you told me you wanted to get out of here. Are you done with the interviews?"
    mc "Mais tu m'as dit que tu voulais sortir d'ici. Tu as fini avec les entretiens ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4419
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_cf83b6aa:

    # ama "No, but I have an hour and a half free for lunch. I want to show you something at the training ground."
    ama "Non, mais j'ai une heure et demie de libre pour le déjeuner. Je veux te montrer quelque chose sur le terrain d'entraînement."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4420
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_127b916c:

    # ama "It's not going to be a sightseeing tour, but there's something I want you to see."
    ama "Ça ne va pas être une visite touristique, mais il y a quelque chose que je veux que tu voies."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4421
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_3c59e95c:

    # mc "Is that why you're dressed like that instead of wearing a suit?"
    mc "C'est pour ça que tu es habillée comme ça au lieu de porter un tailleur ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4423
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_83feee36:

    # ama "Yes, and there are clothes in the bag for you to change into as well."
    ama "Oui, et il y a aussi des vêtements dans le sac pour que tu te changes."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4424
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_09bd4eb0:

    # mc "I'm on it. Can you let [car] know that I'll be out for an hour and a half?"
    mc "Je m'en occupe. Tu peux prévenir [car] que je serai absent pendant une heure et demie ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4425
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_0a844e08:

    # mc "I don't have anything on my schedule, but..."
    mc "Je n'ai rien de prévu dans mon emploi du temps, mais..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4426
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_b8895caf:

    # ama "I'm on it. Don't take too long."
    ama "Je m'en occupe. Ne mets pas trop de temps."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4427
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_ab9274b5:

    # mc "Five minutes. Five actual minutes."
    mc "Cinq minutes. Cinq vraies minutes."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4430
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_09f25124:

    # "It takes you four minutes. And four minutes later, you're in a military car on your way to the training camp."
    "Ça te prend quatre minutes. Et quatre minutes plus tard, tu es dans une voiture militaire en route pour le camp d'entraînement."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4431
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_11209234:

    # mc "What do you want to show me?"
    mc "Qu'est-ce que tu veux me montrer ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4432
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_9aea9237:

    # ama "Do you remember the day your bed broke?"
    ama "Tu te souviens du jour où ton lit s'est cassé ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4433
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_c587b003:

    # mc "Yeah, the day Zeus broke my bed."
    mc "Ouais, le jour où Zeus a cassé mon lit."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4435
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_ff7a6680:

    # ama "I told you I'd show you my most prized possessions. I can't wait to show it to you anymore."
    ama "Je t'avais dit que je te montrerais mes biens les plus précieux. Je ne peux plus attendre pour te les montrer."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4436
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_dcb682b5:

    # mc "You also told me you hoped I wouldn't consider you a psychopath."
    mc "Tu m'avais aussi dit que tu espérais que je ne te prenne pas pour une psychopathe."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4438
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_75a7f326:

    # ama "Well, my most prized possessions are next to... other things."
    ama "Eh bien, mes biens les plus précieux sont à côté de... d'autres choses."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4440
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_299c84a1:

    # mc "Let's see what dark secrets my wife is hiding. I won't stop loving you because of it."
    mc "Voyons quels sombres secrets ma femme cache. Je n'arrêterai pas de t'aimer pour autant."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4442
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_d8a39aca:

    # mc "Let's see what dark secrets you're hiding. I won't stop loving you because of it."
    mc "Voyons quels sombres secrets tu caches. Je n'arrêterai pas de t'aimer pour autant."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4444
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_937ccf9d:

    # ama "*Laugh* I hope so. Don't expect me to keep the severed ears of everyone I've killed, either."
    ama "*Rires* J'espère bien. Ne t'attends pas non plus à ce que je garde les oreilles coupées de tous ceux que j'ai tués."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4445
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_480f108c:

    # "The casual way she says it, between laughter, sends a shiver down your spine."
    "La façon désinvolte dont elle dit ça, entre deux rires, te donne des frissons dans le dos."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4446
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_8d66038f:

    # "You will never be able to fully understand the blonde mercenary or her redheaded sister. That makes you feel a bit sad."
    "Tu ne pourras jamais comprendre pleinement la mercenaire blonde ou sa sœur rousse. Ça te rend un peu triste."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4447
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_5a740667:

    # "You decide to continue the conversation as if she were joking."
    "Tu décides de continuer la conversation comme si elle plaisantait."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4448
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_e4406e69:

    # mc "*Fake laugh* At least a few teeth?"
    mc "*Rire forcé* Au moins quelques dents ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4450
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_b982ed32:

    # ama "Movies lie about that. It's harder than it looks to pull a tooth. And it takes time that we usually don't have."
    ama "Les films mentent à ce sujet. C'est plus dur que ça en a l'air d'arracher une dent. Et ça prend un temps qu'on n'a généralement pas."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4451
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_33ef7237:

    # ama "Besides, it would be pretty disgusting to have a collection of teeth."
    ama "En plus, ce serait plutôt dégueulasse d'avoir une collection de dents."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4452
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_acec8169:

    # mc "I totally agree."
    mc "Je suis totalement d'accord."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4453
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_14e552be:

    # "You figure that, if she knows how long it takes to pull a tooth... You'd rather not ask."
    "Tu te dis que, si elle sait combien de temps ça prend d'arracher une dent... Tu préfères ne pas demander."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4455
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_c0ed0383:

    # "You continue on your way for a few more minutes before [ama] stops the car."
    "Vous continuez votre route pendant encore quelques minutes avant qu'[ama] n'arrête la voiture."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4456
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_74cd2940:

    # "You aren't following any path or road that you can see, but [ama] seems very sure of where she's driving."
    "Tu ne suis aucun chemin ou route visible, mais [ama] semble très sûre d'où elle conduit."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4459
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_ce0696f3:

    # "You stop next to a barbed wire fence."
    "Vous vous arrêtez à côté d'une clôture en fil de fer barbelé."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4460
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_b9e2c68b:

    # ama "Here we are. You can get out of the car now."
    ama "Nous y voilà. Tu peux sortir de la voiture maintenant."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4461
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_1de52e47:

    # mc "This isn't the training camp."
    mc "Ce n'est pas le camp d'entraînement."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4463
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_0c5e41c9:

    # ama "*Laugh* Do you want a prize for your observation skills?"
    ama "*Rire* Tu veux un prix pour tes talents d'observation ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4464
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_6c2f2ec1:

    # ama "The training camp starts on the other side of the fence."
    ama "Le camp d'entraînement commence de l'autre côté de la clôture."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4465
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_a2ac8600:

    # mc "Can we jump it?"
    mc "On peut sauter par-dessus ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4467
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_c134d120:

    # ama "No need. We'll go under it."
    ama "Pas besoin. On va passer en dessous."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4468
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_08aa36f9:

    # mc "Lead the way."
    mc "Montre le chemin."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4470
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_df1542f1:

    # "You walk about a hundred and fifty steps among small gullies created by rainwater runoff."
    "Vous faites environ cent cinquante pas parmi de petites ravines créées par le ruissellement des eaux de pluie."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4471
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_42ad5c91:

    # "You use one of those gullies to pass under the fence."
    "Vous utilisez l'une de ces ravines pour passer sous la clôture."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4472
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_32ba3773:

    # "You only need to crouch. No crawling. You make a mental note that something needs to be done about the gullies."
    "Vous avez juste besoin de vous accroupir. Pas besoin de ramper. Vous notez mentalement qu'il faut faire quelque chose pour ces ravines."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4473
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_d52f7618:

    # "You walk about fifty more steps after crossing the fence."
    "Vous faites encore une cinquantaine de pas après avoir franchi la clôture."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4476
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_db9b9307:

    # ama "Here it is."
    ama "C'est ici."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4477
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_5f4607c0:

    # mc "Here? But there's nothing here."
    mc "Ici ? Mais il n'y a rien ici."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4478
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_10a95077:

    # mc "It's exactly the same as thirty meters back there. I think I've seen that rock three times today."
    mc "C'est exactement pareil qu'à trente mètres en arrière. Je crois que j'ai vu ce rocher trois fois aujourd'hui."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4480
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_5967a00a:

    # "[ama] surprises you by dropping to the ground."
    "[ama] te surprend en se laissant tomber par terre."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4481
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_690646ab:

    # ama "Except for this burrow... Just a moment... I almost have it."
    ama "À l'exception de ce terrier... Un instant... J'y suis presque."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4482
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_4ec5b0f7:

    # ama "It has rained quite a bit since the last time I was here, and there's more dirt than I expected."
    ama "Il a pas mal plu depuis la dernière fois que je suis venue, et il y a plus de terre que ce que je pensais."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4484
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_7bbd55c5:

    # "After a while, [ama] pulls out a pretty dirty waterproof bag."
    "Au bout d'un moment, [ama] sort un sac étanche plutôt sale."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4485
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_0028cf35:

    # "She tries to wipe it clean with her hand, without much success."
    "Elle essaie de l'essuyer avec sa main, sans grand succès."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4486
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_58a4054a:

    # mc "What's in there? It's not very big."
    mc "Qu'est-ce qu'il y a là-dedans ? Ce n'est pas très grand."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4488
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_031b17bd:

    # ama "I already told you, my most prized possessions. Sit down."
    ama "Je te l'ai déjà dit, mes biens les plus précieux. Assieds-toi."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4489
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_4d4c7852:

    # "The sadness in her eyes is enough to make you sit down without opening your mouth."
    "La tristesse dans ses yeux suffit à te faire asseoir sans ouvrir la bouche."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4490
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_4a29174e:

    # "The bag is small. You expect something with sentimental value, but you can't imagine what it is."
    "Le sac est petit. Tu t'attends à quelque chose ayant une valeur sentimentale, mais tu n'arrives pas à imaginer ce que c'est."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4495
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_ae3e3856:

    # "[ama] takes a faded polaroid out of the bag. It shows a little girl in military gear that looks too big for her."
    "[ama] sort un polaroïd délavé du sac. On y voit une petite fille dans un équipement militaire qui a l'air trop grand pour elle."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4496
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_1519bf7e:

    # ama "Meet Fiona. It's the only existing picture of her."
    ama "Je te présente Fiona. C'est la seule photo d'elle qui existe."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4497
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_7a085a2a:

    # ama "It's from a training session a week before she died."
    ama "Elle a été prise lors d'une session d'entraînement une semaine avant sa mort."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4499
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_0e5674ee:

    # mc "She reminds me of young [eri] more than young [dap]."
    mc "Elle me rappelle plus [eri] jeune que [dap] jeune."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4501
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_4f2aeb04:

    # mc "For some reason, I imagined a miniature [eva]. I guess because of the name she gave the doll."
    mc "Pour une raison ou une autre, j'imaginais une [eva] miniature. Je suppose que c'est à cause du nom qu'elle a donné à la poupée."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4502
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_17129545:

    # mc "But she reminds me more of young [eri] than [eva]."
    mc "Mais elle me rappelle plus [eri] jeune qu'[eva]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4504
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_4a0ca034:

    # ama "I think she would've liked to hear that. She was the most empathetic of all of us."
    ama "Je pense qu'elle aurait aimé entendre ça. Elle était la plus empathique de nous toutes."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4505
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_043e1d38:

    # ama "I think you are right, she would've been like [eri] if she'd had the chance."
    ama "Je pense que tu as raison, elle aurait été comme [eri] si elle en avait eu la chance."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4506
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_834e9fe5:

    # mc "I'm sorry, [ama]. I'm sorry for everything you guys had to go through."
    mc "Je suis désolé, [ama]. Je suis désolé pour tout ce que vous avez dû traverser."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4507
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_6a5616d7:

    # mc "I'm sorry about Fiona. But also about Clarice, Beatrice, and Diana."
    mc "Je suis désolé pour Fiona. Mais aussi pour Clarice, Beatrice et Diana."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4508
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_63223d14:

    # mc "I'm sorry I never got the chance to meet them."
    mc "Je suis désolé de n'avoir jamais eu la chance de les rencontrer."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4511
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_f7321d28:

    # "You spend a while looking at the photo. You'd like to hug the woman you adore, but you know she's deep in thought."
    "Tu passes un moment à regarder la photo. Tu aimerais serrer dans tes bras la femme que tu adores, mais tu sais qu'elle est perdue dans ses pensées."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4513
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_a2a37865:

    # "You spend a while looking at the photo. You'd like to hug the sad mercenary, but you know she's deep in thought."
    "Tu passes un moment à regarder la photo. Tu aimerais serrer dans tes bras la triste mercenaire, mais tu sais qu'elle est perdue dans ses pensées."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4514
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_44855285:

    # "You hate Daniels for depriving you of the chance to meet Diana, Beatrice, and Clarice."
    "Tu détestes Daniels de t'avoir privé de la chance de rencontrer Diana, Beatrice et Clarice."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4515
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_40f021f2:

    # "You hate Richards, the CEO before Daniels, because Fiona's death happened under his watch."
    "Tu détestes Richards, le PDG avant Daniels, parce que la mort de Fiona est arrivée sous sa surveillance."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4516
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_3007892c:

    # "But above all, you pity the girls. The living and the dead. For what they went through. For what they suffered."
    "Mais par-dessus tout, tu as pitié des filles. Les vivantes et les mortes. Pour ce qu'elles ont traversé. Pour ce qu'elles ont souffert."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4518
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_7f74b570:

    # "And the rest of the clones, too. They went through the same thing."
    "Et le reste des clones, aussi. Ils ont traversé la même chose."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4520
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_ac792836:

    # "And the clones, too. They went through the same thing."
    "Et les clones, aussi. Ils ont traversé la même chose."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4521
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_c0b79d13:

    # "None of them deserved it."
    "Aucune d'entre elles ne méritait ça."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4523
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_a8136d8d:

    # mc "Are you okay?"
    mc "Ça va ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4524
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_e5064004:

    # ama "No. But I wanted you to meet them."
    ama "Non. Mais je voulais que tu les rencontres."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4525
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_c6c6b70c:

    # mc "Did you say 'them'?"
    mc "Tu as dit 'elles' ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4530
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_fef26734:

    # ama "These are the other girls. Well, we are..."
    ama "Ce sont les autres filles. Enfin, nous sommes..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4531
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_be330c67:

    # ama "Diana, me, Beatrice, [eva], and Clarice."
    ama "Diana, moi, Beatrice, [eva] et Clarice."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4532
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_3d2bf7e0:

    # mc "You're all so different from each other... And it's weird seeing you as a brunette."
    mc "Vous êtes toutes si différentes les unes des autres... Et ça fait bizarre de te voir en brune."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4534
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_8b7fa035:

    # ama "We tried to maintain our individuality by dyeing our hair and wearing different makeup."
    ama "On essayait de garder notre individualité en se teignant les cheveux et en se maquillant différemment."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4535
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_7329578b:

    # ama "We were allowed to do that, unlike the rest of the clones."
    ama "On avait le droit de le faire, contrairement au reste des clones."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4536
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_26f78c73:

    # ama "Diana was the prettiest of us. Her specialties were... seduction and assassination."
    ama "Diana était la plus jolie d'entre nous. Ses spécialités étaient... la séduction et l'assassinat."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4537
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_f98baf20:

    # ama "Beatrice always liked being the strongest. She specialized in heavy weaponry and logistics."
    ama "Beatrice a toujours aimé être la plus forte. Elle était spécialisée dans l'armement lourd et la logistique."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4538
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_e409203c:

    # ama "Clarice was the most fragile of us all. She was sick when we were kids and... Well, she was the smallest along with Fiona."
    ama "Clarice était la plus fragile de nous toutes. Elle était malade quand on était gamines et... Eh bien, c'était la plus petite avec Fiona."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4539
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_0f21242b:

    # ama "She was the communications specialist. But she would have crushed anyone in a fight."
    ama "Elle était la spécialiste des communications. Mais elle aurait écrasé n'importe qui dans un combat."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4540
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_9840f65d:

    # ama "And [eva] and me, you already know us."
    ama "Et [eva] et moi, tu nous connais déjà."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4541
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_68830a2a:

    # mc "What was your specialty?"
    mc "C'était quoi ta spécialité ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4543
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_90632b16:

    # ama "Mine was surveillance, interrogation, and espionage. I broke my leg when I was six and spent a month glued to the monitors."
    ama "La mienne, c'était la surveillance, l'interrogatoire et l'espionnage. Je me suis cassé la jambe quand j'avais six ans et j'ai passé un mois collée aux écrans."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4544
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_1cd31f0d:

    # ama "[eva]'s specialty was... is... infiltration and elimination."
    ama "La spécialité d'[eva] était... est... l'infiltration et l'élimination."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4545
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_9090a1f8:

    # ama "Fiona would have been our sniper."
    ama "Fiona aurait été notre sniper."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4546
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_e178a7a4:

    # ama "But don't get me wrong. Any of us could do everything."
    ama "Mais ne te méprends pas. N'importe laquelle d'entre nous pouvait tout faire."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4548
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_47b70cce:

    # ama "Well... maybe everything except the seduction part. Only Diana and Clarice did that."
    ama "Enfin... peut-être tout sauf la partie séduction. Seules Diana et Clarice faisaient ça."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4549
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_368fcaef:

    # mc "You told me."
    mc "Tu me l'as dit."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4551
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_3c2aed6c:

    # ama "But as for the rest, any of us could use a grenade launcher or comms equipment."
    ama "Mais pour le reste, n'importe laquelle d'entre nous pouvait utiliser un lance-grenades ou du matériel de communication."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4552
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_37eb576e:

    # ama "And, obviously, we could all beat anyone on the base at the shooting range with an M4A1 or a Glock."
    ama "Et, évidemment, on pouvait toutes battre n'importe qui sur la base au stand de tir avec un M4A1 ou un Glock."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4553
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_c90cfebc:

    # ama "And in hand-to-hand combat, we could compete with anyone."
    ama "Et au corps à corps, on pouvait rivaliser avec n'importe qui."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4554
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_1386d5a0:

    # mc "Sounds very strange to me... Specialists, but at the same time generalists."
    mc "Ça me paraît très étrange... Des spécialistes, mais en même temps des généralistes."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4556
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_5eef60ce:

    # ama "You never know what you're going to encounter on a mission. We all had to know how to do everything."
    ama "On ne sait jamais ce qui peut nous arriver lors d'une mission. Nous devions tous savoir tout faire."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4557
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_53f9fb7c:

    # ama "Some of the other operatives are more specialized. The Ds are really good with heavy weapons. They're big guys."
    ama "Certains autres agents sont plus spécialisés. Les D sont vraiment doués avec les armes lourdes. Ce sont de costauds."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4558
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_30a0ae8c:

    # ama "But they'll never be as good as Beatrice was."
    ama "Mais ils ne seront jamais aussi bons que l'était Béatrice."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4559
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_d56b9c53:

    # mc "I get it."
    mc "Je comprends."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4560
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_2280aea1:

    # mc "You said that was the only photo of Fiona. That's weird, right?"
    mc "Tu as dit que c'était la seule photo de Fiona. C'est bizarre, non ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4561
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_37550ed7:

    # mc "I guess there aren't many photos of all of you together either."
    mc "Je suppose qu'il n'y a pas beaucoup de photos de vous tous ensemble non plus."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4566
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_692c7fce:

    # ama "This is the only one there is, as far as I know."
    ama "C'est le seul qui existe, pour autant que je sache."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4567
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_d7520798:

    # ama "Photos are forbidden on the base, except when they want to make a promotional poster. And even then we wear masks."
    ama "Il est interdit de prendre des photos sur la base, sauf lorsqu'il s'agit de réaliser une affiche promotionnelle. Et même dans ce cas-là, nous portons des masques."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4568
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_72786cbc:

    # ama "Nobody wants a photo of 10 G-series clones circulating on the internet. Or a photo of six 6-year-old girls training."
    ama "Personne ne souhaite voir circuler sur Internet une photo de dix clones de la série G. Ni une photo de six fillettes de 6 ans à l'entraînement."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4569
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_8dabad0f:

    # mc "I get it. So much secrecy..."
    mc "Je comprends. Tout ce secrétisme..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4570
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_3c07ff49:

    # mc "I'm glad you showed me these photos. It makes me happy and sad at the same time."
    mc "Je suis content que tu m'aies montré ces photos. Ça me rend à la fois heureux et triste."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4572
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_76b8b592:

    # ama "Fiona's photo was taken by Arnau, one of [aar]'s brothers, with a smuggled camera."
    ama "La photo de Fiona a été prise par Arnau, l'un des frères de [aar], avec un appareil photo de contrebande."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4573
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_dc702d85:

    # ama "Ours was taken by [aar]. They found the camera and took it away."
    ama "La nôtre a été prise par [aar]. Ils ont trouvé l'appareil et l'ont confisqué."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4574
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_f26029ae:

    # ama "That's why I kept them here. It was my secret hiding spot. No one could take them from me here."
    ama "C'est pour ça que je les ai gardées ici. C'était ma cachette secrète. Personne ne pouvait me les prendre ici."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4576
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_191509e1:

    # ama "The last time I was here, I didn't know that I'd never see my sisters alive again."
    ama "La dernière fois que je suis venue ici, je ne savais pas que je ne reverrais jamais mes sœurs en vie."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4577
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_47b414f6:

    # ama "I wish you guys could have met them. And that they could have met you."
    ama "J'aurais aimé que vous puissiez les rencontrer. Et qu'elles puissent vous rencontrer."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4578
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_e8427a0e:

    # "You know she's trying to act tough. The [ama] from back home would probably be crying by now. Coming back to Aruba is changing her."
    "Tu sais qu'elle essaie de faire la dure. La [ama] de la maison serait probablement en train de pleurer à l'heure qu'il est. Revenir à Aruba la change."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4579
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_8908deda:

    # mc "You don't need to hide them anymore. No one is ever going to take those photos from you."
    mc "Tu n'as plus besoin de les cacher. Personne ne te prendra jamais ces photos."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4580
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_844d759b:

    # mc "I'll take care of it if anyone tries."
    mc "Je m'en occuperai si quelqu'un essaie."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4582
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_550cd2ea:

    # ama "Thanks, [mc]. Though I guess now that I own part of the company, no one would dare."
    ama "Merci, [mc]. Même si je suppose que maintenant que je possède une partie de l'entreprise, personne n'oserait."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4583
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_d91cc20f:

    # mc "I guess not."
    mc "J'imagine que non."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4584
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_863c2920:

    # mc "But I don't see anything that would make me call you a psychopath. Having photos of your sisters isn't it."
    mc "Mais je ne vois rien qui me ferait te traiter de psychopathe. Avoir des photos de tes sœurs n'en est pas une preuve."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4586
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_54748aeb:

    # ama "There's something else in the bag."
    ama "Il y a autre chose dans le sac."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4588
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_c60ffa46:

    # "[ama] takes a piece of metal out of the bag and leaves it on her knee. You have no idea what it could be."
    "[ama] sort un morceau de métal du sac et le pose sur son genou. Tu n'as aucune idée de ce que ça peut être."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4589
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_81df295e:

    # ama "It's a piece of shrapnel from the device that killed Fiona."
    ama "C'est un éclat de l'engin qui a tué Fiona."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4590
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_cda67e0f:

    # ama "Each of us kept a piece. I hid mine here and couldn't get it back when we had to leave."
    ama "Chacune de nous en a gardé un morceau. J'ai caché le mien ici et je n'ai pas pu le récupérer quand on a dû partir."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4591
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_8149625e:

    # mc "What's wrong with that?"
    mc "Qu'est-ce qu'il y a de mal à ça ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4593
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_65f7e344:

    # ama "Don't you think it's weird that we kept a piece of the thing that killed our sister?"
    ama "Tu ne trouves pas ça bizarre qu'on ait gardé un morceau du truc qui a tué notre sœur ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4594
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_44e7274b:

    # mc "It's not common, but I've seen mothers wearing a lock of their dead child's hair around their necks and..."
    mc "Ce n'est pas courant, mais j'ai vu des mères porter une mèche de cheveux de leur enfant décédé autour du cou et..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4595
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_49ad248f:

    # mc "Wait... Show me the picture of the five of you again."
    mc "Attends... Montre-moi encore la photo de vous cinq."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4600
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_bd368d65:

    # mc "The heart [eva] always wears around her neck... Is that her piece of the explosive?"
    mc "Le cœur qu'[eva] porte toujours autour du cou... C'est son morceau de l'explosif ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4602
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_22c2d107:

    # ama "Yes. It's the biggest piece. The one that killed her. She shaped it into a heart and made a pendant out of it."
    ama "Oui. C'est le plus gros morceau. Celui qui l'a tuée. Elle lui a donné la forme d'un cœur et en a fait un pendentif."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4603
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_4c4fe98d:

    # ama "That's why she always wears it. It's her way of letting Fiona... see the world she missed out on."
    ama "C'est pour ça qu'elle le porte toujours. C'est sa façon de laisser Fiona... voir le monde à côté duquel elle est passée."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4604
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_655658b1:

    # ama "I know it might sound twisted to anyone other than her sisters, but..."
    ama "Je sais que ça peut paraître tordu pour n'importe qui d'autre que ses sœurs, mais..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4605
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_03aed379:

    # mc "It's not twisted, [ama]. It's a very sweet gesture on [eva]'s part."
    mc "Ce n'est pas tordu, [ama]. C'est un geste très touchant de la part d'[eva]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4607
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_5d8674bc:

    # ama "Don't tell her I told you. Not even that you figured it out yourself."
    ama "Ne lui dis pas que je te l'ai dit. Ni même que tu l'as deviné tout seul."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4608
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_61af9c86:

    # ama "She'd probably kill me and then feel very lonely being the only one alive out of the six of us."
    ama "Elle me tuerait probablement et se sentirait ensuite très seule d'être la seule en vie sur nous six."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4609
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_c77894c6:

    # mc "That would be very typical of [eva]. Don't worry, I won't say anything."
    mc "Ce serait très typique d'[eva]. Ne t'inquiète pas, je ne dirai rien."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4610
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_9122b12e:

    # mc "I asked her about the heart and she told me she'd tell me about it someday. I have to give her the chance to do that when she's ready."
    mc "Je lui ai posé des questions sur le cœur et elle m'a dit qu'elle m'en parlerait un jour. Je dois lui laisser l'occasion de le faire quand elle sera prête."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4613
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_ae79eb17:

    # "[ama] stands up after putting the photos and the fragment back into the bag."
    "[ama] se lève après avoir remis les photos et le fragment dans le sac."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4614
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_ef2df167:

    # "She doesn't put it back in the hiding spot, but instead puts it in one of her pants pockets."
    "Elle ne le remet pas dans la cachette, mais le met plutôt dans l'une des poches de son pantalon."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4615
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_168388e6:

    # ama "And now we should get going. Our hour and a half is almost up. I still have to interview several operatives today."
    ama "Et maintenant, on devrait y aller. Notre heure et demie est presque écoulée. Je dois encore faire passer des entretiens à plusieurs agents aujourd'hui."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4616
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_396d4bef:

    # ama "And [car] won't like it if you're late."
    ama "Et [car] n'aimera pas si tu es en retard."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4617
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_9ec71eb9:

    # mc "Do we have time to do one thing?"
    mc "Est-ce qu'on a le temps de faire une chose ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4618
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_e474bb73:

    # ama "Depends. What do you want to do?"
    ama "Ça dépend. Qu'est-ce que tu veux faire ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4620
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_902b3dcc:

    # "You stand up and hug her. You have no words to express what you feel. Your arms around her body will have to convey the message."
    "Tu te lèves et tu la prends dans tes bras. Tu n'as pas de mots pour exprimer ce que tu ressens. Tes bras autour de son corps devront faire passer le message."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4622
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_95ec8f3f:

    # "For the first time since she took the bag out of the hideout, [ama] lets her feelings flow."
    "Pour la première fois depuis qu'elle a sorti le sac de la planque, [ama] laisse libre cours à ses émotions."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4623
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_d5276be1:

    # "You hate making her cry, but these tears are also part of her healing process."
    "Tu détestes la faire pleurer, mais ces larmes font aussi partie de son processus de guérison."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4624
translate french c31s007_AmaTour_0bb7ae79:

    # "Neither of you cares about being a little late to the next appointment on your schedule."
    "Aucun de vous deux ne se soucie d'être un peu en retard au prochain rendez-vous de votre emploi du temps."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4628
translate french c31s007_surgery_ea02b104:

    # "The rest of the day passes with what seems to be the new normal."
    "Le reste de la journée se passe dans ce qui semble être la nouvelle normalité."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4629
translate french c31s007_surgery_b69f9398:

    # "At least the folders stop piling up on your desk."
    "Au moins, les dossiers arrêtent de s'empiler sur ton bureau."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4631
translate french c31s007_surgery_50007757:

    # "Upon returning to the CEO's House, and after showering, you eat the catering that [car] ordered for dinner."
    "De retour à la Maison du PDG, et après avoir pris une douche, tu manges le repas traiteur que [car] a commandé pour le dîner."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4632
translate french c31s007_surgery_6f280d90:

    # "Once again she nailed it with dishes you like. You have to find out how she does it."
    "Une fois de plus, elle a fait mouche avec des plats que tu aimes. Il faut que tu découvres comment elle fait."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4633
translate french c31s007_surgery_8b9e4664:

    # "[bet] is a little nervous about the next day's surgery."
    "[bet] est un peu nerveuse à propos de l'opération du lendemain."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4634
translate french c31s007_surgery_91b38331:

    # "She has spent the last two days meeting with surgeons and engineers, and rehearsing the surgery."
    "Elle a passé les deux derniers jours à rencontrer des chirurgiens et des ingénieurs, et à répéter l'opération."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4635
translate french c31s007_surgery_f357ce29:

    # "She thinks it'll go well, but it's a surgery that has never been done before. There are too many things that could go wrong."
    "Elle pense que ça va bien se passer, mais c'est une opération qui n'a jamais été faite auparavant. Il y a trop de choses qui pourraient mal tourner."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4637
translate french c31s007_surgery_9117775c:

    # "This time, the two women decide to sleep with you."
    "Cette fois, les deux femmes décident de dormir avec toi."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4638
translate french c31s007_surgery_117c5f6b:

    # "You go to bed early. [gav]'s surgery is scheduled for 10 AM."
    "Tu te couches tôt. L'opération de [gav] est prévue pour 10h."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4639
translate french c31s007_surgery_7ea9f7c2:

    # "The bed is big enough for the three of you."
    "Le lit est assez grand pour vous trois."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4641
translate french c31s007_surgery_66562efc:

    # centered "{size=+20}{b}DAY 41 – SUNDAY{/b}{/size}"
    centered "{size=+20}{b}JOUR 41 – DIMANCHE{/b}{/size}"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4643
translate french c31s007_surgery_6ef2d0b1:

    # "In the morning, [bet] barely touches the freshly baked croissants that [car] sends every morning."
    "Le matin, [bet] touche à peine aux croissants fraîchement sortis du four que [car] envoie tous les matins."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4644
translate french c31s007_surgery_4cc9ee8e:

    # "If you needed any sign of how nervous she is, that's more than enough."
    "Si tu avais besoin d'un signe pour voir à quel point elle est nerveuse, c'est plus que suffisant."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4646
translate french c31s007_surgery_35bcb1b1:

    # "You arrive at your office a little before 8. It feels weird not seeing [car] when you arrive."
    "Tu arrives à ton bureau un peu avant 8h. Ça fait bizarre de ne pas voir [car] en arrivant."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4647
translate french c31s007_surgery_19ad6719:

    # "The folders have disappeared from your desk and a bunch of emails have appeared in your inbox."
    "Les dossiers ont disparu de ton bureau et un tas d'e-mails sont apparus dans ta boîte de réception."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4648
translate french c31s007_surgery_2e8b336a:

    # "There's a coffee waiting for you, which means [lar] is probably already in the building."
    "Un café t'attend, ce qui veut dire que [lar] est probablement déjà dans le bâtiment."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4649
translate french c31s007_surgery_6e2893d5:

    # "You think you're going to love [car]'s efficiency."
    "Tu te dis que tu vas adorer l'efficacité de [car]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4652
translate french c31s007_surgery_f00b0076:

    # "After a few minutes of reading emails..."
    "Après quelques minutes à lire des e-mails..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4653
translate french c31s007_surgery_26e21393:

    # lar "Oops! I didn't know you had arrived already."
    lar "Oups ! Je ne savais pas que vous étiez déjà arrivé."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4654
translate french c31s007_surgery_293e4618:

    # mc "Good morning. I assume you're [lar]. I'm [mc]. Nice to meet you."
    mc "Bonjour. Je suppose que vous êtes [lar]. Je suis [mc]. Ravi de vous rencontrer."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4656
translate french c31s007_surgery_230e9949:

    # lar "Good morning, Mr. Marks. Yes, I'm [lar], your assistant on Sundays and Mondays."
    lar "Bonjour, M. Marks. Oui, je suis [lar], votre assistante les dimanches et lundis."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4657
translate french c31s007_surgery_5f9e6b36:

    # mc "Nice to meet you, [lar]."
    mc "Enchanté, [lar]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4659
translate french c31s007_surgery_f03da9f8:

    # lar "I've filed all the folders that [car] told me to. If you want to check them, they are in..."
    lar "J'ai classé tous les dossiers que [car] m'a dit de faire. Si vous voulez les vérifier, ils sont dans..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4660
translate french c31s007_surgery_892040b7:

    # mc "No need. I saw that [car] sent me emails with the documentation. I doubt I'll need the folders."
    mc "Pas besoin. J'ai vu que [car] m'a envoyé des e-mails avec la documentation. Je doute d'avoir besoin des dossiers."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4661
translate french c31s007_surgery_0f24195a:

    # lar "Perfect, sir."
    lar "Parfait, monsieur."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4663
translate french c31s007_surgery_70cc744a:

    # lar "If you need me, I'll be right outside."
    lar "Si vous avez besoin de moi, je serai juste dehors."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4664
translate french c31s007_surgery_4e5b80f5:

    # mc "Thank you, [lar]."
    mc "Merci, [lar]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4667
translate french c31s007_surgery_63f6a1b1:

    # "As the time for the surgery approaches..."
    "Alors que l'heure de l'opération approche..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4668
translate french c31s007_surgery_c5caecb7:

    # mc "[lar], I'm going to the medical facilities. If anything {b}urgent{/b} comes up, please let me know."
    mc "[lar], je vais aux installations médicales. Si quelque chose d'{b}urgent{/b} se présente, fais-le moi savoir."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4669
translate french c31s007_surgery_54a5742e:

    # lar "I understand, Sir. Only what's truly urgent."
    lar "Je comprends, Monsieur. Seulement ce qui est vraiment urgent."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4670
translate french c31s007_surgery_ac67d23a:

    # mc "Today, the urgent thing is [gav]'s surgery. The rest can wait unless the sky falls on our heads."
    mc "Aujourd'hui, l'urgence c'est l'opération de [gav]. Le reste peut attendre, à moins que le ciel ne nous tombe sur la tête."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4672
translate french c31s007_surgery_306f80db:

    # "[aar] is already there, next to a G you haven't met."
    "[aar] est déjà là, à côté d'un G que vous n'avez pas encore rencontré."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4673
translate french c31s007_surgery_6f5648e0:

    # mc "Good morning, [aar]. Good morning..."
    mc "Bonjour, [aar]. Bonjour..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4674
translate french c31s007_surgery_1fa85298:

    # gid "[gid], Sir. Good morning."
    gid "[gid], Monsieur. Bonjour."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4675
translate french c31s007_surgery_816e2552:

    # aar "Good morning, [mc]."
    aar "Bonjour, [mc]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4676
translate french c31s007_surgery_5434f45c:

    # mc "Is everything going according to plan?"
    mc "Est-ce que tout se passe comme prévu ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4678
translate french c31s007_surgery_c43223f3:

    # aar "For now, yes. [bet] hasn't entered the operating room yet."
    aar "Pour l'instant, oui. [bet] n'est pas encore entrée dans la salle d'opération."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4679
translate french c31s007_surgery_d8e3f095:

    # mc "I imagined it like in the TV shows."
    mc "J'imaginais ça comme dans les séries télé."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4680
translate french c31s007_surgery_d3807f28:

    # mc "I thought we could watch the operation live, from a balcony or something like that."
    mc "Je pensais qu'on pourrait regarder l'opération en direct, depuis un balcon ou un truc du genre."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4681
translate french c31s007_surgery_72f81c55:

    # aar "We've never needed that kind of facility. That operating room is usually used to treat combat wounds."
    aar "On n'a jamais eu besoin de ce genre d'installation. Cette salle d'opération sert généralement à traiter les blessures de combat."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4682
translate french c31s007_surgery_d56b9c53:

    # mc "I get it."
    mc "Je comprends."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4683
translate french c31s007_surgery_f5935eeb:

    # aar "One of [bet]'s assistants will bring us updates from time to time. If there's anything interesting to report."
    aar "Un des assistants de [bet] nous tiendra au courant de temps en temps. S'il y a quelque chose d'intéressant à signaler."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4684
translate french c31s007_surgery_8f535801:

    # gid "If you'll excuse me, I'm going to take my leave. My shift starts in a few minutes."
    gid "Si vous voulez bien m'excuser, je vais vous laisser. Mon service commence dans quelques minutes."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4685
translate french c31s007_surgery_c7e29479:

    # mc "Of course, [gid]." (multiple=2)
    mc "Bien sûr, [gid]." (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4686
translate french c31s007_surgery_c62cdc45:

    # aar "Go ahead, [gid]." (multiple=2)
    aar "Vas-y, [gid]." (multiple=2)

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4687
translate french c31s007_surgery_4a4472e4:

    # "Neither of you knows who he was addressing. It doesn't matter."
    "Aucun de vous ne sait à qui il s'adressait. Ça n'a pas d'importance."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4689
translate french c31s007_surgery_13e94e4b:

    # aar "How is [bet]?"
    aar "Comment va [bet] ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4690
translate french c31s007_surgery_b3f642c9:

    # mc "Nervous. I guess that's what comes with performing a unique surgery."
    mc "Nerveuse. J'imagine que c'est ce qui arrive quand on pratique une opération unique."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4691
translate french c31s007_surgery_34a1e70a:

    # mc "I don't know if I could stay focused the entire time during a six-hour operation."
    mc "Je ne sais pas si je pourrais rester concentré tout le long d'une opération de six heures."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4692
translate french c31s007_surgery_b78f8095:

    # aar "Surgeons are cut from a different cloth. They know what a single slip-up can mean for their patients."
    aar "Les chirurgiens sont faits d'un autre bois. Ils savent ce qu'un seul faux pas peut signifier pour leurs patients."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4694
translate french c31s007_surgery_2a327b37:

    # "To your surprise, [car] appears in the waiting room. She sits in a lone chair."
    "À votre surprise, [car] apparaît dans la salle d'attente. Elle s'assoit sur une chaise isolée."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4696
translate french c31s007_surgery_bdeda2e4:

    # mc "[aar], I'm going to leave you for a moment. I want to talk to [car]."
    mc "[aar], je vais te laisser un moment. Je veux parler à [car]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4697
translate french c31s007_surgery_244012f6:

    # aar "No problem."
    aar "Pas de problème."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4699
translate french c31s007_surgery_9d268e96:

    # mc "Good morning, [car]. I didn't expect to see you here."
    mc "Bonjour, [car]. Je ne m'attendais pas à vous voir ici."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4700
translate french c31s007_surgery_ef4f2a5e:

    # car "I've known [gav]... all these kids... since they were born."
    car "Je connais [gav]... tous ces enfants... depuis leur naissance."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4701
translate french c31s007_surgery_20dbf9c5:

    # car "I don't think I could stay home during the surgery without going crazy."
    car "Je ne pense pas que j'aurais pu rester à la maison pendant l'opération sans devenir folle."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4702
translate french c31s007_surgery_cf9e99c3:

    # car "I didn't expect to see you here either, Sir."
    car "Je ne m'attendais pas non plus à vous voir ici, Monsieur."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4703
translate french c31s007_surgery_33778031:

    # mc "I told you I'd come today."
    mc "Je vous avais dit que je viendrais aujourd'hui."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4705
translate french c31s007_surgery_55552d4e:

    # car "I know. But I thought you'd wait for the results in your office. Mr. Richards and Mr. Daniels..."
    car "Je sais. Mais je pensais que vous attendriez les résultats dans votre bureau. M. Richards et M. Daniels..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4706
translate french c31s007_surgery_43265ac1:

    # mc "I'm neither Richards nor Daniels, [car]. Maybe my way of doing things isn't as efficient, but..."
    mc "Je ne suis ni Richards ni Daniels, [car]. Peut-être que ma façon de faire n'est pas aussi efficace, mais..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4707
translate french c31s007_surgery_90d11605:

    # mc "I care about [gav]'s surgery."
    mc "L'opération de [gav] me tient à cœur."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4709
translate french c31s007_surgery_4e81318d:

    # car "I already told you that you were different, Sir."
    car "Je vous ai déjà dit que vous étiez différent, Monsieur."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4710
translate french c31s007_surgery_d04eb723:

    # mc "And I told you I took it as a compliment."
    mc "Et je vous ai dit que je le prenais comme un compliment."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4711
translate french c31s007_surgery_d9330084:

    # car "In this case, it is."
    car "Dans ce cas, c'en est un."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4713
translate french c31s007_surgery_7b9d0210:

    # "[ama] arrives along with [cal] a few minutes before the surgery starts."
    "[ama] arrive avec [cal] quelques minutes avant que l'opération ne commence."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4715
translate french c31s007_surgery_e8de27bb:

    # "Time, rather than passing, crawls on the clocks the moment the operation begins."
    "Le temps, plutôt que de s'écouler, semble ramper sur les horloges dès que l'opération commence."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4716
translate french c31s007_surgery_44e060b7:

    # "Conversations die down at the same rate."
    "Les conversations s'éteignent au même rythme."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4718
translate french c31s007_surgery_6933e30b:

    # "There is nothing to see in this room. And the door through which the assistant who is supposed to bring news should appear doesn't open."
    "Il n'y a rien à voir dans cette pièce. Et la porte par laquelle l'assistante censée apporter des nouvelles devrait apparaître ne s'ouvre pas."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4720
translate french c31s007_surgery_24355797:

    # "You take it as a good sign. You have blind faith in [bet] as a surgeon."
    "Vous le prenez comme un bon signe. Vous avez une confiance aveugle en [bet] en tant que chirurgienne."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4722
translate french c31s007_surgery_d058b5bd:

    # "Some clones show up from time to time. They take a peek into the room before leaving again."
    "Certains clones apparaissent de temps en temps. Ils jettent un coup d'œil dans la pièce avant de repartir."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4724
translate french c31s007_surgery_18b70d76:

    # "Every time one of them shows up, you get the feeling you're being watched."
    "À chaque fois que l'un d'eux se présente, vous avez l'impression d'être observé."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4726
translate french c31s007_surgery_fde3c3ac:

    # "As if they want to make sure the new CEO is in the room, worrying about how the surgery of one of their own is going."
    "Comme s'ils voulaient s'assurer que le nouveau PDG est bien dans la pièce, à s'inquiéter du déroulement de l'opération de l'une des leurs."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4728
translate french c31s007_surgery_a5f9d4a0:

    # "[mael] shows up towards the end of the operation. He is also interested in knowing how everything is going."
    "[mael] se pointe vers la fin de l'opération. Il veut aussi savoir comment tout se déroule."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4729
translate french c31s007_surgery_2856c1b6:

    # "Although perhaps his reasons are different from yours."
    "Même si ses raisons sont peut-être différentes des tiennes."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4731
translate french c31s007_surgery_8813668f:

    # "Six hours come and go. The damn assistant doesn't show up to give any explanation."
    "Six heures passent. Ce putain d'assistant ne se pointe pas pour donner la moindre explication."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4733
translate french c31s007_surgery_6eef5cfb:

    # "As the seventh hour of the surgery approaches, the door you've all been staring at for an hour finally opens."
    "Alors que la septième heure de l'opération approche, la porte que vous fixez tous depuis une heure s'ouvre enfin."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4734
translate french c31s007_surgery_3d6be1e6:

    # ass "The operation was a success. Everything went as expected. The patient is under observation."
    ass "L'opération est un succès. Tout s'est passé comme prévu. Le patient est en observation."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4736
translate french c31s007_surgery_40ac48e0:

    # "You can see the emotions reflected on the faces of everyone present."
    "Tu peux voir les émotions se refléter sur les visages de toutes les personnes présentes."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4737
translate french c31s007_surgery_662bdd9c:

    # "There is relief, joy, and even a calculating look or two."
    "Il y a du soulagement, de la joie, et même un ou deux regards calculateurs."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4738
translate french c31s007_surgery_eb37aced:

    # "There are even some inquisitive eyes studying your reaction."
    "Il y a même des regards inquisiteurs qui étudient ta réaction."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4740
translate french c31s007_surgery_7c16b76a:

    # "Everyone slowly leaves the room, leaving you alone with [ama]."
    "Tout le monde quitte lentement la pièce, te laissant seul avec [ama]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4742
translate french c31s007_surgery_cb167bc5:

    # ama "Are you going to stay here?"
    ama "Tu vas rester ici ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4743
translate french c31s007_surgery_4a0e9d80:

    # mc "Yes. I want to talk to Aunt [bet] and have her explain how everything went. I know I won't understand half of what she tells me, but..."
    mc "Ouais. Je veux parler à Tante [bet] pour qu'elle m'explique comment tout s'est passé. Je sais que je ne comprendrai pas la moitié de ce qu'elle me dira, mais..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4744
translate french c31s007_surgery_682c1495:

    # ama "I understand. I have to go to my office for a moment, but I'll be back as soon as I can."
    ama "Je comprends. Je dois aller à mon bureau un instant, mais je reviendrai dès que possible."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4745
translate french c31s007_surgery_b44d7909:

    # mc "More interviews?"
    mc "Encore des entretiens ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4747
translate french c31s007_surgery_b0f46c42:

    # ama "No. Nobody wanted to do an interview today. Everyone would be thinking about the surgery."
    ama "Non. Personne ne voulait faire d'entretien aujourd'hui. Tout le monde penserait à l'opération."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4748
translate french c31s007_surgery_f25da4af:

    # ama "Most people like [gav]."
    ama "La plupart des gens aiment bien [gav]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4749
translate french c31s007_surgery_1d39dbd0:

    # ama "I just have to check the guard shift changes."
    ama "Je dois juste vérifier les changements de service des gardes."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4750
translate french c31s007_surgery_1da6a712:

    # mc "I get it. See you later."
    mc "Je comprends. À plus tard."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4752
translate french c31s007_surgery_11598801:

    # "You're left alone in the waiting room. There's nothing to see and no new news."
    "Vous vous retrouvez seul dans la salle d'attente. Il n'y a rien à voir et aucune nouvelle."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4753
translate french c31s007_surgery_df85b949:

    # "Just waiting for Aunt [bet]. You spend a few minutes staring at the door."
    "Vous attendez juste tante [bet]. Vous passez quelques minutes à fixer la porte."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4756
translate french c31s007_surgery_d45f3ced:

    # "She appears fifteen minutes later. Time has gone back to moving at its usual speed."
    "Elle apparaît quinze minutes plus tard. Le temps a repris son cours normal."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4757
translate french c31s007_surgery_2d81eaa5:

    # bet "I didn't expect anyone to still be here. I just came for a coffee."
    bet "Je ne m'attendais pas à ce qu'il y ait encore quelqu'un ici. Je suis juste venue prendre un café."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4758
translate french c31s007_surgery_be261e8b:

    # mc "Everything okay with the surgery?"
    mc "Tout se passe bien pour l'opération ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4760
translate french c31s007_surgery_c9b11614:

    # bet "Everything's perfect. Even better than perfect. The rest of the surgeons are very good at what they do."
    bet "Tout est parfait. Même mieux que parfait. Le reste des chirurgiens sont très doués dans ce qu'ils font."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4761
translate french c31s007_surgery_f27c6efb:

    # bet "The kid is going to recover from the surgery sooner than I expected."
    bet "Le gamin va se remettre de l'opération plus tôt que je ne l'espérais."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4762
translate french c31s007_surgery_7762f78f:

    # mc "That's good. How did everything go? What's the next step?"
    mc "C'est une bonne nouvelle. Comment ça s'est passé ? C'est quoi la prochaine étape ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4764
translate french c31s007_surgery_12e96dec:

    # "She explains how the surgery went. As you imagined, you don't understand even a quarter of what she's explaining."
    "Elle explique comment l'opération s'est déroulée. Comme tu l'imaginais, tu ne comprends même pas le quart de ce qu'elle raconte."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4765
translate french c31s007_surgery_5569ce06:

    # bet "We'll keep [gav] under observation for a few days. We don't want the wound to get infected."
    bet "On va garder [gav] en observation pendant quelques jours. On ne veut pas que la plaie s'infecte."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4766
translate french c31s007_surgery_6ff9db01:

    # bet "With a little luck, we'll be able to turn on the arm in a week and see how he reacts."
    bet "Avec un peu de chance, on pourra activer le bras dans une semaine et voir comment il réagit."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4767
translate french c31s007_surgery_d3e1e5ee:

    # mc "Will I be able to be there when you do it?"
    mc "Est-ce que je pourrai être là quand vous le ferez ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4769
translate french c31s007_surgery_d68d4772:

    # bet "I hadn't thought about it, but I think it's a good idea for you to be there when we do it."
    bet "Je n'y avais pas pensé, mais je pense que c'est une bonne idée que tu sois là quand on le fera."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4770
translate french c31s007_surgery_2eddb174:

    # bet "The fact that you're the last one left here shows how much you care about this."
    bet "Le fait que tu sois le dernier resté ici montre à quel point tu tiens à ça."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4771
translate french c31s007_surgery_fa39a046:

    # bet "Someone is probably talking about it right now around the base."
    bet "Quelqu'un en parle probablement en ce moment même sur la base."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4772
translate french c31s007_surgery_43bd1d06:

    # mc "I don't really care about that right now."
    mc "Je m'en fous un peu de ça pour l'instant."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4773
translate french c31s007_surgery_875b4e55:

    # mc "How are you doing?"
    mc "Comment tu vas ?"

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4775
translate french c31s007_surgery_a860f15f:

    # bet "Exhausted. But very happy. There was a moment when I thought we wouldn't make it."
    bet "Épuisée. Mais très heureuse. Il y a eu un moment où j'ai cru qu'on n'y arriverait pas."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4776
translate french c31s007_surgery_dae02f71:

    # bet "But everything turned out fine in the end."
    bet "Mais tout s'est bien terminé finalement."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4777
translate french c31s007_surgery_b77a74c6:

    # bet "Now I just want to take a shower. I can still feel the sweat running down my back."
    bet "Maintenant, je veux juste prendre une douche. Je sens encore la sueur couler dans mon dos."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4778
translate french c31s007_surgery_b5bc5456:

    # mc "Then I won't keep you any longer. I'll see you later so we can go home."
    mc "Alors je ne te retiens pas plus longtemps. On se voit plus tard pour rentrer à la maison."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4780
translate french c31s007_surgery_3a86df9c:

    # bet "I'm not going home. I want to stay here for the night in case there are any complications."
    bet "Je ne rentre pas. Je veux rester ici pour la nuit au cas où il y aurait des complications."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4781
translate french c31s007_surgery_9ff6f9b6:

    # mc "But you're exhausted..."
    mc "Mais tu es épuisée..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4782
translate french c31s007_surgery_d99a2dda:

    # bet "The rest of the surgeons are just as exhausted as I am. But it's my surgery."
    bet "Les autres chirurgiens sont tout aussi épuisés que moi. Mais c'est mon opération."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4784
translate french c31s007_surgery_59c27817:

    # mc "Thanks for everything, Aunt [bet]."
    mc "Merci pour tout, Tante [bet]."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4785
translate french c31s007_surgery_dafd98c2:

    # bet "Thank you for giving me the chance to help the boy."
    bet "Merci de m'avoir donné la chance d'aider ce garçon."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4787
translate french c31s007_surgery_5eedca3f:

    # "You go back to your office and give the news to [lar]. Obviously, she already knew."
    "Tu retournes à ton bureau et annonces la nouvelle à [lar]. Évidemment, elle le savait déjà."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4789
translate french c31s007_surgery_cb4e7a9f:

    # "You sit behind your desk and stare at the walls for a while."
    "Tu t'assois derrière ton bureau et fixes les murs pendant un moment."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4790
translate french c31s007_surgery_a849c7e5:

    # "Now the waiting game begins."
    "Maintenant, le jeu de l'attente commence."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4795
translate french c31s007_ama_5e64d07e:

    # "After about 40 minutes..."
    "Après environ 40 minutes..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4796
translate french c31s007_ama_56411a58:

    # ama "I just talked to Aunt [bet]. She explained everything about the surgery."
    ama "Je viens de parler à tante [bet]. Elle m'a tout expliqué sur l'opération."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4797
translate french c31s007_ama_3df02708:

    # ama "It's great that everything went so well."
    ama "C'est génial que tout se soit si bien passé."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4798
translate french c31s007_ama_6580b0cb:

    # mc "Absolutely. [gav] deserves it, and [eva] doesn't deserve to carry that guilt."
    mc "Absolument. [gav] le mérite, et [eva] ne mérite pas de porter cette culpabilité."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4799
translate french c31s007_ama_29adea49:

    # ama "[eva] is going to be very happy."
    ama "[eva] va être très heureuse."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4802
translate french c31s007_ama_d527c7c8:

    # ama "Aunt [bet] told me she's going to spend the night at the medical facilities..."
    ama "Tante [bet] m'a dit qu'elle allait passer la nuit au centre médical..."

# game/scripts/c31/c31.rpy:4803
translate french c31s007_ama_5f57d6d8:

    # ama "Do you want to go out for dinner in Oranjestad? You haven't had the chance to visit it yet..."
